(2313058, 605001, 'The Ocean Rises', '海洋上升的隐喻中，诉说失去与悲伤的金属摇滚。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=631005&width=300&trackid=2313058', '[00:31.42]The shore was so dry\n[00:36.08]The sand needed some water\n[00:38.26]We could hear it cry\n[00:43.76]Like a dying flower\n[00:43.77]Could you look away (away!)\n[00:43.78]The waves are crying (crying!)\n[00:44.44]Slowly making their way (away!)\n[00:44.45]The ocean is rising (rising!)\n[00:44.46]When the ocean rises\n[00:44.47]Deep in our hearts, the pain dies (dies dies dies)\n[00:50.68]Far away from here\n[01:02.04]The truth is like a spear\n[01:08.70]It\'s been so cold now\n[01:12.92]As the wind is blowing\n[01:17.18]And the earth is just a hollow\n[01:22.28]A coffin for the dying\n', '/stream/2313058'),
