(2302087, 597553, 'Love Of A Woman', '酒鬼因女人的爱而获救，忧郁民谣。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=625719&width=300&trackid=2302087', '[00:00.22]Love Of A Woman\n[00:00.23]Well, I’ve been to heaven and I’ve been to hell\n[00:03.40]But which was which? Well, I never could tell\n[00:06.34]Been beaten by life and kicked as I fell\n[00:09.28]It was the love of a woman that saved me\n[00:12.18]It was the love of a woman that saved me.\n[00:17.34]Been thrown in the gutter and thrown up to the sky\n[00:20.52]Been saved for salvation but knew it a lie\n[00:23.80]Been so forsaken even statues might cry\n[00:26.94]It was the love of a woman that saved me\n[00:29.42]It was the love of a woman that saved me.\n[00:34.74]What made Jack Daniels famous made a loser out of me\n[00:41.00]What gave the south its comfort brought me only misery\n[00:47.38]There was no such thing as drinking responsibly\n[00:53.54]It was the love of a decent woman that finally set me free.\n[01:00.38]Guzzled red wine like a pig at a trough\n[01:02.68]No matter how much it was never enough\n[01:06.18]My liver surrendered but I called its bluff\n[01:09.24]It was the love of a woman that saved me\n[01:12.60]It’s was the love of a woman that saved me.\n[01:15.80]Chorus\n[01:16.14]What shall we do with the drunken sailor, what shall we do with the drunken sailor?\n[01:22.06]What shall we do with the drunken sailor, earl-aye in the morning?\n[01:28.66]Sail away down the High Street, sail away down the High Street\n[01:35.02]Sail away down the High Street, until you drown your dreams.\n[01:56.98]What made Jack Daniels famous made a loser out of me\n[02:03.04]What gave the south its comfort brought me only misery\n[02:08.12]There was no such thing as drinking responsibly\n[02:15.76]It was the love of a decent woman that finally set me free.\n[02:21.96]Instrumental.\n[02:22.62]The woman stood by me she wouldn’t let me hide\n[02:23.82]For the way I was drinking was a slow suicide\n[02:25.54]She gave me back my soul, my future, my pride\n[02:26.00]It was the love of a woman that saved me\n[02:59.32]It was the love of a woman that saved me\n[03:03.04]It was the love of a woman that saved me.\n', '/stream/2302087'),
