(1504130, 374892, 'Follow Up [Radio Edit]', '在人生延迟中重拾计划A，寻求救赎与新路。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=173174&width=300&trackid=1504130', '[00:20.96]Follow Up\n[00:24.46]2013 © Scored Records \\ Scored Media\n[00:24.47]Written By Gregor Anderson\n[00:24.48]See me and my friends\n[00:27.00]had a plan for this life\n[00:32.40]but then it all changed\n[00:39.24]through others delays\n[00:46.00]do we have to store up all our hope for the next life?\n[00:57.50]or can we follow up plan A again?\n[01:05.70]A second way\n[01:09.50]Within the threshold of plan A\n[01:15.26]A second way\n[01:19.72]A  second way\n[01:30.32]I am redeemed but the body feels chained to this life\n[01:40.62]I know I’m redeemed but My body feels chained to this life\n[01:48.02]Come with me my friends\n[01:53.28]Come with me to new days\n[02:01.02]Come with me to new ways\n[02:05.54]Over the threshold of delays\n[02:12.10]Come with me my friends\n[02:15.48]Come with me to new days\n[02:21.36]Just for me it’s the only way\n[02:25.66]Just for me it’s the only way\n', '/stream/1504130'),
(1895179, 522217, 'Runaway', '鼓励挣脱束缚，携手奔向自由之夜。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=459916&width=300&trackid=1895179', '[00:27.03]I\'m not gonna let you give it up\n[00:32.02]Your motivation\'s through the roof\n[00:36.84]Please tell me why do you feel so low\n[00:41.60]Are you ready for this?\n[00:44.68]We will try our best\n[00:47.07]To get off our chest\n[00:49.42]What\'s inside\n[00:51.83]Our Broken mind\n[00:54.22]Leave it all behind\n[00:56.61]Don\'t you waste your time\n[00:59.09]Now you know\n[01:01.41]We can go\n[01:03.83]Can you take me to your world\n[01:07.47]And we\'ll runaway\n[01:09.85]And we\'ll runaway\n[01:13.42]We won\'t stop until we\'re lost\n[01:17.02]And we\'ll runaway\n[01:19.48]And we\'ll runaway\n[01:22.49]Into the night\n[01:27.30]Into the night\n[01:34.53]The scars are real and so damn deep\n[01:39.56]Long lost friends to remind you\n[01:44.06]No matter what are the consequences\n[01:48.99]You made it this far\n[01:51.82]Please believe in you\n[01:54.18]It\'s time to make this true\n[01:56.68]Don\'t forget but forgive\n[02:01.46]Can you take me to your world\n[02:05.13]And we\'ll runaway\n[02:07.53]And we\'ll runaway\n[02:10.95]We won\'t stop until we\'re lost\n[02:14.67]And we\'ll runaway\n[02:17.05]And we\'ll runaway\n[02:20.19]Into the night\n[02:24.88]Into the night\n[02:29.64]Into the night\n[02:34.46]Into the night\n[02:39.20]Into the night\n', '/stream/1895179'),
(341, 16, 'Mastodonte', '以大象视角控诉盗猎，呼唤自由与保护。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=43&width=300&trackid=341', '[00:16.80]Ils courent vers l\'eau,\n[00:16.92]La terre tremble,\n[00:52.40]Les grands mâles devant,\n[00:56.90]Les défenses en avant.\n[01:00.50]Si les os d\'homme\n[01:01.86]Valaient l\'ivoire et la viande,\n[01:05.96]Que serait l\'homme au zoo ?\n[01:12.94]Les pieds devant.\n[01:15.58]Ils accourent de loin,\n[01:16.72]De l\'immensité sans fin,\n[01:16.73]Avec les elfes et le vent,\n[01:32.20]Les éléphants.\n[01:59.08]Les ailes de la liberté,\n[01:59.09]Plombées à mort, tailladées,\n[01:59.10]Découpées, décimées,\n[01:59.11]Massacrées, arrachées.\n[01:59.18]Les trophées de la haine,\n[01:59.19]L\'absence de protection,\n[01:59.20]La mort de l\'homme\n[01:59.21]Quand sa cible tombe.\n[02:19.56]Ils accourent de loin,\n[02:19.82]De l\'immensité sans fin,\n[02:19.83]Avec les elfes et le vent,\n[02:19.84]Les éléphants.\n[02:19.85]Les derniers nous supplient :\n[02:19.86]“Protégez-nous ! Vivez mais\n[02:19.87]Laissez-nous courir et hurler.”\n[02:32.44]Les éléphants.\n[02:33.24]Les elfes et le vent.\n[02:35.26]Libres, fiers et sauvages,\n[02:43.86]Les éléphants.\n[02:45.58]Ils accourent de loin,\n[02:46.80]De l\'immensité sans fin,\n[03:01.52]Avec les elfes et le vent,\n[03:52.28]Les éléphants.\n', '/stream/341'),
