.16]But she like my Memphis pimping\n[01:27.62]Beale Street blue baby\n[01:29.28]Ima true grizzly\n', '/stream/2343127'),
(1571640, 437402, 'Lettre á Mathilde (feat Bluemillenium, Martijn De Boer, Doxent Zsigmond)', '法语呢喃吟唱，诉说对玛蒂尔德逝去的哀伤与思念。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=178908&width=300&trackid=1571640', '[00:01.70]Je ne la reverrais plus\n[00:09.31]Mathilde est partit.\n[00:14.39]Son jardin restera vide.\n[00:20.45]Elle ne me dira plus …Bonjour\n[00:47.30]La chatelaine ne rentrerar plus\n[00:51.68]Le poele de faience restera glacé.\n[00:57.20]Oh Mathilde\n[01:00.76]je pleure dans la chapelle,\n[01:03.60]Je prie pour ton retour\n[01:05.88]Mathilde…\n[01:09.82]Reviens chez toi\n[01:10.80]Tombé dans l’abîme,\n[01:22.78]noyé au fond du puit\n[01:27.54]Je revois le visage de ma princesse\n[01:33.16]Où est tu ?\n[01:35.60]Que fais tu ?\n[01:41.58]Reviendras tu un jour?\n[01:45.82]Peut être, je l’espère\n[01:49.84]Nous avons des choses à faire\n[01:54.10]Des choses à vivre\n[01:56.80]Demain , l’horizon sera le tient, sera le nôtre.\n', '/stream/1571640'),
(1247352, 4819, 'Talk Samba (Parliamo un pò)', '意语爵士波萨诺瓦，低语爱情里的犹豫与温柔。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=149433&width=300&trackid=1247352', '[00:31.76]Quando Ritorni mi sembra inverno\n[00:34.88]Il sole basso, il mio sguardo perso\n[00:39.52]Un saluto e un bacio lieve come seta\n[00:45.78]Dimmi che penso\n[00:49.48]Attento!\n[00:53.76]Se sbagli le parole non potrai recuperare più….\n[00:59.20]Se penso alla forza che ci vuole per amarsi\n[01:07.54]Forse l’ho perduta e non lo so\n[01:15.42]Pure non ci riesce di fuggire o abbandonarci\n[01:22.34]Se mi sforzo un poco in fondo ti amo ancora un po’ ….\n[01:28.08]Il sole dopo un inverno grigio\n[01:32.02]Il tuo sorriso dopo un litigio\n[01:35.86]Dammi il tempo di capire tu chi sei\n[01:42.16]Non so che sento\n[01:45.58]E mi tormento\n[01:50.36]In fondo sono questa. Lo capisci, non ti basta? Lascia stare, non pensarci più\n[01:56.76]Quello che mi manca non mi riesce di spiegarlo\n[02:00.50]Prendimi la mano e vedi un pò\n[02:00.51]Se il freddo che sento riesci solo a allontanarlo\n[02:54.90]Tienimi vicino stretta stretta accanto a te…\n[02:55.64]Dai resta qui che parliamo ancora\n[02:55.65]Il mondo aspetta e poi guarda l’ora\n[02:55.66]È già tardi per uscire stai con me\n[02:55.67]a perder tempo\n[02:55.68]Guardarci dentro\n[02:55.69]Che forse a guardar bene tanto male non lo siamo anzi mi piaci e non ti lascio più\n', '/stream/1247352'),
(2260818, 540327, 'Tropic Daze', '热带浩室电子曲，夏日放松氛围，人声简短致谢。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=606634&width=300&trackid=2260818', '[00:30.34]Bye.\n[01:15.44]Thank you.\n[01:40.24]Thank you.\n[02:02.18]Thank you.\n', '/stream/2260818'),
(1492690, 504420, 'I.D.G.A.F.A.Y', '一首愤怒励志的说唱，鼓励人们无视质疑，勇敢做自己。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=237437&width=300&trackid=1492690', '[00:12.42]Greta Reign - I.D.G.A.F.A.Y Lyrics\n[00:12.52]Intro:\n[00:12.53]Hey what\'sup allow me to introduce myself to people in this world who might feel lost and need a little helpcoz I, can be, the courage that you need and help you to a place to realise that you can succeed hey.\n[00:23.88]Verse 1:\n[00:23.98]Should you pay attention focus on what your life means Hah, or listen to the haters as they come for you or me Nah, no one really knows what their future might bring so instead they listen to alarm bells hear them ring-a-ling hey.\n[00:36.00]Verse Hook:\n[00:36.10]People they go crazy it happens on the daily, no one there that really cares didn\'t stop to ask who, what, why, where, so make your calm get wavy ride it out on your own tide, throw your 2 fingers up at the world coz this right here your time.\n[00:48.04]Verse 1 (Continued):\n[00:48.98]If you stop to realise that some people maybe in your life, can be the ones who drag you down only hit you up if they need your time, so tick tick tick tick tock put them bitches on the clock and if you don\'t believe in second chances fuck them they can get blocked blocked.\n[01:00.12]Every single day I contemplate the same question, should I let what others say affect me with aggression, depression is here in the world so don\'t ever think that you are weak I wanna see you seek the help you need.\n[01:12.00]Bridge:\n[01:12.01]Cooking up a brand new remedy.\n[01:15.22]Sprinkle extra for the enemy.\n[01:18.94]Exterminating all the jealousy.\n[01:22.02]Shake deficiency like tetany.\n[01:25.46]Chorus:\n[01:26.22]Fuck you bitches make it simple.\n[01:30.04]I.D.G. A.F.A.Y (x2) I don\'t give a fuck about you and I wrote this song to tell you why.\n[01:35.96]Verse 2:\n[01:36.04]For too long in my own life I\'ve sat and watched time pass me by, as it faded away, eroded away, didn\'t know back then to draw a line, on the mother fuckers dragging me down every day, should I stay, don\'t wanna leave, is there any other way.\n[01:47.70]Verse 2 (Continued):\n[01:56.78]These words are mine saying I despise you most coz you shut me out of everything I wanna bang bang bang on all your doors, \'n\' pick up a sledgehammer take it to the walls, destroy everything I see and then you might just hear my cause.\n[02:11.98]So he he hello, better pick up when I call.\n[02:14.76]Watch out below it\'s so long for you to fall.\n[02:17.82]All the way down where my temper gets the best of me, you\'ll never see the rest of me, not welcome on my destiny.\n[02:25.08]Verse 3:\n[02:44.88]If you wanna eat a slice go bake up your own cake, add some elbow grease in every piece then serve onto your plate, all the blood, sweat and tears that it took to make it rise, do your best to keep it safe away from all the prying eyes.\n[02:59.78][Bridge (x2)\n[04:24.71]End\n', '/stream/1492690'),
(850288, 358532, 'Anansi', '一首宁静浪漫的器乐流行曲，适合放松聆听。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=99342&width=300&trackid=850288', '', '/stream/850288'),
(1932813, 209, 'Bread and Roses', '女性劳工争取面包与玫瑰的民谣颂歌。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=477355&width=300&trackid=1932813', '[00:03.20]As we come marching, marching, in the beauty of the day,\n[00:07.24]A million darkened kitchens, a thousand mill-lofts gray\n[00:10.68]Are touched with all the radiance that a sudden sun discloses,\n[00:15.18]For the people hear us singing, "Bread and Roses, Bread and Roses."\n[00:53.18]As we come marching, marching, we battle, too, for men—\n[01:02.04]For they are women\'s children and we mother them again.\n[01:08.90]Our lives shall not be sweated from birth until life closes—\n[01:12.46]Hearts starve as well as bodies: Give us Bread, but give us Roses.\n[01:19.24]As we come marching, marching, unnumbered women dead\n[01:20.36]Go crying through our singing their ancient cry for Bread;\n[01:20.37]Small art and love and beauty their trudging spirits knew—\n[01:29.74]Yes, it is Bread we fight for—but we fight for Roses, too.\n[01:46.36]As we come marching, marching, we bring the Greater Days—\n[01:55.04]The rising of the women means the rising of the race.\n[02:01.62]No more the drudge and idler—ten that toil where one reposes—\n[02:06.66]But a sharing of life\'s glories: Bread and Roses, Bread and Roses.\n', '/stream/1932813'),
(2306959, 588550, 'The Dollar Man', '民谣吟唱对冷漠世界的反思，呼唤温柔与和平。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=628120&width=300&trackid=2306959', '[00:16.93]My\n[00:21.48]people long for such simple things\n[00:25.72]but\n[00:26.98]you have gone and fucked it up\n[00:30.78]Our mother\'s hands bleed the blood of our family\n[00:36.40]and she will give until she\'s gone\n[00:41.88]Where did your heart go?\n[00:44.38]Or has it just grown cold\n[00:47.68]from the fear that you\'re alone?\n[00:53.10]Won\'t wait you brother\n[00:54.60]though\n[00:55.66]you do live loveless I will always watch for your return Oh,\n[01:03.02]pay the dollar man with every lesson that you have\n[01:08.86]Tell em from me there\'s no way to buy peace\n[01:14.12]Show those machine men with no love in us how we have grown holy\n[01:35.20]Make love till peace time delight in clear\n[01:38.98]skies Plain seas you won\'t lift a soul\n[01:45.82]Dance till your legs shake Hope till your\n[01:49.28]heart breaks and Make a nod of letting go\n[01:54.60]Oh,\n[01:55.36]wrestle with daybreak Laugh till your stomach aches\n[02:02.04]Drink to all your loved ones help Follow your souls crying\n[02:08.58]As this life goes by oh Learn to be gentle with yourself\n[02:17.48]Pay the dollar man with every lesson that you have\n[02:24.60]Tell em from me there\'s no way to buy peace Show those\n[02:28.46]machine men with no love in us how we have grown holy\n[02:36.48]So we dance beneath the stars\n[02:55.50]Thanks for watching!\n', '/stream/2306959'),
(2264039, 515591, 'Tears', '失落的灵魂在黑夜中渴求一丝光亮，泪水与孤独交织。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=608214&width=300&trackid=2264039', '[00:19.78]Dispair has become my friend\n[00:22.78]It seems my life is a circle with no end\n[00:28.36]I’m lost to everyone around\n[00:32.54]I’m slowly disappearing and losing my ground\n[00:40.04]I’m empty inside\n[00:41.04]I need a piece of your light.\n[00:41.05]I’m losing my mind.\n[00:43.90]I’m a child of tears of the night\n[00:46.56]When the sun goes down\n[00:46.57]My thoughts are covered by the dark clouds\n[00:46.58]Afraid to be lost there again\n[00:46.59]And to stay forever in that nightmare realm\n[00:46.60]I’m empty inside\n[00:48.56]I need a piece of your light.\n[00:54.32]I’m losing my mind.\n[00:58.14]I’m a child of tears of the night\n[01:02.38]I’m lost to everyone around\n[01:07.36]I’m disappearing and losing my ground\n[01:29.46]I’m empty inside\n[01:33.66]I need a piece of your light.\n[01:37.94]I’m losing my mind.\n[01:42.30]I’m a child of tears of the night\n', '/stream/2264039'),
(1614541, 499377, 'Ritueller Missbrauch', '德语说唱揭露黑暗阴谋，氛围压抑愤怒。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=342797&width=300&trackid=1614541', '[00:20.76]Jeden Tag verschwinden Kinder,\n[00:21.92]für die Täter sind sie Vieh.\n[00:23.30]Wirtschaft,\n[00:23.88]Politik,\n[00:24.40]die Männer warten schon auf sie.\n[00:26.04]Dunkle Orden im Geheim,\n[00:27.10]global vernetzt und vereint.\n[00:28.62]Im Geheim treffen sie sich seit Babyloner Zeit,\n[00:31.20]nennen sie Illuminaten,\n[00:32.16]Satanisten,\n[00:33.20]alle gleich.\n[00:33.76]Ihre Orden sind weltweit bedient,\n[00:35.32]ermächtigt und reich.\n[00:36.52]Wirtschaft,\n[00:37.02]Politik,\n[00:37.50]viele in Führungspositionen,\n[00:39.10]keine Juden oder Christen,\n[00:40.50]Satanisten tun nur so.\n[00:41.62]Sie sind anders wie wir,\n[00:42.98]empathielos und kaltlieblos,\n[00:44.98]süchtig nach Zerstörung und Gewalt.\n[00:46.92]Sie gebären Kinder, um sie rituell zu opfern.\n[00:49.58]Keine Schule oder Freunde,\n[00:50.74]konditioniert als ihre Opfer.\n[00:52.44]Männer in Rom mit Massen,\n[00:53.76]Dursten nach Blut,\n[00:54.72]Pentagramm,\n[00:55.44]20 Mann in der Mitte,\n[00:56.76]ihr Tripp.\n[00:57.16]Ein kleines Baby,\n[00:58.23]unschuldig und rein,\n[00:59.18]es weint und schreit,\n[01:00.08]vergewaltigt,\n[01:00.92]gefoltert im Kreis ihrer Reihen.\n[01:02.78]Das Böse nährt sich von unserer Angst unterm Leib.\n[01:05.18]Die Hölle ist hier, wir leben in der Dunkelheit.\n[01:07.96]Kleine Kinder werden einfach geführt aus ihrem Heim,\n[01:10.40]wenn sie nicht geboren wurden,\n[01:11.80]um ein Opfer zu sein.\n[01:13.32]Das Böse nährt sich von unserer Angst unterm Leib.\n[01:15.72]Die Hölle ist hier, wir leben in der Dunkelheit.\n[01:18.46]Kleine Kinder werden einfach geführt aus ihrem Heim,\n[01:20.88]wenn sie nicht geboren wurden,\n[01:22.26]um ein Opfer zu sein.\n[01:23.66]Eingesperrt im dunklen Raum,\n[01:25.02]gefesselt und allein,\n[01:26.22]jeden Tag verschwinden Kinder.\n[01:27.70]Gehören sie nicht mal schreien in den Händen der verfliehenen Elite.\n[01:30.84]Opfern sie ihr Leben,\n[01:32.12]der ringt mir nach Blut,\n[01:33.14]kostet im Millionenleben.\n[01:34.58]Satanist gibt es schon seit Anbeginn der Zeit.\n[01:36.72]Viele Geheimgesellschaften, wenige eingeweiht.\n[01:39.48]Den Kern des Satanismus,\n[01:40.88]die Götter alter Schriften.\n[01:42.42]Woll aus Kinderopfer,\n[01:43.46]die Macht durch Superlisten.\n[01:45.04]Belgier in Südfroh, über 20 Zeugen pro.\n[01:47.28]Ihre Macht ist groß und steht über dem Gerichtshof.\n[01:49.86]Mach die Augen auf,\n[01:50.82]Bruder,\n[01:51.14]überall,\n[01:51.80]auch Kult ist in Polix.\n[01:53.40]Damit geholt ihr.\n[01:54.88]Sie kontrollieren die Medien,\n[01:56.26]überall böses Sand ist.\n[01:57.98]Der Spiegel lobt den Dreck von Marina Abramowitsch.\n[02:00.82]Die Industrie nennt den Dreck Spiritwood.\n[02:02.96]Kannibalismus, Propaganda, gehen nach Blut.\n[02:05.70]Hollywood ist Satanismus, perverse Industrie.\n[02:08.30]Kinderstars,\n[02:08.88]Witze,\n[02:09.24]Geld,\n[02:09.70]Hauptsitz der Pädophilen.\n[02:10.88]Sie ernähren sich von Angst,\n[02:12.28]Medien schaffen diese Klima.\n[02:13.54]Heucheln,\n[02:13.80]Friede und Liebe,\n[02:14.76]all das,\n[02:15.36]was sie übernommen.\n[02:16.16]Das Böse nährt sich von unserer Angst unterm Leib.\n[02:18.92]Die Hölle ist hier, wir leben in der Dunkelheit.\n[02:21.42]Kleine Kinder werden einfach geführt aus ihrem Heim,\n[02:23.84]wenn sie nicht geboren wurden,\n[02:25.26]um ein Opfer zu sein.\n[02:26.72]Das Böse nährt sich von unserer Angst unterm Leib.\n[02:29.32]Die Hölle ist hier, wir leben in der Dunkelheit.\n[02:31.92]Kleine Kinder werden einfach geführt aus ihrem Heim,\n[02:34.46]wenn sie nicht geboren wurden,\n[02:35.70]um ein Opfer zu sein.\n[02:37.14]Ignoranz hält sie am Leben unserer Gleichgültigkeit.\n[02:39.86]Das Schlechte um sie rum lässt sie alle völlig kalt.\n[02:42.40]Angezogen von der Dunkelheit,\n[02:43.86]abgestumpft und ignorant,\n[02:45.24]leugnen sie das Böse.\n[02:46.78]Es liegt in Gottes Hand,\n[02:47.78]Musikstars wie Kiescher pulsieren vor dem Pentagramm.\n[02:50.66]Wir singen den Teufel,\n[02:52.26]dahinter steckt Programm.\n[02:53.12]Schau dir Lady Gaga, Miley Cyrus mal genauer an.\n[02:55.78]Das ist keine Musik und verdirbt unseren Verstand.\n[02:58.20]Das große Ganze können oder wollen sie nicht verstehen.\n[03:00.78]Satanismus überall, er prägt unser Leben.\n[03:03.34]Die meist unterschätzte Religion weit und breit.\n[03:06.10]Früher oft praktiziert,\n[03:07.30]heute nur noch im Geheim.\n[03:11.42]Mach die Augen auf, Bruder.\n[03:14.56]Überall okkulte Symbole.\n[03:16.28]Überall Satanismus-Propaganda.\n[03:18.70]Wach endlich auf, Bruder.\n[03:20.34]Kinder sterben jeden Tag,\n[03:21.40]werden rituell missbraucht,\n[03:23.20]rituell getötet.\n[03:25.14]Das ist kein Spiel,\n[03:25.94]das ist kein Spaß,\n[03:26.76]das ist Realität.\n[03:27.52]Mach auf.\n[03:29.68]Das Böse nährt sich von unserer Angst und am Leid.\n[03:32.36]Die Hölle ist hier, wir leben in der Dunkelheit.\n[03:34.86]Kleine Kinder werden einfach geführt aus ihrem Heim,\n[03:37.30]wenn sie nicht geboren wurden,\n[03:38.72]um ein Opfer zu sein.\n[03:40.22]Das Böse nährt sich von unserer Angst und am Leid.\n[03:42.78]Die Hölle ist hier, wir leben in der Dunkelheit.\n', '/stream/1614541'),
(1939137, 560, 'Enter The Metaverse (With Choir)', '合唱与配乐交织，营造进入元宇宙的史诗感。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=479972&width=300&trackid=1939137', '[00:03.00]Thank you.\n[00:40.96]Thank you.\n[01:11.58]Thank you.\n[01:34.88]Thank you.\n[02:00.34]Thank you.\n[02:36.30]Thank you.\n[03:00.66]Thank you.\n', '/stream/1939137'),
(1687185, 497837, 'Everything Will Be Alright', '鼓励人们勇敢前行，相信一切都会好起来。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=240964&width=300&trackid=1687185', '[00:05.64]Don\'t stop!\n[00:09.38]Don\'t be afraid\n[00:13.62]Of what will come\n[00:22.32]You\'ll handle it all\n[00:26.72]And the sun\n[00:32.96]Sometimes fades\n[00:39.34]And you see no trace\n[00:45.32]But it\'s not for long\n[00:52.52]Just take your dreams with you\n[00:58.50]And do something new\n[01:02.80]May your path be shined by stars\n[01:17.20]Time goes by\n[01:20.78]Someone builds and someone breaks\n[01:27.64]Life is short, we\'re remembered by our deeds\n[01:39.67]Don\'t stop, walk straight\n[01:44.31]Don\'t let them break you down\n[01:51.15]On your path you\'ll see the light\n[01:56.92]Just believe, everything will be alright\n[02:32.17]Don\'t stop!\n[02:35.73]How do you feel?\n[02:42.79]Just clear your head\n[02:45.73]And go ahead\n[02:55.57]There\'s a love that no one sees\n[03:01.41]There\'s a place where you can be free\n[03:07.19]May your path be shined by stars\n[03:20.83]Time goes by\n[03:23.25]Someone builds and someone breaks\n[03:30.63]Life is short, we\'re remembered by our deeds\n[03:42.37]Don\'t stop, walk straight\n[03:47.05]Don\'t let them break you down\n[03:53.13]On your path you\'ll see the light\n[03:59.93]Just believe, everything will be alright\n', '/stream/1687185'),
(2147477, 461498, 'Vila da Regeneração [single]', '以歌声描绘巴西小镇的黄昏、雨水与星光，寄托乡愁与梦想。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=556600&width=300&trackid=2147477', '[00:17.04]Fica no fim da tarde\n[00:19.40]Essa cidade encantada\n[00:22.00]Que queima, que fere e arde\n[00:26.18]No fundo do coração\n[00:31.84]Ela é saudade crua\n[00:33.66]Realidade sonhada\n[00:36.62]Que lentamente invade\n[00:41.00]As notas desta canção\n[00:46.87]Eu canto a vila\n[00:48.29]Com sua história e seu povo\n[00:50.87]Com tudo que há de novo\n[00:50.88]Pousado na tradição\n[00:50.89]Eu canto a vila\n[00:50.90]Canto a rua e a igreja\n[00:53.25]Numa canção sertaneja\n[00:57.89]Num solo de violão\n[01:00.79]E quando chove em cheio\n[01:06.44]Em noite de São Gonçalo\n[01:10.49]Sobe um orvalho ralo\n[01:14.23]Das rachaduras do chão\n[01:35.67]E quando chove encharca\n[01:37.63]Um frio nunca esperado\n[01:41.25]De cruviana, gelado\n[01:44.49]Vem das frestas e do oitão\n[01:50.70]E se falta luz\n[01:52.80]Brota um céu estrelado\n[01:57.56]Estrela pra todo lado\n[02:02.09]Piscando na escuridão\n[02:07.52]E se volta a luz\n[02:10.20]Volta com ela meu sonho\n[02:15.18]De nunca viver tristonho\n[02:18.54]Lá em Regeneração\n', '/stream/2147477'),
(121074, 337382, 'Between Light and Shadow (feat. Moving Sand)', '在光与影之间游走的爵士氛围曲，慵懒而梦幻。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=16739&width=300&trackid=121074', '[01:17.92]Search\n[01:18.34]In the middle\n[01:19.92]Not too loud\n[01:20.18]Not too sweet\n[01:20.26]Between\n[01:23.26]Light and shadow....\n[01:23.27]Between\n[01:24.36]Wrong and right\n[02:07.96]Between\n[02:08.34]Light and Shadow....\n', '/stream/121074'),
(1932812, 209, 'The Death Of The Ball Turret Gunner', '以二战炮手视角吟唱死亡与战争的悲歌。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=477355&width=300&trackid=1932812', '[00:42.06]From my mother\'s sleep I fell into the State,\n[00:49.38]And I hunched in its belly till my wet fur froze.\n[01:14.74]Six miles from earth, loosed from its dream of life,\n[01:23.38]I woke to black flak and the nightmare fighters.\n[02:18.08]When I died they washed me out of the turret with a hose.\n', '/stream/1932812'),
(405927, 352727, 'The Good Shepherd', '一首温暖的民谣，讲述好牧人的信仰与守护。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=50387&width=300&trackid=405927', '[00:14.78]The Good Shepherd\n[00:14.79]I come from the father with promises to keep\n[00:21.28]And I will lay down my life for my sheep\n[00:30.66]For this is the reason that he sent me here\n[00:40.06]And if you\'ll just believe in me\n[00:44.70]I\'ll take away your fears\n[00:51.80]I am the keeper of the gateway of life\n[01:00.62]If you follow me you will be saved\n[01:07.74]But there are those who reject the purpose of my life\n[01:18.18]And if you decide to follow them\n[01:21.82]Then you will be enslaved\n[01:26.70]Chorus\n[01:28.00]I am the Good Shepherd and I’m here for all to see\n[01:35.50]I know my own and my own know me\n[01:47.30]But there are those who are blind to my reality\n[01:57.60]I\'m standing right before them but they just can’t see\n[02:08.24]I have come that you may have life and live it to the full\n[02:15.46]And I will always be with you come what may\n[02:26.64]Don\'t put your trust in the hired hand he’s really not     concerned\n[02:33.61]And when trouble comes to visit you\n[02:38.21]You’ll find he’ll run away\n[02:42.33]Those that belong to me listen to my voice\n[02:45.21]I know each and every one and they all follow me\n[03:13.97]I\'ll give them eternal life they never will be lost\n[03:50.19]And no one will ever take them away from me\n', '/stream/405927'),
(2235921, 517701, 'Me Dada Ka Varis Hu', '达达巴格万的虔诚赞歌，传递灵性教诲与内心平静。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=594961&width=300&trackid=2235921', '[00:15.56]मैं ‘दादा’ का वारस हूँ\n[00:17.76]मैं ‘दादा’ का वारस हूँ,\n[00:22.80]राही केवल सतका हूँ,\n[00:25.18]बोलो प्यारे साथ,\n[00:27.04]‘दा…..दा भगवान’,\n[00:31.36]अम्मर…. वर दे,  वरदान. ----- मैं…\n[00:37.34]दादाजीकी पाँच ही आज्ञा पालेंगे,\n[01:12.36]महावीर खुद ही बन  जाएँगे.\n[01:27.28]कदम कदमपे हम आगे बढ़ेंगे,\n[01:32.20]शुद्धात्मा परमात्मा हो ते जाएँगे,\n[01:37.42]जय सच्चिदानंद वंदन, जय सच्चिदानंद. ---मैं ...\n[01:47.30]अक्रम विक्रम अचल  शिखर,\n[01:49.82]गुप्त है भगवान सबके भीतर\n[02:37.14]अभेदता से हम एक रहेंगे\n[02:41.60]ज़हाँ नज़र आए शुद्धात्मा देखेंगे\n[02:46.72]जय सच्चिदानंद वंदन जय सच्चिदानंद.  --- मैं....\n[02:58.40]जिग्नाषु ओं मुमक्षो की प्यास बुज़ेगी\n[03:04.56]स्व पद में रहेने की प्यास लगेगी\n', '/stream/2235921'),
