(1802808, 510926, 'Far and Wide', '赞美耶稣的摇滚灵魂乐，歌颂其伟大与恩典。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=396207&width=300&trackid=1802808', '[00:00.40]FAR AND WIDE\n[00:00.50]INTRO:\n[00:00.51]We’ve searched far and wide\n[00:02.62]Through the day and night\n[00:05.20]Jesus, there’s none like You\n[00:08.50]All the nations are here\n[00:13.00]Your servants look up all night\n[00:15.38]We await Your triumphant return.\n[00:19.54]CHORUS:\n[00:20.56]All creation praise You\n[00:22.64]In all the earth none like You\n[00:25.16]We’ll bow before You, none is good but the Lord\n[00:30.88]All creation praise You\n[00:32.96]Far and wide we’ve searched, none like You\n[00:35.48]We sing Hallelujah, for none is like the Lord.\n[00:41.16]VERSE ONE:\n[00:41.32]Power and great glory\n[00:43.12]A strong tower; He’s our safety\n[00:46.12]There’s none as good and gracious as the Lord\n[00:51.38]Mighty in battle; He breaks all the shackles\n[00:56.38]There’s none as great and gracious as the Lord.\n[01:00.94]PRELUDE:\n[01:00.95]Come shield us with Your wings\n[01:04.66]Guide us with Your grace\n[01:07.32]You’re the life and the way\n[01:11.96]Our saviour is who You are\n[01:14.78]Our joy at night and day\n[01:17.18]You’re the life and the way. *CHORUS*\n[01:22.30]VERSE TWO:\n[01:24.38]The blind regain their sight\n[01:26.66]The barren now holds her child\n[01:47.84]There’s none as good and gracious as the Lord\n[01:51.74]The weak are made strong\n[01:55.38]The meek are made bold\n[01:58.10]There’s none as great and gracious as the Lord. *PRELUDE + CHORUS*\n[03:00.54]Copyright 2020 Richard Shekari\n', '/stream/1802808'),
