(2248144, 495572, 'Stuck in the Silence', '电子节拍中唱出孤独与失落，在喧嚣里寻找平静。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=601328&width=300&trackid=2248144', '[00:00.42]Something\'s goin\' wrong in the world today\n[00:04.88]Everybody\'s lost and gone insane\n[00:11.68]If you\'re lookin\' for me\n[00:13.82]I\'ll be in the shade\n[00:17.26]Watchin\' this whole world go up in flames\n[00:23.48]Every face I see’s got pain behind the eyes\n[00:28.62]Everybody\'s searchin\' for a reason why\n[00:33.46]I keep my distance, try to stay serene\n[00:40.26]\'Cause I know I’m not the cure for broken dreams\n[00:46.54]And I feel like a robot\n[00:49.38]Just movin\' through the static\n[00:52.44]And I think it’s time I disappear\n[00:56.76]Yeah\n[00:58.48]Yeah\n[00:58.62]I’m stuck in the silence, lost in the noise\n[01:12.62]Fadin’ like a signal with a broken voice\n[01:15.54]Heart on low, soul on freeze\n[01:18.24]Tryna find some peace in a world diseased\n[01:33.46]Stuck in the silence, lost in the noise\n[01:36.20]Fadin’ like a signal with a broken voice\n[01:39.10]Heart on low, soul on freeze\n[01:41.86]Tryna find some peace in a world diseased\n[01:46.28]If I had one wish to call my own\n[01:50.34]I’d bring my people back, bring ‘em home\n[01:56.58]It ain’t been the same since you’ve been gone\n[02:01.54]I just need my brothers back where they belong\n[02:08.94]And I feel like a robot\n[02:11.86]Just movin\' through the static\n[02:14.78]And I think it’s time I disappear\n[02:18.70]I’m stuck in the silence, lost in the noise\n[02:23.36]Fadin’ like a signal with a broken voice\n[02:26.30]Heart on low, soul on freeze\n[02:28.96]Tryna find some peace in a world diseased\n[02:44.14]Stuck in the silence, lost in the noise\n[02:46.86]Fadin’ like a signal with a broken voice\n[02:49.78]Heart on low, soul on freeze\n[02:52.48]Tryna find some peace in a world diseased\n[02:55.60]You can’t reach me now\n[02:59.36]You can’t pull me out\n[03:05.82]You can’t fix me now\n[03:12.90]No, you can’t save me now\n[03:31.13]I’m stuck in the silence, lost in the noise\n[03:33.97]Fadin’ like a signal with a broken voice\n[03:36.89]Heart on low, soul on freeze\n[03:39.61]Tryna find some peace in a world diseased\n', '/stream/2248144'),
(301969, 7872, 'Fit For a King', '民谣叙事曲，讲述宴会上刺杀暴君的复仇故事。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=43195&width=300&trackid=301969', '[00:12.58]The guest of honor to watch the slaughter\n[00:20.94]Of peasants who had dared to try for freedom\n[00:29.19]With suits and dresses and pricessless frescos\n[00:37.22]I pass the marbled halls to reach the banquet\n[00:45.34]The dukes and lords were gathered around\n[00:55.38]A banquet, fit for a king\n[01:05.26]With platters and grease-stained splatters\n[01:12.73]They hold a feast like non I\'d ever seen\n[01:20.93]His royal highness, he wines and dines us\n[01:28.78]And boasts of all his conquests of the land\n[01:36.85]The food was stunning, if ever I saw\n[01:47.75]A banquet, fit for a king\n[01:57.67]When were done, he said "now comes the fun,\n[02:00.32]Where we waste all these treasonous fools\n[02:04.81]Here is my knife, I\'ll let you take the life\n[02:08.41]of the one that you think is the worst."\n[02:13.04]And so I turned and faced the king.\n[02:26.36]I stabbed that knife down on his gold crown\n[02:34.52]His royal bloodline spewing on the marble\n[02:42.62]His eyes beseeched me, this hallow screeched plea\n[02:50.73]"Oh why, oh why would someone do this to me?"\n[02:58.91]The guards were slackjawed, I ran through the courtyard\n[03:07.07]The prisoners were following behind\n[03:15.12]I gave that bastard what he deserved\n[03:25.13]A funeral, fit for a king\n', '/stream/301969'),
(1892110, 538836, 'Dile Cuanto la Quiero', '雷鬼情歌，向月亮倾诉对心上人的深情与思念。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=458286&width=300&trackid=1892110', '[00:20.54]Luna , Donde estás .\n[00:31.60]Ay dile que yo sé , que ella tiene su amor ,\n[00:34.98]pero me moriré , si no le digo la verdad.\n[00:47.76]Luna , confiésale mi amor.\n[00:57.24]Ya no puedo seguir con estos sentimientos,\n[01:00.70]que me matan por dentro , y así no puedo vivir.\n[01:11.26]Luna , donde estés , contigo quiero estar.\n[01:22.98]Quiero ser la estrella que ilumine cada paso que de ,\n[01:26.82]y por donde camine , yo la voy a cuidar.\n[01:35.70]Luna tú que estás con ella siempre en sus noches .\n[01:41.54]Dile cuanto la quiero.\n', '/stream/1892110'),
