ou\'re love and beauty\n[04:28.68]To others, you\'re a foe\n[04:34.08]We\'re different things for each another\n[04:38.32]Which one, you never know\n[05:01.46]One day, I\'ll discover\n[05:04.32]A way to liberate\n[05:09.70]I know my freedom won\'t be late\n[05:17.32]To some, I\'m sharps and star breeze\n[05:23.28]To others, I\'m a foe\n[05:27.20]We\'re different things to each another\n[05:32.28]Which one, you never know\n', '/stream/2242600'),
