(2229014, 495572, 'Scattered', '电子舞曲节奏中，用混乱思绪舞出闪耀自我。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=591818&width=300&trackid=2229014', '[00:15.52]I wake up, eyes already wide\n[00:19.30]My thoughts all race, no place to hide\n[00:23.22]I jump from task to random goal\n[00:27.52]Energy sparks but takes a toll\n[00:30.14]I want to shine, find my own groove\n[00:33.86]But focus slips, I must improve\n[00:37.76]So many sparks inside my brain\n[00:41.72]They make me dance right through the strain\n[00:45.46]I’m spinning round, can’t stay in place\n[00:49.48]Colors flash by, I keep the pace\n[00:53.80]In chaos I find my own beat\n[00:57.72]This rhythm moves both head and feet\n[01:01.64]I start one job, then switch again\n[01:06.84]Moments slip out, lost in the din\n[01:08.30]I paint a song, then chase a dream\n[01:10.92]Lighting my mind like laser beams\n[01:13.82]I know it’s hard to stay on track\n[01:33.22]But each bright spark is calling back\n[01:40.72]I’ll twist my chaos into light\n[01:44.84]So all can shine within tonight\n[01:48.86]I’m spinning round, can’t stay in place\n[01:52.56]Colors flash by, I keep the pace\n[01:56.76]In chaos I find my own beat\n[02:00.70]This rhythm moves both head and feet\n[02:20.36]I feel the bass beneath my skin\n[02:23.70]No limits hold me deep within\n[02:27.72]My scattered thoughts form new design\n[02:31.80]I dance, I glow, I’m feeling fine\n[02:36.10]I’m spinning round, can’t stay in place\n[02:39.70]Colors flash by, I keep the pace\n[02:43.98]In chaos I find my own beat\n[02:47.34]This rhythm moves both head and feet\n', '/stream/2229014'),
(1067877, 386200, 'Passion', '电子流行曲，反复呼唤激情，渴望重燃旧爱。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=126213&width=300&trackid=1067877', '[00:00.00]Passion,\n[00:03.94]passion, passion, passion.\n[00:06.08]Let\'s start.\n[00:06.96]One, two, three.\n[00:08.36]Come on, let\'s start.\n[00:10.58]I try to come to see you,\n[00:13.64]but you won\'t let me in.\n[00:17.64]I know\n[00:19.38]we had our moments, can we start again?\n[00:24.70]I try to come to see you,\n[00:27.72]but you won\'t let me in.\n[00:31.86]I know\n[00:33.62]we had our moments.\n[00:35.42]Let\'s start again.\n[00:39.04]Let\'s start again, again and again.\n[00:43.44]Can we start again?\n[00:45.70]Question.\n[00:47.34]I know, I know, I know.\n[00:53.32]Throw it all away.\n[00:56.50]Put all your doubts in a bottle.\n[00:59.72]So, so far away, far away.\n[01:07.02]Put all your thoughts in a bottle.\n[01:11.02]Throw it all away, so far away.\n[01:17.74]Knock on my door.\n[01:19.08]Yeah,\n[01:21.42]yeah,\n[01:22.44]I will open.\n[01:24.50]Come on, knock, knock, knock on my door.\n[01:27.94]Yeah,\n[01:28.64]yeah.\n[01:31.82]Come on, knock.\n[01:33.86]Knock on my door.\n[01:35.00]Knock,\n[01:35.80]knock, knock on my door.\n[01:38.22]Yeah,\n[01:38.98]yeah.\n[01:42.50]I\'ll let you in.\n[01:45.88]Oh, oh, oh.\n[01:47.78]Oh,\n[01:49.66]oh, oh.\n[02:38.25]Oh, oh, oh.\n[03:06.82]Oh,\n[03:10.50]oh,\n[03:12.54]oh.\n[03:20.41]Knock, knock, knock on my door.\n[03:24.14]Yeah, yeah.\n[03:59.45]Oh, oh, oh.\n[04:28.88]Oh,\n[04:39.32]oh, oh.\n[04:59.96]Oh,\n[05:09.54]oh, oh.\n[05:31.02]Oh,\n[05:39.96]oh, oh.\n', '/stream/1067877'),
(2043262, 439707, 'Mahidevran - Parable (Live from LEGEND STUDIO)', '智慧国王的寓言，警示知足常乐，摇滚现场演绎。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=526618&width=300&trackid=2043262', '[01:23.10]If I can stop one\n[01:25.08]One little life from pain\n[01:28.02]I won’t ever live in vain\n[01:33.84]If I can give you\n[01:36.52]One little drop of rain\n[01:39.18]Story that can stop your strain\n[01:44.78]There was a kingdom\n[01:47.34]Ruled by a fair king\n[01:50.96]So many times ago\n[01:53.60]He had the wisdom\n[01:58.06]Got almost everything\n[02:01.08]Here  my story  goes.\n[02:07.22]CH\n[02:08.58]Once in the heavy woods\n[02:11.56]The king of wisdom lost his way\n[02:17.38]Dying desperately, fading away\n[02:23.20]Until he saw them stay…\n[02:50.96]Two lonely strangers\n[02:53.34]Saved one more life this day\n[02:56.42]Helped the king to find his way\n[03:01.98]He said: “No measures!\n[03:05.16]You can take anything\n[03:07.68]All you can bring back with you!”\n[03:14.38]CH\n[03:14.39]Then in the heavy woods\n[03:19.68]The one of them was fully robbed\n[03:28.02]Dying desperately fading away\n[03:31.00]He lost the sack of treasures\n[03:39.02]Dying desperately losing his way\n[03:42.12]Because of lack of measures!\n[04:00.34]And the second holy stranger\n[04:02.50]Reached his home in spite of danger all alive\n[04:11.10]Put some coins in little pocket\n[04:13.58]Silver ring and golden locket for his wife\n[04:19.54]And she never really asked him\n[04:24.72]Why he didn’t take the sack of heavy gold.\n[04:33.08]Take as much as you can measure\n[04:35.62]Take a handful – that’s the treasure you can hold.\n[04:44.10]Give me your hand, we will stand, understand the simple thing of the u-ni-iverse\n[04:53.76]We will be glad, if we had just the handful of the coins, of the duties in purse.\n[05:07.06]As much as you can!\n[05:10.32]You never be fan!\n[05:30.98]As you can!\n[05:32.88]No more fan!\n[05:34.12]As you can!\n[05:34.13]Be a Man!\n', '/stream/2043262'),
(189585, 337382, 'Triplexity - Lise (with LucB)', '法语爵士波萨诺瓦，诉说离别与不舍的浪漫情歌。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=28378&width=300&trackid=189585', '[00:12.78]LISE\n[00:13.16](Paroles et musique : Luc Bérengnier)\n[01:02.32]Lise, oh ma Lise\n[01:03.72]on s\'enlise à s\'aimer trop longtemps\n[01:09.88]Lise, oh ma Lise\n[01:15.74]je prend le train demain avant\n[01:26.02]que tu te fatigues\n[01:27.94]des petits points du jour\n[01:31.62]secret de nos amours\n[01:36.01]Lise, oh ma Lise\n[01:39.67]un nouveau chemin nous attend\n[01:45.63]Lise, oh ma Lise\n[01:51.87]je t\'en prie ne pleure pas tant\n[01:57.91]Lise, oh ma Lise\n[02:06.11]je t\'aurai fait pleurer avant\n[02:13.97]à jouer trop souvent\n[02:18.54]à ton doux chevet\n[02:20.00]le jeu des amants\n[02:22.96]Lise, oh ma Lise\n[02:27.82]on s\'enlise à s\'aimer trop longtemps\n[02:33.76]Lise, oh ma Lise\n[02:41.80]souris donc au lendemain\n[02:45.48]tout habillé de rose\n[02:50.40]qui te prend déjà par la main\n[02:50.54]je suis un voyageur\n[02:50.55]qui ne comprend pas bien\n[02:50.62]les jeux du coeur\n[02:50.63]Lise, oh ma Lise\n[02:50.64]je reprend mon chemin pour ailleurs\n', '/stream/189585'),
