(2298493, 603673, 'Palace of Sand', '沙堡幻梦，潮汐般的民谣低语，诉说记忆与真相。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=623600&width=300&trackid=2298493', '[00:04.92]The moon is fading fast Memories never last You’re a trace of red In a path we tread\n[00:27.28]Bring me a palace of sand To hold within my hand A ocean flows inside a dream Where nothing\'s ever what it seems\n[00:38.80]We breathe the morning haze Lost inside the maze Walking on a bridge of blue Trying to find the truth\n[01:10.18]Bring me a palace of sand To hold within my hand A ocean flows inside a dream Where nothing\'s ever what it seems\n[01:21.16]Holding the heavy sand Palace in my hand A ocean flows inside a dream Where nothing\'s ever what it seems\n', '/stream/2298493'),
(968235, 362501, 'When The Gutter Looks Up', '爵士放克灵魂乐，唱出低谷中仰望女孩的失落与自省。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=113916&width=300&trackid=968235', '[00:00.00]You jump too high, you foolish clown\n[00:05.34]Put your feet back\n[00:07.68]on the ground\n[00:09.54]You think that they won\'t last no more\n[00:13.78]So here you jump again\n[00:15.90]from the highest floor\n[00:18.14]And if the world is still around\n[00:22.00]I can hardly touch the ground\n[00:27.60]You\'re only really,\n[00:29.18]really down When the girl looks up\n[00:37.24]Girl looks up\n[00:42.38]You hit the street like a one-man guy But\n[00:48.14]you\'re not the only one that is left behind\n[00:52.08]You think that you\'re not welcome\n[00:54.72]here When the small talk in the corner\n[00:58.46]You disappear And if the world is still around\n[01:05.44]You can hardly hear a sound You\'re only really,\n[01:11.76]really down When the girl looks up\n[01:24.12]When the girl looks up\n[01:35.30]And if the world is still around\n[01:39.69]I can hardly touch the ground\n[01:45.92]You\'re only really, really down\n[01:50.28]When the girl looks up Down, down, down,\n[01:59.16]down Really,\n[02:01.32]really,\n[02:01.88]really,\n[02:02.44]really down When the girl looks up\n[02:10.80]When the girl looks up\n[02:19.02]When the girl looks up\n', '/stream/968235'),
(1834993, 535912, 'Pain(t) On Me', '以艺术为喻的失恋悲歌，痛与美交织。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=275248&width=300&trackid=1834993', '[00:12.56]Verse 1\n[00:12.80]Sing to me, tell me that I’m not the one\n[00:16.42]Not just any song, I’ll let you be the swan\n[00:23.42]You know my secrets, you know my fears\n[00:30.06]I feel how I’m evicted, I’m trapped in all your tears\n[00:36.02]I’m in every word your lips are shaping\n[00:42.42]And it’s in your silence, that I’m slowly fading\n[00:47.76]So before you go, before questions stay unanswered\n[00:54.24]Sculpt me brutally, until I’m truly battered\n[00:59.68]Chorus\n[01:00.12]Make of me your work of art\n[01:12.52]Adorn my soul, decorate my heart\n[01:23.30]Don’t be afraid, please, just feel free\n[01:32.26]To put paint on me\n[01:37.80]Put pain on me...\n[01:43.08]Verse 2\n[01:48.12]Cover up the harm, cover up your shame\n[01:53.60]As long as you can’t see it, it will be the same\n[01:59.94]Eyes so easy to deceive, but deep inside you’ll know\n[02:05.76]That’s just surface colour, cause the dark can’t glow\n[02:11.78]You’ll see the mud, you’ll see the dirt\n[02:17.66]There’s no escape, your path was curt\n[02:24.26]And in the end, if we go back to the start\n[02:29.50]You’ll realize that maybe, you’re the “work of art”\n', '/stream/1834993'),
