(1944019, 510926, 'This World', '一首信仰告白式的流行民谣，诉说天国盼望与平安。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=482116&width=300&trackid=1944019', '[00:12.78]THIS WORLD\n[00:12.79]VERSE ONE:\n[00:12.80]It was You who lit the way in the dark\n[00:16.86]It is You who gives me peace\n[00:24.18]It was You who shamed death on the cross\n[00:30.38]Yes, it’s You, O’ King of kings\n[00:33.74]CHORUS:\n[00:34.80]Let Thy Kingdom come\n[00:36.58]This world doesn’t feel like home. (4x)\n[00:40.92]VERSE TWO:\n[00:40.93]You’re one of a kind\n[01:01.80]O’ Prince of peace, yes, You are\n[01:04.60]You left Your throne to come and save me\n[01:09.40]Come give Him praise; lift His Holy name on high\n[01:18.38]He gave Himself for you and me. *Chorus*\n', '/stream/1944019'),
