(647352, 337907, 'My Inspiration', '以信仰与坚持为力量，鼓励人们勇敢追寻内心的灵感。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=75410&width=300&trackid=647352', '[00:13.14]MY INSPIRATION (2008)\n[00:16.44]Verse 1\n[00:20.63]Sol\n[00:20.64]Sometimes i feel like I’m turning around the same places\n[00:26.13]Ré\n[00:27.15](I) know that my fears could drive my life, and won’t find the way\n[00:31.97]Sol                 Mim         La\n[00:32.61]Everyday I thank my God to be alive in this world and always see the sun\n[00:41.21]Chorus 1\n[00:43.11]Ré         Sim\n[00:43.45]Pain give us the power, tears fill-up your eyes\n[00:48.35]Ré                Sim\n[00:48.45]No matter how hard is life, i’m still stand up\n[00:53.49]Fa#m               Mim\n[00:53.77]I have to try to get ready to bring some beauty,\n[00:58.69]Ré\n[00:59.09]Some range, some keys, to my Faith\n[01:02.45]Verse 2\n[01:04.65]Time flies like a bird, that is why there is no time for regrets\n[01:10.11]So step by step,\n[01:14.13]I will make some progress, try to feel my emotions,\n[01:19.65]and  let express and rise my inspiration\n[01:25.83]Repeat chorus 1\n[01:26.79]Bridge\n[01:26.80]Fa#m                 Sim\n[01:28.57]I just want to tell  you that  everything’s gonna be ok\n[01:50.77]Fa#m               Sim\n[01:52.31]I want you to know that faillure is a future success\n[01:55.95]Fa#m        Sim\n[01:57.23]Keep on trusting and believing in your star\n[02:02.85]Mim           La\n[02:02.97]And at the end you will really start your life\n[02:07.47]Ré            Sim\n[02:19.29]Love bring us the power, Faith is in your eyes\n[02:26.95]Fa#m           Mim\n[02:29.81]No matter how hard I’ve tried,\n[02:32.97]Ré\n[02:34.11]I won’t give up,\n[02:35.49]I will keep on tracing down my path\n', '/stream/647352'),
