(2311270, 597553, 'Lighthouse Keeper', '灯塔守望者独守孤海，思念逝去的爱人，渴望风暴淹没一切。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=630068&width=300&trackid=2311270', '[00:08.00]Lighthouse Keeper\n[00:08.01]I am a lighthouse keeper, I watch a barren sea\n[00:11.20]They say no man’s an island, no man, that is, save me\n[00:15.42]I am a lighthouse keeper, these tides are memories\n[00:19.60]Rachel’s been gone a long, long time\n[00:23.36]Rachel’s been gone a long, long time.\n[00:26.72]I am a lighthouse keeper, I search for the mast\n[00:30.98]Of the boat that frees me, from the shadows of my past\n[00:34.10]I am a lighthouse keeper; each drink will be my last\n[00:38.72]Rachel’s been gone a long, long time\n[00:42.76]Rachel’s been gone a long, long time.\n[00:45.60]Chorus\n[00:46.40]Drown, drown, oceans flood round\n[00:49.66]Won’t you tear this old lighthouse down\n[00:52.48]Drown, drown, oceans flood round\n[00:57.70]Won’t you tear this old lighthouse down.\n[01:13.54](Instrumental)\n[01:16.50]Chorus\n[01:19.46]Let the storm clouds gather, let the storm clouds blow\n[01:22.58]Blow out the light, from this worthless soul\n[01:23.98]Let the storm clouds gather, let the storm birds crow\n[01:23.99]Blow out the light, from this worthless soul.\n[01:24.00]Chorus\n[01:24.01]I am a lighthouse keeper, I guard a jagged shore\n[01:25.06]On whose rocks ex-lovers, will wreck their love no more\n[01:25.08]I am a lighthouse keeper, I scream as oceans roar:\n[01:30.38]Rachel’s been gone a long, long time\n[01:34.88]Rachel’s been gone a long, long time\n[01:38.66]Rachel’s been gone a long, long time\n[02:20.40]Rachel’s been gone a long, long time.\n', '/stream/2311270'),
