l.\n[04:09.78]Why do you need so much?\n[04:11.32]I need so much.\n[04:13.24]Like I never needed before.\n[04:16.36]But you never came down to see me.\n[04:18.96]Oh, could you ever?\n[04:20.70]Because it\'s the mark.\n[04:23.26]To make my way along.\n[04:29.30]Why do you need so much?\n[04:33.58]I need so much.\n[04:34.72]Like I never needed before.\n', '/stream/2314393'),
(1307839, 343767, 'Traveler\'s Song', '旅人背起行囊，追寻世界尽头与自我价值。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=155433&width=300&trackid=1307839', '[00:11.50]days look the same through the window pane\n[00:14.00]you wannna feel the sun\n[00:16.16]so you pack your stuff but you dunno yet\n[00:19.56]where you’re traveling to\n[00:24.34]gotta step in the world\n[00:28.92]going out on the road\n[00:34.20]cause you’re a traveler\n[00:54.50]you wanna see every corner\n[00:56.56]of the planet earth\n[00:59.80]going round places and up mountains\n[01:03.40]nobody’s ever seen\n[01:06.76]you carry your home\n[01:11.02]on your shoulder\n[01:17.48]cause you’re a traveler\n[01:26.16]life is your travel\n[01:30.18]cause you never lost north\n[01:36.50]you just won’t settle\n[01:40.88]until you find what it’s worth\n[01:47.38]until you find who is worth\n[01:51.74]from the other bank of this tiny globe\n[02:05.98]another episode\n[02:08.54]i wonder in which language should we greet\n[02:11.26]next we will meet\n[02:14.20]the horizon’s direction\n[02:21.16]donkey for companion\n[04:01.38]cause you’re a traveler\n', '/stream/1307839'),
(2299207, 600977, 'One-must-be_-not-seem-_Надо-быть_-а-не-казаться_', '俄语民谣，呼吁做真实的自己而非伪装。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=623998&width=300&trackid=2299207', '[00:21.88]https://telegra.ph/TO-BE-NOT-TO-SEEM---Lyuboj-sejchas-pytaetsya-kazatsya-10-16\n[00:23.68]13 ? TO BE, NOT TO SEEM - Любой сейчас пытается казаться\n[00:23.69]Everyone today is trying to appear,\n[00:24.26]Pretending to be someone, year after year.\n[00:26.60]Hiding behind a proper mask,\n[00:29.02]Afraid to face the simplest task.\n[00:31.64]It all revolves around the fear to be,\n[00:33.90]Each move — a copy endlessly.\n[00:36.86]Illusions form a fatal spin,\n[00:39.32]Inside — unending doubt within.\n[00:42.24]You must be — not just seem,\n[00:46.84]Stop obeying the fear’s regime.\n[00:48.22]No more lies, no more disguise,\n[00:51.74]Just let your truth arise.\n[00:54.22]To “be” won’t gather crowds around,\n[00:56.50]It needs no praise, no cheering sound.\n[01:08.08]It asks for no reward or name,\n[01:12.72]It breathes — alive, untamed.\n[01:15.58]“To seem” craves glory, thirsts for fame,\n[01:18.22]“To be” stands still within its flame.\n[01:20.70]One is born from fear and show,\n[01:23.24]The other shines in quiet glow.\n[01:25.92]You must be — not just seem,\n[01:30.02]Stop obeying the fear’s regime.\n[01:30.98]No more lies, no more disguise,\n[01:41.02]Just let your truth arise.\n[01:46.94]When silence finally fills the air,\n[01:49.02]“To seem” will fall to its own despair.\n[01:51.62]But “to be” will rise from the ground,\n[01:54.00]Turning chaos pure and sound.\n[01:56.70]“To seem” forever begs for praise,\n[01:59.36]It feeds on noise, it craves the gaze.\n[02:02.06]But “to be” can live without display,\n[02:04.52]Its light clears thought along the way.\n[02:07.28]You must be — not just seem,\n[02:18.86]Stop obeying the fear’s regime.\n[02:21.72]No more lies, no more disguise,\n[02:23.08]Just let your truth arise.\n[02:29.04]Don’t wait for signs or permission to move,\n[02:32.98]Don’t hide your trembling under the gloom.\n[02:35.26]In the space where reflections cease,\n[02:38.36]You’ll meet your height, your inner peace.\n[02:40.88]Most choose the mask, afraid to be,\n[02:44.32]To face the crowd’s hypocrisy.\n[02:46.10]But by pretending to fit their mold,\n[02:47.66]You lose the link to your own soul.\n[02:51.20]You must be — not just seem,\n[02:55.62]Stop obeying the fear’s regime.\n[02:56.14]No more lies, no more disguise,\n[03:00.38]Just let your truth arise.\n[03:19.38]--------------------------------------------\n[03:20.76]13 Любой сейчас пытается казаться\n[03:21.16]Любой сейчас пытается казаться,\n[03:21.17]Из себя кого то корчит без конца.\n[03:21.18]Чтобы за маской правильной скрываться,\n[03:21.19]Не показывая своего лица.\n[03:21.20]Всё крутится на страхе быть собой,\n[03:21.21]И каждый жест рождает подражание,\n[03:21.38]Иллюзий круг становится судьбой,\n[03:21.39]Внутри лишь безконечные терзания.\n[03:31.18]Надо быть, а не казаться,\n[03:31.19]Не нужно больше притворяться.\n[03:31.50]Хватит страху подчиняться,\n[03:31.64]Начни просто - проявляться.\n[03:31.65]А «быть» не собирает зрителей вокруг,\n[03:32.58]В нём нет потребности в признании.\n[03:33.72]Оно не требует каких то там заслуг,\n[03:33.90]И проявляется в в естественном дыхании.\n', '/stream/2299207'),
