(2024290, 557378, 'Marian&Sean - Gravedad', '电子拉丁情歌，失重般缠绵的浪漫爱恋。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=517672&width=300&trackid=2024290', '[00:01.20]Baby vamos a pasar el rato\n[00:06.04]Quiero que no se nos vaya el tiempo\n[00:08.64]El tiempo\n[00:10.06]Eres tú como yo\n[00:13.90]Te quiero sentir\n[00:15.36]Te quiero sentir\n[00:17.24]Underground\n[00:18.38]Right now\n[00:19.22]I want you all around me\n[00:21.78]Kissing in the silence\n[00:23.94]Trippin, gettin high\n[00:25.44]Underground\n[00:26.38]Right now\n[00:27.38]I want you all around me\n[00:29.80]Kissing in the silence\n[00:31.76]Trippin, gettin high\n[00:33.54]Contigo quiero estar\n[00:35.42]Contigo quiero estar\n[00:37.34]Sin la gravedad\n[00:39.72]La gravedad\n[00:40.84]Siento en el espacio cuando me recorres\n[00:44.04]Me da paz cuando encima de mi te corres\n[00:45.26]Tu cuerpo se libera en la oscuridad\n[00:46.70]Ya no puedo estar tan lejos no\n[00:48.78]Underground\n[00:50.72]Right now\n[00:50.73]I want you all around me\n[00:55.44]Kissing in the silence\n[00:57.10]Trippin, gettin high\n[01:11.28]Underground\n[01:11.66]Right now\n[01:12.08]I want you all around me\n[01:14.50]Kissing in the silence\n[01:15.12]Trippin, gettin high\n[01:15.44]Contigo quiero estar\n[01:16.72]Contigo quiero estar\n[01:17.54]Sin la gravedad\n', '/stream/2024290'),
(1892677, 363811, 'Simplement', '夏日派对邂逅，从怯懦到相恋的温柔回忆。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=458582&width=300&trackid=1892677', '[00:11.34]C’était une de ces soirées estivales\n[00:18.88]Où apparaissent tous les rivaux\n[00:24.88]Des types qui vous sapent le moral\n[00:33.52]Ce soir je ferais mieux de ne boire que de l’eau\n[00:40.14]Ce n’était peut-être vraiment pas le moment\n[00:46.78]Pour tenter de devenir ton amant\n[00:54.42]Et petit à petit\n[00:57.90]Je me suis approché\n[01:02.32]J’avais tout simplement envie\n[01:05.52]De savoir qui tu étais\n[01:09.52]Mais un grand type\n[01:13.24]Plutôt du genre bellâtre\n[01:17.62]Te vantait ses mérites\n[01:20.32]Et moi j’avais le trac\n[01:25.26]Puis tout à coup tu t’es retournée\n[01:32.60]Je me suis senti vraiment absent\n[01:38.58]Mais tu t’adressais à moi\n[01:46.24]Je revivais enfin\n[01:54.76]Il y a des jours où la vie a du charme\n[02:02.16]Pour un peu j’en aurais versé une larme\n[02:08.62]Et petit à petit\n[02:12.30]Tu t’es approchée\n[02:16.28]T’avais tout simplement envie\n[02:19.34]De savoir qui j’étais\n[02:22.90]Et plus de grand type\n[02:26.82]Ni même de bellâtre\n[02:31.26]Je me trouvais plein de mérite\n[02:34.20]Et l’extase avait chassé le trac\n[02:38.96]Je buvais tes paroles\n[02:53.58]Et rien n’existait plus\n[03:08.48]Ensemble on est parti\n[03:10.66]On n’a rien calculé\n[03:14.94]On avait tout simplement envie\n[03:18.42]De savoir qui on était\n[03:22.80]Bien sûr tout çà\n[03:25.70]Çà a fini un jour\n[03:30.10]Mais moi je ne suis pas triste\n[03:33.62]Car je t’aime toujours\n', '/stream/1892677'),
(1980623, 551289, 'Future Chill', '氛围电子轻音乐，人声吟唱，适合放松与旅途。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=500092&width=300&trackid=1980623', '[00:09.32]Thank you.\n[00:36.18]Thank you.\n[01:05.22]Thank you.\n[01:33.40]Thank you.\n[02:00.58]Thank you.\n[02:35.70]Thank you.\n', '/stream/1980623'),
(1519114, 487069, 'Goodbye Romeo', '告别花言巧语的爱人，结束一段反复失望的感情。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=319152&width=300&trackid=1519114', '[00:10.24]You say you’re sorry\n[00:12.68]You say it’s gonna be all different this time\n[00:18.84]You say don’t worry\n[00:22.20]You say that we deserve a second chance.\n[00:28.92]You’ll say anything to make it right\n[00:33.38]But I’ve been down this road before\n[00:37.76]You’re so good at the promising part\n[00:41.30]But so bad at following through.\n[00:46.62]You can tell me whatever you want\n[00:51.10]But you’re wasting your breath, Romeo o o\n[00:55.48]‘Cause your words go in one ear and out the other\n[01:00.22]So don’t bother\n[01:02.48]Oh oh oh oh oh oh oh\n[01:04.84]Goodbye, Romeo.\n[01:16.86]This story’s over\n[01:21.34]This love has died so it can live on no more\n[01:25.46]Let’s stop pretending\n[01:30.14]That we’re just actors waiting for the next show.\n[01:35.60]You’ll say anything to make us right\n[01:39.98]But we’ve been down this road before\n[01:44.48]You’re so good at the promising part\n[01:47.86]But so bad at making love true.\n[01:53.28]You can tell me whatever you want\n[01:57.76]But you’re wasting your breath, Romeo o o\n[02:02.16]‘Cause your words go in one ear and out the other\n[02:06.88]So don’t bother\n[02:09.12]Oh oh oh oh oh oh oh\n[02:11.52]Goodbye, Romeo.\n[02:14.48]I thought parting was such sweet sorrow\n[02:16.28]Now it’s sweet, the sorrow’s gone\n[02:16.29]We won’t have to meet tomorrow\n[02:37.74]So I guess you’re on your own.\n[02:42.18]You can tell me whatever you want\n[02:45.96]But you’re wasting your breath, Romeo o o\n[02:50.76]‘Cause your words go in one ear and out the other\n[02:55.76]So don’t bother\n[02:58.02]Oh oh oh oh oh oh oh\n[03:00.38]Goodbye, Romeo.\n[03:03.82]You can tell me whatever you want\n[03:08.88]But you’re wasting your breath, Romeo o o\n[03:13.00]‘Cause your lips move while mine moved on to another\n[03:17.88]So don’t bother\n[03:20.22]Oh oh oh oh oh oh oh\n[03:22.58]Goodbye, Romeo.\n', '/stream/1519114'),
(1926466, 510867, 'WHEN I\'M WITHOUT YOU', '失恋后痛苦思念，雨中无法继续生活。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=474816&width=300&trackid=1926466', '[00:08.20]Aching for loving\n[00:11.70]I ache for your loving\n[00:15.66]I’d want you back\n[00:19.38]I need you back\n[00:23.40]My heart is glowing\n[00:27.16]It’s burning and glowing\n[00:30.98]It wants you back\n[00:33.60]Even if you can’t come back\n[00:37.56]I still feel you\n[00:40.70]Like I’m in you\n[00:42.74]I can die now\n[00:44.68]Or start anew\n[00:46.62]Rain is falling\n[00:48.56]I am falling\n[00:50.44]People round me\n[00:52.78]Are all crawling\n[00:54.52]Wanna see you\n[00:56.24]Wanna meet you\n[00:58.52]I miss you so\n[01:00.40]Can’t continue\n[01:01.96]Life I’m living\n[01:04.22]Heart I’m giving\n[01:05.86]I mean nothing\n[01:07.60]When I’m without you\n[01:09.80]Temperature’s rising\n[01:11.44]I’m dramatizing\n[01:15.50]‘Cos I want you back\n[01:20.12]I really need you back\n[01:24.58]Hurt drained my feelings\n[01:26.94]I live without words and meanings\n[01:30.78]Wait for you to get back\n[01:35.32]Even though you won’t come back\n[01:39.06]I still feel you\n[01:42.10]Like I’m in you\n[01:44.20]I can die now\n[01:46.14]Or start anew\n[01:48.10]Rain is falling\n[01:50.00]I am falling\n[01:51.90]People round me\n[01:53.82]Are all crawling\n[01:56.00]Wanna see you\n[01:57.98]Wanna meet you\n[01:59.82]I miss you so\n[02:01.56]Can’t continue\n[02:03.40]Life I’m living\n[02:05.42]Heart I’m giving\n[02:07.06]I mean nothing\n[02:53.16]When I’m without you\n', '/stream/1926466'),
(1891977, 542298, 'My Love', '一首深情的流行情歌，表达对爱人的依赖与感激。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=458205&width=300&trackid=1891977', '[00:08.44](Verse one)\n[00:08.45]My every single breath is based on you\n[00:08.46]My heart caught an arrow\n[00:08.56]The only thing that gives me sense of life\n[00:08.57]For tomorrow\n[00:08.60](Chorus)\n[00:08.61]My love you know I need you here and now\n[00:51.50]My love I\'m blinded by your perfect nature\n[00:55.76]My love can not find a better word\n[01:02.68]Hold me, hold me, hold me\n[01:03.92]My love you came and lift me off the ground\n[01:07.54]My love that make my life feels like adventure\n[01:11.68]My love healed my lonely world\n[01:15.78]Hold me, hold me, hold me\n[01:19.26](Verse two)\n[01:20.48]You showed me what\'s the meaning of the truth\n[01:27.60]My sunrise fire\n[02:06.66]You gave me understanding of the life\n', '/stream/1891977'),
(2314282, 597553, 'Angie In The Mornings', '清晨忆旧爱安吉，苏格兰远行，爱终成往事。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=631379&width=300&trackid=2314282', '[00:01.31]I\n[00:03.24]remember Angie in the mornings\n[00:06.43]I remember Angie in the day\n[00:12.74]It was always Angie in the mornings\n[00:17.42]Until the day she went away\n[00:22.10]I remember Angie in the evenings\n[00:27.22]Hair as golden as the sun\n[00:32.22]And Angie when she was leaving When our love affair was done\n[00:43.40]Scotland was calling Marriage, art and rain\n[00:47.28]I felt like I was falling I walked like I was lame\n[00:52.92]Scotland was calling She rode the Glasgow train\n[00:57.08]I clung to my ocean It was never the same I remember\n[01:03.40]Angie in the nightclub I remember Angie by the sea\n[01:13.04]We both worked in the same nightclub\n[01:17.66]But the ocean came for free\n[01:22.46]There was Angie in the sunshine\n[01:27.10]There was Angie on the beach Always dreaming of leaving\n[01:36.84]Always slightly out of reach Scotland was calling Marriage,\n[01:46.16]art and rain\n[01:47.92]I felt like I was falling I walked\n[01:50.78]like I was lame Scotland was calling\n[01:55.08]She rode the Glasgow train\n[01:57.42]I clung to my ocean It was never the same Scotland was calling\n[02:26.86]Marriage, art and rain\n[02:28.66]I felt like I was falling\n[02:31.14]I walked like I was lame Scotland was calling\n[02:35.90]She rode the Glasgow train I clung to my ocean\n[02:40.62]It was never the same\n[02:44.00]As all things have their beginning\n[02:48.54]So all things must have their end\n[02:53.86]You start off as lovers\n[02:58.24]And end up\n[02:59.44]Facebook friends Those years seem far away now\n[03:08.06]But the memories stay strong\n[03:12.80]So for Angie in the mornings I dedicate this\n[03:18.92]song I dedicate this song I dedicate this song\n[03:29.56]I dedicate this song\n', '/stream/2314282'),
(2264038, 515591, 'Mirror', '镜中迷失自我，梦境追寻虚幻身影的忧郁摇滚。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=608214&width=300&trackid=2264038', '[00:01.86]I look in the mirror\n[00:04.94]And I see\n[00:09.74]The eyes of a stranger are gazing at me\n[00:15.84]How many years\n[00:20.34]Have you been\n[00:23.50]In the kingdom of illusions and dreams\n[00:44.54]Searching in the darkness\n[00:46.76]For familiar shape\n[00:50.32]No one could see he made an escape\n[00:58.12]Searching in the darkness\n[01:00.40]Under the cloud of night\n[01:04.16]For the runaway hiding from the light\n[01:11.60]Every night I have the same old dream\n[01:14.32]Maze of mirrors in front of me\n[01:20.64]So many faces so many lies\n[01:24.64]When I touch the image that I see\n[01:28.04]It breaks into pieces \'round me\n[01:31.92]And takes you so far... so far away\n[01:38.70]Far away, far away, far away\n[01:41.36]Please, tell me your name!\n[01:47.46]I will believe all the words you\'ll say\n[01:51.54]Far away, far away, far away\n[01:56.54]Maybe you will stay\n[01:59.96]Reflection following my way\n', '/stream/2264038'),
