(2296700, 362100, 'Night Shadow', '暗夜阴影缠绕梦境，在恐惧中挣扎求救。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=622815&width=300&trackid=2296700', '[00:16.08]Night Shadow\n[00:16.16]Locked deep in an endless trance\n[00:19.62]Hallucinations taking hold\n[00:21.64]Break free of the serpents dance\n[00:23.96]I cannot let it take control\n[00:26.56]My mind is filled with bad decisions\n[00:31.02]If I surrender I will never forgiven\n[00:35.24]The night shadows follow me\n[00:41.76]I feel them creeping in the corners\n[00:42.88]I’m sick and tired of losing sleep\n[01:08.36]Somebody save me from this horror\n[01:13.68]The night shadows haunt my dreams\n[01:17.36]They’re lurking silent in the corners\n[01:21.30]I feel them clawing at my feet\n[01:26.82]My mind is falling to disorder\n[01:29.84]I awake\n[01:31.38]To the sound of my own heartbeat racing\n[01:34.24]Is this what, they adore\n[01:37.56]Just a taste\n[01:40.18]Of my rampant fear, my mind is aching\n[01:43.08]As they hide beneath the floor\n[01:47.62]Save me from this dark illusion\n[01:48.52]The shadows wicked trance\n[01:52.08]Save me from myself\n[02:18.14]Free me from this great confusion\n[02:22.02]A neverending dance\n[02:24.10]Before it starts again\n[02:27.66]Shine a light\n[02:29.66]Bring it down\n[02:30.82]Shine a light\n[02:31.70]Bring it down\n[02:32.98]Shine a light\n[02:33.86]Don’t let the shadows win\n', '/stream/2296700'),
(226722, 3592, 'certains adultes èrrent', '法语民谣低吟成人世界的谎言与心碎', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=33558&width=300&trackid=226722', '[00:04.84]CERTAINS ADULTES ERRENT\n[00:05.98]Certains adultes errent entre promesse et mensonges,\n[00:07.58]Certains adultères oppressent mon âme et la ronge\n[00:09.90]Certains adultes errent entre promesse et mensonges,\n[00:12.54]Certains adultères oppressent mon âme et la ronge\n[00:14.68]Et dans mon cœur ça fait BOM BOM\n[00:17.18]Et dans mon cœur ça fait BOM BOM\n[00:19.16]J’ai pas d’histoire pour faire des rêves,\n[00:22.60]Juste un cauchemar pire que les grèves,\n[00:24.84]Pas de Poudlard et pas d’élèves,\n[00:27.40]Pas de barbare et pas de glaive,\n[00:29.94]Des contes de faits,\n[00:31.98]Pas de fées,\n[00:33.24]Tous comptes faits,\n[00:34.52]C’est bien mieux\n[00:35.56]quand c’est laid,\n[00:37.26]oui je sais,\n[00:38.28]je suis vieux.\n[00:40.06]J’ai qu ‘une seule chose à te raconter,\n[00:42.44]Un peu morose la vérité :\n[00:44.94]Pas de princesse à libérer,\n[00:47.52]Rien qu’des diablesses à éviter ;\n[00:50.20]Ton Butin sait barrer,\n[00:52.64]Il m’a mené en bateau bien plus loin que les mers ;\n[00:55.22]Ma Putain s’est barrée,\n[00:57.78]T’a laissé mon pirate au fond d’une cale de galère ;\n[01:00.30]Ton Trésor part\n[01:01.30]ma petite merveille,\n[01:02.82]triste comme les soirs\n[01:03.82]où ta mère veille,\n[01:05.32]en tous cas,\n[01:06.58]pas sur toi,\n[01:07.76]rassure toi,\n[01:09.00]je suis là,\n[01:10.34]mon p’tit gars ,\n[01:11.68]compte sur moi,\n[01:12.80]ton papa\n[01:13.96]na pardonne pas !\n[01:20.70]Certains adultes errent entre promesse et mensonges,\n[01:23.16]Certains adultères oppressent mon âme et la ronge\n[01:25.68]Certains adultes errent entre promesse et mensonges,\n[01:28.20]Certains adultères oppressent mon âme et la ronge\n[01:30.48]Et dans mon cœur ça fait BOM BOM\n[01:32.76]Et dans mon cœur ça fait BOM BOM\n[01:49.72]Ton Butin sait barrer,\n[01:53.16]Il m’a mené en bateau bien plus loin que les mers ;\n[01:55.88]Ma Putain s’est barrée,\n[01:58.34]T’a laissé mon pirate au fond d’une cale de galère ;\n[02:00.96]Ton Butin sait barrer…\n[02:05.76]Ma Putain s’est barrée…\n[02:10.98]C’est pour toi le fils\n[02:12.12]Qui ne verra jamais l’jour,\n[02:13.52]Sur cette garce je pisse,\n[02:14.88]La maudit sans détour ;\n[02:16.12]J’ai comme,\n[02:16.54]Un truc bien lourd\n[02:17.24]Sur le cœur, ‘faut qu’je lourde,\n[02:18.64]Que j’gomme,\n[02:19.24]Rééduque mon courroux,\n[02:20.52]ma rancœur,\n[02:21.08]que j’m ‘assomme,\n[02:49.92]de haine :\n[02:55.64]pourquoi cette chienne,\n[02:58.16]un peu sheitane ?\n[02:59.62]c’était la mienne,\n', '/stream/226722'),
(1858791, 350433, 'Buscando ese lugar', '一首寻找内心宁静之地的西班牙语民谣，温暖治愈。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=337007&width=300&trackid=1858791', '[00:13.28]Hay un lugar perdido,\n[00:15.18]un paraíso escondido,\n[00:18.84]dónde hay felicidad y abrigo y la tristeza no se ve.\n[00:25.48]Dicen que en el aquel lugar no existe la ansiedad\n[00:31.72]por lo sucedido y que no importa lo que ocurrirá.\n[00:37.30]Ese lugar dónde estará metido, si me preguntas a mí\n[00:44.08]yo te diré que no lo sé.\n[00:48.82]He ido a mil terapias, he practicado no sé cuántas gimnasias,\n[01:30.08]he viajado, libros, ritos, charlas y ese sitio no se ve.\n[01:36.66]Ripoche viene a Madrid, también habrá Reiki y el paciente,\n[01:45.16]con aportación consciente así siente que ya puede proseguir.\n[01:53.84]Buscando ese lugar, dónde estará metido,\n[01:58.90]si me preguntas a mí, yo te diré que no lo sé.\n[02:19.06]BIS\n[02:20.28]Quizás ese lugar por ser tan evidente y tenerlo aquí presente\n[02:27.68]es tan real que no lo ves...\n[02:31.42]Que no lo ves... Tantra o Tao Te King.\n', '/stream/1858791'),
(2305427, 510867, 'JUDGES', '面对质疑，坚定信念，勇敢前行。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=627279&width=300&trackid=2305427', '[00:00.80]Who are the judges?\n[00:04.48]They can not even spell my name\n[00:08.94]Who are the judges?\n[00:15.22]Did they identify my blame?\n[00:21.34]I’ll let rain keep falling\n[00:23.58]Falling down\n[00:25.32]It’ll wash their thoughts and words away\n[00:28.82]I may seem crawling\n[00:33.30]I may seem down but\n[00:35.88]The faith in me is here to stay\n[00:40.88]I’m not afraid\n[00:46.22]Who are the judges?\n[00:51.06]Why should I ever really care?\n[00:54.86]Tell me\n[00:56.18]Who are the judges?\n[01:00.62]Ones who think they can act unfair\n[01:04.70]I’ll make them come\n[01:08.40]To watch me win\n[01:10.74]And this will be my biggest prize\n[01:15.16]Let me have some\n[01:18.76]Joy within\n[01:20.88]No more things left here to despise\n[01:26.00]I’m not afraid\n[01:49.22]Yeah I’ll be heard in the night\n[01:56.78]Cos any voice sounds right this hour\n[02:00.70]No need to shout,creep and fight\n[02:06.38]Each heart now has a greatest power\n[02:11.80]We’re not afraid\n[02:14.62]Who are the judges?\n[02:27.98]Who are the judges?\n', '/stream/2305427'),
