e that?\n[01:56.06]Is it my fault? Is it my fault?\n[01:59.80]If you would just listen and\n[02:01.94]Stop being distant then\n[02:03.94]Things could be different I know\n[02:06.64]If you would just listen and\n[02:10.00]Stop being distant then\n[02:11.98]Things could be different\n[02:13.84]Things could be different\n[02:15.60]If you would just listen and\n[02:18.00]Stop being distant then\n[02:19.96]Things could be different I know\n[02:22.98]If you would just listen and\n[02:26.00]Stop being distant then\n[02:27.48]Things could be different\n[02:29.78]Things could be different\n[02:32.06]What you want now, you want now\n[02:34.52]Cutting through all my wounds, all my wounds\n[02:38.88]What you want now, you want now\n[02:42.80]Cutting through all my wounds, all all my wounds\n', '/stream/1858313'),
