one...\n[01:57.54]You can\'t stop my return\n[01:57.58]I\'m feeling like a champion\n[01:57.64]So many things that I\'ve been through\n[01:57.65]and I finally came beyond\n[01:57.66]Some deficits I was born with\n[02:13.56]and some I made myself\n[02:15.24]I screwed up my own life\n[02:17.44]I didn\'t need your help\n[02:18.88]Called you back on the pager\n[02:21.16]The sound went beep beep beep\n[02:23.34]S O S and 911 but still won’t hear a peep\n[02:26.42]Just last week I was gone\n[02:28.74]and you had no idea\n[02:30.72]And now I\'m hiding in plain sight\n[02:32.56]not one single tear\n[02:33.90]Down my cheek, another week\n[02:36.18]and things just start to change\n[02:38.38]Brand new mission\n[02:39.18]And I\'m wishing for someone else to blame\n[02:41.36]It\'s all the same, only if that were true\n[02:45.24]Sideways glances, second chances\n[02:47.56]It all comes back to you\n[02:48.82]What to do, I\'m stranded\n[02:51.02]on an island I created\n[02:53.08]It doesn\'t matter what I do\n[02:55.58]This was fated\n[02:56.60]Look up see the eyes of a monster\n[02:59.02]Things get clearer\n[03:00.50]It\'s at that moment that I realize\n[03:02.70]I\'m looking in a mirror\n[03:05.40]Everything has gone wrong.\n', '/stream/1350712'),
