(1825018, 535706, 'Одеяло', '心碎情歌，回忆背叛与逝去的爱。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=198898&width=300&trackid=1825018', '[00:04.58]Я бы хотела время вспять повернуть:\n[00:08.96]Новый сюжет, в мир без тебя заглянуть.\n[00:13.28]Я не могу понять, когда все пошло не так.\n[00:17.64]И бьется сердце с твоим не в такт.\n[00:22.00]Я в жизни лучшая - ты так меня убеждал,\n[00:26.36]Но волей случая пришел нам финал.\n[00:30.78]Другая ворвалась в наш мир всем своим идеалом.\n[00:35.06]И вас накрыло под моим одеялом.\n[00:39.22]Ну а теперь ты слезно просишь тебя простить,\n[00:43.74]Я не могу подо-до-добного допустить.\n[00:48.16]Прошла любовь, ты перестал быть моим идеалом,\n[00:52.62]Когда летал с другой под тем одеялом.\n[00:59.14]Зачем пишу тебе я это письмо?\n[01:03.52]Все вроде бы давным-давно решено.\n[01:06.94]Во мне по-прежнему двоякие чувства,\n[01:12.20]Вместо любви там, к сожалению, пусто.\n[01:16.64]Перемешалось все - в башке винегрет.\n[01:20.76]Могли представить (ну конечно же нет),\n[01:24.72]Что с нами приключится UnHappyEnd.\n[01:29.18]Кто в этом виноват? Ты дай мне ответ.\n[01:34.08]Ну а теперь ты слезно просишь тебя простить,\n[01:38.32]Я не могу подо-до-добного допустить.\n[01:42.66]Прошла любовь, ты перестал быть моим идеалом,\n[01:47.14]Когда летал с другой под тем одеялом.\n[01:53.26]Ууу...\n[01:54.44]Ты перестал быть моим идеалом\n[01:58.54]Ммм...\n[02:03.52]Когда летал с другой под одеялом.\n[02:08.42]Ммм...\n[02:11.98]Ууу...\n[02:13.58]Я бы хотела время вспять повернуть:\n[02:19.02]Новый сюжет, в мир без тебя заглянуть.\n[02:23.82]Я не могу понять, когда все пошло не так.\n[02:28.54]И бьется сердце с твоим не в такт.\n[02:32.92]Я в жизни лучшая - ты так меня убеждал,\n[02:37.26]Но волей случая пришел нам финал.\n[02:41.70]Другая ворвалась в наш мир всем своим идеалом.\n[02:45.90]И вас накрыло под моим одеялом.\n[02:50.38]Ну а теперь ты слезно просишь тебя простить,\n[02:54.72]Я не могу подо-до-добного допустить.\n[02:59.18]Прошла любовь, ты перестал быть моим идеалом,\n[03:03.52]Когда летал с другой под тем одеялом.\n', '/stream/1825018'),
(2314277, 597553, 'Brighton Streets', '民谣吟唱孤独徘徊与爱恨纠缠的街头记忆。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=631379&width=300&trackid=2314277', '[00:02.48]I wandered lonely as a skunk,\n[00:07.42]Sometimes demented,\n[00:09.30]sometimes drunk,\n[00:11.06]Like a frightened fox at the height of the Hun,\n[00:15.48]Running from a girl called Anne,\n[00:18.45]Running from a girl called Anne.\n[00:23.06]I loved and loathed and loved her more,\n[00:26.22]She played the saint,\n[00:27.98]I played the boar,\n[00:30.00]Every bloody day, a bloody war,\n[00:34.62]Running from a girl called Anne,\n[00:37.37]Running from a girl called Anne.\n[00:41.94]Some days we swam,\n[00:45.26]Some days we drowned,\n[00:48.78]While brightened streets never made a sound.\n[00:55.58]Some days we died,\n[00:59.02]Some days we lived,\n[01:02.42]Until we had nothing left to give.\n[01:09.36]Some days we drowned,\n[01:12.78]Some days we swam,\n[01:15.76]Those brightened streets never gave a damn.\n[01:23.02]Some days we lived,\n[01:26.48]Some days we died,\n[01:29.96]Only God knows how we ever survived.\n[01:36.80]I wandered lonely as a sea,\n[01:40.02]Searching for a sail that would set me free,\n[01:43.60]From the vicious ship destroying me.\n[01:48.12]Running from a girl called Anne,\n[01:51.15]Running from a girl called Anne.\n[02:14.76]Some days we swam,\n[02:17.84]Some days we drowned,\n[02:21.34]While brightened streets never made a sound.\n[02:28.18]Some days we died,\n[02:31.64]Some days we lived,\n[02:35.02]Until we had nothing left to give.\n[02:42.24]Some days we drowned,\n[02:45.34]Some days we swam,\n[02:48.76]Those brightened streets never gave a damn.\n[02:55.60]Some days we lived,\n[02:59.10]Some days we died,\n[03:02.54]Only God knows how we ever survived.\n[03:09.68]I met Icarus, I had to fall and fall,\n[03:12.56]She laughed in scorn,\n[03:14.34]Then slept with Paul,\n[03:16.18]A heart as cold as any Hadrian\'s wall.\n[03:20.94]Running from a girl called Anne,\n[03:23.68]Running from a girl called Anne.\n[03:28.34]I wandered lonely as a clown, A drunken oaf\n[03:33.52]for Brighton town,\n[03:34.86]But though she tried,\n[03:36.64]she never tore me down.\n[03:39.86]Running from a girl called Anne,\n[03:42.45]Running from a girl called Anne.\n[03:47.08]Some days we swam,\n[03:50.42]Some days we drowned,\n[03:53.92]While brightened streets never made a sound.\n[04:00.74]Some days we died,\n[04:04.26]Some days we lived,\n[04:07.58]Until we had nothing left to give.\n[04:11.01]Some\n[04:14.52]days we drowned,\n[04:17.90]Some days we swam,\n[04:20.40]Those brightened streets never gave a damn.\n[04:28.18]Some days we lived,\n[04:31.68]Some days we died,\n[04:35.18]Only God knows how we ever survived.\n[04:42.04]Only God knows how we ever survived.\n[04:48.90]Only God knows how we ever survived.\n', '/stream/2314277'),
(1705763, 519842, 'La cenere', '意大利独立民谣，诉说离别与灰烬般的思念', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=189366&width=300&trackid=1705763', '[00:06.56]LA CENERE\n[00:06.58]E’ il tuo modo di farti sentire\n[00:12.64]la tua assenza che resta\n[00:17.44]è una partenza che sopravvive al ritorno\n[00:23.54]un ritorno che non sopravvive alla partenza\n[00:31.54]E’ una ragione che non asciuga la paura\n[00:38.32]una paura che non si arrende alla ragione\n[00:42.58]è una scusa giunta solo dopo\n[00:43.70]la costruzione di nuovi equilibri\n[00:54.64]e adesso\n[00:57.36]Io vivo come se\n[00:59.08]la cenere potesse essere\n[01:02.72]incandescente per sempre\n[01:07.68]adesso\n[01:10.22]E’ il mio modo di lasciarti andare\n[01:12.96]la mia presenza che non si fa sentire\n[01:15.60]è una partenza che certo avrà il suo ritorno\n[01:18.34]un ritorno che forse saprà ridare\n[01:18.60]un senso al tempo\n[01:18.61]E’ una scusa amara\n[01:20.30]perché utile solo alla comprensione\n[01:20.31]perché nella mia lista dei desideri\n[01:20.32]mancava la voce avere ragione\n[01:20.33]Io vivo come se\n[01:20.34]la cenere potesse essere\n[01:20.35]incandescente per sempre\n[01:29.64]adesso\n[01:38.02]E vorrei chiedermi dove sono\n[01:53.70]ma riesco solo a chiedermi dove sei\n[02:01.14]tu sei qui ma resti altrove\n[02:01.84]perché vorrei riflettermi su ciò che mi circonda\n[02:06.82]ma riesco solo a girare attorno\n[02:08.26]a ciò che si riflette su di me\n[02:08.27]perché manco pure a me stesso\n[03:08.92]adesso\n', '/stream/1705763'),
(2230964, 475967, 'Igor Pumphonia - Maze', '深邃电子节拍营造迷幻氛围，人声采样重复星球大战。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=592692&width=300&trackid=2230964', '[00:33.12]Star Wars\n[00:41.40]Star Wars\n[00:42.72]Star Wars\n[00:54.04]Star Wars\n[00:59.68]Star Wars\n[01:39.01]Star Wars Star Wars\n[01:57.00]Star Wars Star Wars Star Wars\n[02:57.28]The\n[03:30.54]Thank you.\n', '/stream/2230964'),
(2307588, 495572, 'Gravity', '失重般坠入电子律动，在鼓打贝斯中释放自我。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=628485&width=300&trackid=2307588', '[00:07.88](VERSE)\n[00:10.90]Nothing left to hold or prove\n[00:15.96]Just the sound pulling me to you\n[00:22.18]Every doubt is falling through\n[00:26.74]When the sound pulls me to you\n[00:32.30](PRECHORUS)\n[00:32.46]We\'re rising up\n[00:34.38]Surrender till we lose our souls\n[00:37.42]No turning back\n[00:39.84]We\'re weightless in the gravity, gravity\n[00:44.44](HOOK)\n[00:44.80]Grav- Grav- Gravity We\'re losing Grav- Grav- Gravity\n[00:48.80]Grav- Grav- Gravity We\'re losing Grav- Grav- Gravity\n[00:53.88]Grav- Grav- Gravity We\'re losing Grav- Grav- Gravity\n[00:54.40]Grav- Grav- Gravity We\'re losing Grav- Grav- Gravity\n[00:59.84](CHORUS)\n[01:05.84]We\'re rising up\n[01:07.46]Surrender till we lose our souls\n[01:11.32]No turning back\n[01:13.50]We\'re weightless in the gravity, gravity\n[01:16.90]We\'re rising up\n[01:18.88]Surrender till we lose our souls\n[01:22.40]No turning back\n[01:24.66]We\'re weightless in the gravity, gravity\n[01:28.76](VERSE 2)\n[01:29.96]We\'re weightless in the gravity, gravity\n[01:31.46]Watch the colours turn to blue\n[01:31.47]Breaking everything we knew\n[01:32.42]Let the sky come into view\n[01:33.56]While the sound pulls me to you\n[02:01.69](CHORUS)\n[02:01.70]We\'re rising up\n[02:03.15]Surrender till we lose our souls\n[02:07.12]No turning back\n[02:09.32]We\'re weightless in the gravity, gravity\n[02:12.67]We\'re rising up\n[02:14.79]Surrender till we lose our souls\n[02:17.77]No turning back\n[02:20.35]We\'re weightless in the gravity, gravity\n[02:23.79](POSTCHORUS)\n[02:24.11]We\'re rising up\n[02:26.63]Surrender till we lose our souls\n[02:29.57]No turning back\n[02:32.35]We\'re weightless in the gravity, gravity\n[02:35.23]We\'re rising up\n[02:37.75]Surrender till we lose our souls\n[02:41.47]No turning back\n[02:43.93]We\'re weightless in the gravity, gravity\n[02:47.27](HOOK)\n[02:47.67]Grav- Grav- Gravity We\'re losing Grav- Grav- Gravity\n[02:51.57]Grav- Grav- Gravity We\'re losing Grav- Grav- Gravity\n[02:57.11]Grav- Grav- Gravity We\'re losing Grav- Grav- Gravity\n[03:02.79]Grav- Grav- Gravity We\'re losing Grav- Grav- Gravity\n[03:08.31](OUTRO)\n[03:09.57]We\'re rising up\n[03:10.13]Surrender till we lose our souls\n[03:14.15]No turning back\n[03:15.95]We\'re weightless in the gravity, gravity\n', '/stream/2307588'),
(2306274, 600977, 'I was not born to live in a body (Родилась не для жизни в теле)', '俄语女声吟唱灵魂与身体的裂痕，神秘而忧郁。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=627751&width=300&trackid=2306274', '[00:19.30]21. "Трещина в реальности"\n[00:19.31]Родилась не для жизни в теле,\n[00:22.64]А для преломления лучей.\n[00:26.96]Всё как будто в карусели,\n[00:30.34]Среди обычных серых дней.\n[00:33.04]Внутри неё с рожденья трещина,\n[00:37.10]И через этот тонкий скол\n[00:39.80]Струилась сила, что обещана,\n[00:43.86]Но груз её был так тяжёл.\n[00:47.04]Держала свет и тьму кромешную,\n[00:50.82]И ясность мысли, злую боль.\n[00:53.96]Она была немного грешною,\n[00:57.74]Играя заданную роль.\n[01:02.00]Она была прозрачной каплей,\n[01:07.80]В густом и вязком мире сна.\n[01:11.38]Не отражалась в зеркалах\n[01:14.42]Чужая всем, всегда одна.\n[01:18.28]Её не то чтобы не поняли,\n[01:21.76]Её не видели почти.\n[01:25.12]Зачем её сюда прогнали,\n[01:29.38]Сказав заранее «прости»?\n[01:33.52]И тело стало разрушаться,\n[01:38.50]Не от болезни, просто так.\n[01:53.92]Структура начала сушиться,\n[01:57.22]Подав всего лишь один знак.\n[02:00.70]Сценарий вёл её к финалу,\n[02:04.50]Где смерть — лишь точка для рывка.\n[02:07.94]Но вдруг в пространстве что то встало\n[02:10.98]Возникло новое начало\n[02:14.78]И снова что то зазвучало\n[02:18.28]Плечи расправились, слегка\n[02:21.08]Не бог, не демон, не спасенье —\n[02:24.98]А просто сдвиг среди теней.\n[02:28.32]Как будто кто-то вне теченья\n[02:31.44]Разжал застывший круг камней.\n[02:35.36]Не голос — нет, не зов, не память,\n[02:38.76]А трещина в законе снов,\n[02:42.26]Где можно было вновь расплавить\n[02:45.70]Заледеневший свод основ.\n[02:49.04]Она не стала кем-то новым,\n[03:11.74]Не возвратилась, не ушла.\n[03:15.94]А просто рухнули обеты,\n[03:19.54]Где раньше пряталась душа.\n[03:23.48]Теперь в ней нет ни форм, ни цели,\n[03:26.80]Ни оправданий, ни вины.\n[03:30.18]В ней — только трещина в пределе,\n[03:35.30]Где раньше были фальшь и сны.\n', '/stream/2306274'),
(2021785, 554338, 'Jazz Vocal Jam 2', '爵士人声演绎经典A列车，轻快摇摆，纽约情怀。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=516732&width=300&trackid=2021785', '[00:00.44]One, two, three, four.\n[00:30.32]Listen to the thrill, the thrumlin\'.\n[00:34.26]On board, get down that A train.\n[00:39.34]Soon you will be on Sugar Hill and Highland.\n[00:43.90]You must, you must take that A train\n[00:48.42]to go to Sugar Hill way up in Highland.\n[00:53.54]If you miss the A train,\n[00:57.30]you\'ll find the means to pick a train.\n[00:59.90]And I\'m worried.\n[01:03.32]Forget on board, it\'s coming.\n[01:06.96]Can you hear the thrill, the thrumlin\'?\n[01:11.82]Only for that A train.\n[01:15.38]Soon you\'ll be on Sugar Hill and Highland.\n[01:19.60]When I\'m in New York City,\n[01:21.88]I go see theater.\n[01:23.60]I love Danny White, T-shirt city, love me too.\n[01:28.17]And maybe I hear the shout,\n[01:30.80]then all the bad,\n[01:32.02]the new.\n[01:33.94]I go tight, see, I go see Miss Liberty.\n[01:38.32]Breaking trains, a legal divide.\n[01:40.34]Hospitals are my favorite place.\n[01:42.90]New York starts breathing new.\n[01:44.46]This is where I\'m meant to be.\n[01:45.80]I got so much to see in New York City.\n[01:50.44]May we all need to take the A train to\n[01:52.58]go to Sugar Hill way up in Highland.\n[02:40.67]Bum,\n[02:40.94]ba,\n[02:41.24]da,\n[02:41.38]da,\n[02:41.70]bum,\n[02:41.94]bum,\n[02:42.22]bum,\n[02:42.58]bum,\n[02:42.72]do,\n[02:42.98]do,\n[02:43.18]do,\n[02:43.26]do,\n[02:43.50]do.\n[02:44.12]Ba,\n[02:44.38]da,\n[02:44.54]ba,\n[02:44.78]da,\n[02:45.10]do,\n[02:45.24]do,\n[02:45.56]ba,\n[02:45.66]da,\n[02:45.80]bum,\n[02:46.22]bum,\n[02:46.38]do,\n[02:46.58]do,\n[02:46.84]do,\n[02:46.90]do,\n[02:46.91]do,\n[02:47.08]bum,\n[02:47.34]bum,\n[02:47.82]bum,\n[02:48.10]bum,\n[02:48.34]bum,\n[02:48.40]bum,\n[02:48.44]bum,\n[02:48.50]do.\n[02:49.34]Hurry,\n[02:50.30]get on board, get on board, it\'s coming.\n[02:53.72]Can you hear the thrill, the thrumlin\'?\n[02:59.58]Only for that A train.\n[03:02.68]Soon you\'ll be on Sugar Hill and Highland.\n[03:07.74]Bum, ba, da, da, bum, bum, bum, bum, bum, bum.\n', '/stream/2021785'),
(2337603, 593138, 'Into The Flame', '黑金属咆哮中直面毁灭与烈焰的宿命。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=643599&width=300&trackid=2337603', '[01:27.10]They tried to end the violence\n[01:37.32]And put an end to pain\n[01:45.78]They\'ve found their rest in silence\n[01:58.80]We\'ll never meet again\n[03:14.04]No time to rot in sorrow,\n[03:25.00]There\'s no one else to blame\n[03:33.12]We\'ll all be gone tomorrow\n[03:42.82]We all will see the flame\n', '/stream/2337603'),
(964536, 424916, 'Baiser d\'amoureux', '一首法语爵士情歌，诉说恋人之间温柔而甜蜜的初吻时刻。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=113423&width=300&trackid=964536', '[00:20.70]Baiser d\'amoureux\n[00:20.71]je vois ton ombre portée, ton sourire gêné\n[00:28.80]et la flamme qui s\'agite dans ton regard braisé\n[00:37.94]plus rien tout disparait juste le bruit de nos coeurs\n[00:47.36]qui se battent et se frappent l\'un tout contre l\'autre\n[00:56.20]une guerre de silence\n[01:12.66]tu vois mes cheveux frisés, mes yeux effrayés\n[01:23.12]et mon coeur qui se noie dans tes mots enchantés\n[01:32.96]au loin le soleil couchant n\'ose pas nous déranger\n[01:42.08]il ne manque plus rien peut être un tapis volant\n[01:50.38]et pourquoi pas\n[01:56.80]oh oui je crois\n[02:00.76]que tout est là\n[02:07.36]oh non jamais\n[02:09.48]je n\'voudrais un autre que toi\n[02:16.60]oh oui je vois\n[02:21.26]que tu es là\n[02:24.42]oh oui pour toujours\n[02:27.80]je n\'voudrais vivre que ça\n[02:40.41]je sens que tu le sais à 200%\n[02:48.05]j\'attends et toi tu fais comme celui qui comprend\n[02:57.49]tu viens tout près de moi et le temps suspendu\n[03:06.05]nous offre le plus beau des cadeaux jamais vus\n[03:13.35]un baiser d\'amoureux\n[03:13.36]oh oui je crois\n[03:25.73]que tout est là\n[03:31.09]oh non jamais\n[03:34.35]je n\'voudrais un autre que toi\n[03:41.59]oh oui je vois\n[03:44.75]que tu es là\n[03:49.31]oh oui pour toujours\n[03:53.11]je n\'voudrais vivre que ça\n', '/stream/964536'),
(1537067, 508143, 'My Favorite Song', '戴上耳机听最爱歌曲，忘却烦恼，重拾好心情。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=272734&width=300&trackid=1537067', '[00:00.90]When the world acts crazy\n[00:02.68]Is when I need you the most\n[00:05.08]When everything gets so busy\n[00:07.78]And I can barely move my toes\n[00:10.00]I know it\'s time to unwind\n[00:11.96]Leave my wars and worries outside\n[00:14.96]Plug it in, turn it on\n[00:17.32]Turn it up, sing-a-long\n[00:19.68]When the subway gets crowded\n[00:21.96]And I\'m on my way home\n[00:24.26]It\'s like my body\'s surrounded\n[00:26.78]It\'s a cue to find my phone\n[00:29.08]Cause it\'s time to unwind\n[00:30.78]Leave the noise and the talking outside\n[00:33.30]Plug it in, turn it on\n[00:35.26]Turn it up, sing-a-long\n[00:38.44]I close my eyes\n[00:40.86]I\'m feeling good\n[00:42.96]My favorite song plays\n[00:45.40]And again, I am hooked\n[00:47.46](chorus)\n[00:49.48]"I didn\'t know I could feel that way\n[00:51.74]When you kissed me the other day\n[00:54.14]Suddenly it was a fairytale, oh oh\n[00:57.52]Made a wish to a shooting star\n[01:01.10]Now look at us, look at where we are\n[01:03.60]Livin’ life, like a fairyrtale, oh oh"\n[01:07.58]Plug it in, turn it on\n[01:10.24]Plug it in, turn it on, oh oh\n[01:24.50]When my mind’s unhappy\n[01:26.30]For reasons I don’t know\n[01:28.54]I really need something catchy\n[01:31.18]To get me back into my zone\n[01:33.64]I know it\'s time to unwind\n[01:35.50]Be alone, leave the bad things outside\n[01:38.48]Plug it in, turn it on\n[01:40.88]Turn it up, sing-a-long\n[01:43.16]I close my eyes\n[01:45.58]I\'m feeling good\n[01:47.84]My favorite song plays\n[01:50.30]And again, I am hooked\n[01:52.82](chorus)\n[01:53.88]"I didn\'t know I could feel that way\n[01:56.68]When you kissed me the other day\n[01:58.82]Suddenly it was a fairytale, oh oh\n[02:02.30]Made a wish to a shooting star\n[02:05.88]Now look at us, look at where we are\n[02:08.42]Livin’ life, like a fairyrtale, oh oh"\n[02:12.38]Plug it in, turn it on\n[02:14.94]Plug it in, turn it on, oh\n[02:16.82]Plug it in, turn it on\n[02:19.62]Plug it in, turn it on, oh oh\n[02:32.68]When a day turns bad\n[02:34.54]When I’m feeling sad\n[02:37.00]When it’s all too much\n[02:39.38]The worst I’ve had\n[02:41.70]I close my eyes\n[02:44.36]I\'m feeling good\n[02:46.36]My favorite song plays\n[02:48.96]And again, I am cured\n[02:51.12](chorus)\n[02:51.24]"I didn\'t know I could feel that way\n[02:55.28]When you kissed me the other day\n[02:57.68]Suddenly it was a fairytale, oh oh\n[03:01.34]Made a wish to a shooting star\n[03:04.64]Now look at us, look at where we are\n[03:07.20]Livin’ life, like a fairyrtale, oh oh"\n[03:18.76]“Made a wish to a shooting star\n[03:23.44]Now look at us, look at where we are\n[03:26.00]Livin’ life, like a fairyrtale, oh oh"\n[03:31.38]Plug it in, turn it on, oh oh\n[03:34.20]Plug it in, turn it on\n[03:36.20]Plug it in, turn it on, oh oh\n[03:39.38]Plug it in, turn it on\n[03:41.12]Plug it in, turn it on, oh oh\n[03:53.98]Plug it in, turn it on\n[03:56.12]Plug it in, turn it on, oh oh oh\n', '/stream/1537067'),
(1703922, 5324, 'Seul', '独居男子在音乐与酒精中咀嚼孤独与失落。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=189205&width=300&trackid=1703922', '[00:41.76]Seul - Franck Mouzon - 19xx\n[00:41.77]On va, on vient autour de toi,\n[00:45.48]on dit bonjour, comment ça va...\n[00:51.38]Fini le boulot, tu rentres chez toi,\n[00:55.10]tu r\'ferme la porte derrière tes pas.\n[01:00.40]Tu repense aux gens que \'t\'a côtoyés,\n[01:06.94]tu te dis que c\'est sur, on va sonner,\n[01:11.64]mais tu peux toujours rêver,\n[01:15.40]personne viendra te déranger.\n[01:34.62]Alors tu r\'mets de la musique,\n[01:38.06]t\'évites ce qui blues et ce qui pique,\n[01:41.08]tu penses aux gens que t\'as pas revus,\n[01:44.58]tu penses à ceux que t\'as perdus...\n[02:15.54]Alors tu r\'fermes l\'album photo,\n[02:19.36]pour oublier que t\'es personne,\n[02:24.80]et tu descends jusqu\'au bistrot,\n[02:29.70]et plus tu bois, plus tu t\'isoles...\n[03:32.34]Alors tu r\'fermes l\'album photo,\n[03:35.02]pour oublier que t\'as personne,\n[03:39.78]Alors tu r\'fermes l\'album photo,\n[03:46.46]pour oublier que t\'as personne.\n[04:13.10]On va, on vient autour de toi,\n[04:16.60]on dit bonjour, comment ça va.\n', '/stream/1703922'),
(1336999, 489183, 'Gravity', '女声低吟爱与挣扎，欲放手却难舍的深情告白。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=215183&width=300&trackid=1336999', '[00:15.40]why why why i feel that gain\n[00:21.28]why i feel that strange\n[00:27.54]play and hide prooves\n[00:33.32]blind and shy moves\n[00:37.02]take a risk for me\n[00:40.34]make a step finally\n[00:44.12]I’m not standing on your way\n[00:49.24]When you want to play\n[00:52.92]Sometimes I just can’t breath without you\n[00:58.68]I’m not standing on your way\n[01:03.72]When you want to play\n[01:07.68]Sometimes I just want to hide you from me\n[01:13.60]How how how\n[01:17.94]I finally found\n[01:20.28]I’m gonna sing it starting over over and over\n[01:22.28]They won’t fill my life with requirements of the consumer crowd\n[01:22.52]I\'d rather die\n[01:59.18]’m not standing on your way\n[02:04.82]When you want to play\n[02:08.58]Sometimes I just can’t breath without you\n[02:14.40]I’m not standing on your way\n[02:19.86]When you want to play\n[02:23.18]Sometimes I just want to hide you from me\n[02:29.22]’m not standing on your way\n[02:29.64]When you want to play\n[02:29.65]Sometimes I just won\'t breath without you\n[02:29.66]I’m not standing on your way\n[02:29.67]When you want to play\n[02:29.68]Sometimes I just can\'t  hide you from me\n[02:29.69]How how how\n', '/stream/1336999'),
(2169223, 370210, 'Radici', '意大利语歌曲，以树根隐喻人生旅程与爱之考验。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=565914&width=300&trackid=2169223', '[00:22.50]Ci sono alberi che hanno radici profonde\n[00:28.30]e non li puoi abbattere se non ne conosci la gioventù,\n[00:36.76]non danno i frutti sperati, niente fiori colorati,\n[00:45.30]ma danno ossigeno alla vita\n[00:49.76]sui dirupi del mondo.\n[00:53.46]Così ci sono persone che nel profondo del silenzio,\n[01:00.22]con viaggi lunghi e rubati si troveranno di fronte a te,\n[01:08.96]avranno fronti sudate e facce di denti bianchi\n[01:15.64]che danno ossigeno alla vita, ai confini del mondo,\n[01:22.80]sui dirupi del mondo.\n[01:28.16]La punta è già diretta a nord\n[01:32.08]non resta che lasciarsi andare\n[01:35.90]al dolce dondolio del mare,\n[01:39.84]alla tempesta di tante ore,\n[01:43.76]come se fosse una guerra,\n[01:47.60]l\'eterna lotta tra odio e amore\n[01:50.14]che non sai da che parte sta\n[01:54.10]da questa parte o dall\'altra,\n[01:58.16]su questa riva o sull\'altra.\n[02:41.72]Le stelle sono cadenti come speranze da salvare,\n[02:48.42]il vento caldo notturno come un motore discreto e cieco,\n[02:56.96]si sente ancora l\'odore della terra nuda e secca,\n[03:04.64]non si dimentica un giorno\n[03:07.64]tanto meno una vita.\n[03:11.74]E più si allungano i viaggi e più si allungano le radici\n[03:19.28]che porti dentro di te, che affonderai nella nuova terra,\n[03:28.42]questa nuova compagna che non sai se ti nutrirà,\n[03:35.48]se sarà amica oppure ostile\n[03:39.68]sarà questo il bivio, sarà una prova d\'amore.\n[03:46.18]Devi solo lasciare che sia....\n[03:50.96]come fosse un nuovo giorno\n[04:01.58]che un giorno capirai\n[04:09.14]e quel giorno amerai.\n', '/stream/2169223'),
(1612373, 378695, 'Catch Up to Me', '合成器流行舞曲，追逐奔跑的霓虹能量。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=267023&width=300&trackid=1612373', '[00:11.26]Measure progress in miles,\n[00:14.00]Keep the aliens at bay.\n[00:16.96]Cause happiness is a feeling,\n[00:20.16]When I\'m far enough away.\n[00:23.20]Even this fascination,\n[00:26.06]Is a thing I only know,\n[00:29.02]Cause I\'m gone by the morning,\n[00:32.26]Hurry up, it\'s time to go.\n[00:34.86]Catch up to me now,\n[00:37.84]I\'m only gonna run you know that.\n[00:40.90]Catch up to me now,\n[00:43.74]I\'ve got these monsters at my back.\n[00:47.22]Up to me, up to me, up to me.\n[00:52.86]Catch up to me, up to me, up to me.\n[00:58.04]I will speed through this city,\n[01:03.12]I\'ll go tearing down the line.\n[01:04.20]Feel that blood hit my eardrums,\n[01:04.21]The perfect neon high.\n[01:06.50]I\'m your gold party angel,\n[01:06.51]I\'m the fastest thing you know.\n[01:29.02]So come on, so come on now,\n[01:32.42]Hurry up it\'s time to go.\n[01:34.88]Catch up to me now,\n[01:37.84]I\'m only gonna run you know that.\n[01:40.62]Catch up to me now,\n[01:43.76]I\'ve got these monsters at my back.\n[01:47.22]Up to me, up to me, up to me.\n[01:52.66]Catch up to me, up to me, up to me.\n[02:23.12]Catch up to me now,\n[02:24.80]I\'m only gonna run you know that.\n[02:28.86]Catch up to me now,\n[02:31.76]I\'ve got these monsters at my back.\n[02:35.14]Up to me, up to me, up to me.\n[02:40.80]Catch up to me, up to me, up to me.\n', '/stream/1612373'),
(1959708, 545122, '8 минут (Тысяч солнц прощальный крик) [Игорь Николаев Trance Cover]', '电子翻唱经典，警示战争八分钟毁灭世界', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=489062&width=300&trackid=1959708', '[00:31.46]Город земной застыл в ночи\n[00:35.16]Видит цветные сны\n[00:38.72]Радостный мир, где всё учли\n[00:41.84]Где не хотят войны\n[00:46.06]Век на Земле настал иной\n[00:49.22]В прошлом раскол систем\n[00:52.02]Все идут тропой одной\n[00:55.56]И словно нет проблем\n[00:59.98]Прячут лучи весны\n[01:03.12]Грозную тень войны,\n[01:07.08]Ты не спеши наивно верить\n[01:10.78]Что все вопросы уже решены...\n[01:15.02]* * *\n[01:30.50]Есть много споров на Земле\n[01:33.98]Как обустроить жизнь\n[01:37.82]Стали техничней и взрослей\n[01:40.86]Битвы вождей за приз\n[01:45.18]Время придёт, и новый спор\n[01:48.30]Насмерть расколет нас\n[01:51.26]И огнём зальёт простор,\n[01:54.66]Не удержав баланс\n[01:58.32]Всего лишь 8 минут летит ракета в ночи\n[02:01.90]И пламя адской свечи в пустоте несёт\n[02:05.62]Всего лишь 8 минут - итог случайных причин,\n[02:09.52]Никто на помощь тебе уже не придёт\n[02:13.74]Плачут цветы весны\n[02:17.14]Не допусти войны,\n[02:21.02]Чтоб никогда секундомеры\n[02:24.50]В 8 минут не сожгли наши сны\n[02:28.02]* * *\n[02:28.64]Спит и ответчик и истец\n[03:31.98]Спит и палач и врач\n[03:35.98]Спит моя мама, спит отец,\n[03:39.32]Сказочник и скрипач\n[03:43.40]Только хороших от плохих\n[03:46.56]Не отсечёт судьба\n[03:49.30]Тысяч солнц прощальный крик\n[03:52.66]Обречена борьба\n[03:56.48]Всего лишь 8 минут летит ракета в ночи\n[04:00.04]И пламя адской свечи в пустоте несёт\n[04:03.74]Всего лишь 8 минут - итог случайных причин,\n[04:07.66]Никто на помощь тебе уже не придёт\n[04:11.58]Манят цветы весны\n[04:15.08]В мир, где не ждут войны\n[04:18.94]Где никогда секундомеры\n[04:22.70]В 8 минут не сожгут наши сны\n[04:26.26]Музыка, текст - Игорь Николаев, Виктор Аргонов, вокал - Len\n[04:56.78]6. Призрачный рай [Unreal Space Cover]\n[04:58.44]Мы смотрели в сердца галактик чужих\n[04:58.74]У далёких светил искали мы жизнь\n[04:58.75]Миллионы миров на бескрайнем пути\n[04:59.26]Только призрачный Рай среди них не найти...\n', '/stream/1959708'),
(2165644, 515330, 'Dreamy Inspiration (short 1)', '轻柔人声与氛围旋律交织，营造梦幻怀旧的放松氛围。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=564197&width=300&trackid=2165644', '[00:01.46]¶¶\n[00:12.10]¶¶\n[00:40.00]¶¶ ¶¶\n[01:10.76]¶¶ ¶¶\n', '/stream/2165644'),
(1658149, 504167, 'Show Me', '在迷茫中寻求指引，渴望找到奋斗的人生。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=225132&width=300&trackid=1658149', '[00:15.26]Lyrics:\n[00:15.46]Verse 1:\n[00:15.47]Take my mind away\n[00:22.14]I feel to full of myself.\n[00:27.54]Help me to find my way\n[00:35.92]I know I’m better off then.\n[00:42.44]Pre Chorus 1:\n[00:42.70]I’m not foolish.\n[00:46.24]I’m not weak.\n[00:49.58]I just know, this is the way to what I seek.\n[00:55.94]Chorus:\n[00:57.46]Listen to my thoughts,\n[01:00.28]Listen to my doubts.\n[01:03.86]Listen to my questions and\n[01:06.70]Help me to let go.\n[01:10.80]Listen to my fears\n[01:13.58]Listen to my wishes and\n[01:16.96]Show me the life\n[01:20.42]I’m struggling for.\n[01:38.22]Verse 2:\n[01:38.23]I can be a leave,\n[01:42.56]Moving with the wind.\n[01:51.38]I can be a steady rock,\n[01:56.34]Staying where it is.\n[01:59.82]Pre Chorus 2:\n[02:05.08]I can be anything,\n[02:07.44]Always try to fulfill my dreams\n[02:11.12]Looking right, left and anywhere,\n[02:15.06]But I don’t know that it’s already there.\n[02:19.24]Chorus:\n[02:19.80]Listen to my thoughts,\n[02:22.86]Listen to my doubts.\n[02:26.18]Listen to my questions and\n[02:28.98]Help me to let go.\n[02:33.38]Listen to my fears\n[02:35.60]Listen to my wishes and\n[02:39.24]Show me the life\n[02:42.04]I’m struggling for.\n[02:59.58]Bridge:\n[02:59.66]I will be there to seek you,\n[03:05.82]Will you be there to find me.\n[03:13.74]Only my shadows follow me.\n[03:20.50]Only my shadows follow me.\n', '/stream/1658149'),
(2262663, 475967, 'Devout', '迷幻电子氛围曲，低吟浅唱中透出忧郁与孤独。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=607542&width=300&trackid=2262663', '[00:06.40]MANATHA\n[00:13.79]Travel these sound, while letting head devout\n[00:22.50]And then arise,\n[00:24.58]dust, and lies, no kiss\n[00:30.08]Travel this town while they\'re here to vote\n[00:37.48]Take a notch at the list\n[00:46.86]And still somehow\n[00:50.68]You\'ll be the funniest\n[00:54.44]And still somehow\n[00:58.16]You\'ll be the funniest Like this Like this\n[01:33.80]Like this Like this\n[02:00.62]Take a notch at the list And\n[02:11.28]still somehow You\'ll be the funniest And still\n[02:20.16]somehow\n[02:22.56]You\'ll be the funniest\n[02:27.00]Like this\n[02:27.22]And still somehow You\'ll be the funniest\n[02:32.45]And still somehow You\'ll be the funniest\n[02:39.64]Like this\n[03:02.20]Like this Like\n[03:15.90]this Like this Like this\n[03:26.52]Like this Like this Like this Like this Like this\n[03:53.10]Like this Like this Like this Like this Like this\n', '/stream/2262663'),
(2311697, 490580, 'Talk About Love', '夜色中邀你共舞，直白诉说爱意与渴望。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=630346&width=300&trackid=2311697', '[00:00.00]My name in your head. You gonna remember this night. Give me what I say you\'re doing everything, right? Trust me. I\'m with you tonight. We dance with the moon come through right now. I hope that I\'ll see you soon.\n[00:24.02]Let\'s talk about love tell me what do you like tell me where do you wanna see me naked.\n[00:37.92]All the things you said I\'m gonna do I just want you to come through, come through.\n[01:04.02]Let\'s talk about love, tell me what do you like Tell me why do you wanna see me naked.\n[01:12.01]Let\'s talk about love.\n[01:13.85]Tell me what do you like. Tell me where do you wanna see me naked.\n[01:36.01]My name in your head. You gon\' remember this night. Hear me when I say. You\'re doing everything right. Trust me, I\'m with you. Tonight we dance with the moon. Come through right now I hope that I\'ll see you soon.\n[02:08.27]Let\'s talk about love.\n[02:09.85]Tell me where do you lie. Tell me where do you wanna see me naked.\n[02:16.01]Let\'s talk about love.\n[02:17.89]Tell me where do you lie.\n[02:19.79]Tell me where do you wanna see me naked.\n[02:32.23]Let\'s talk about love.\n[02:35.67]Let\'s talk about love, love, love All the things you said I\'m gonna do. I just want you to come through, come through\n', '/stream/2311697'),
(2302009, 600977, 'He Comes with Silence - Он приходит с тишиной - Version - 2', '以静默降临，斩断毒波，揭示真实自我。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=625621&width=300&trackid=2302009', '[00:21.46]https://telegra.ph/ANTI-SISTEMA--ANTI-SYSTEM-10-16  (OLD)\n[00:24.88]https://telegra.ph/He-comes-with-silence--On-prihodit-s-tishinoj-10-18\n[00:26.54]8.? He comes with silence / Он приходит с тишиной\n[00:26.55]It comes with silence, not with dream,\n[00:28.54]Not with answers — just a gleam.\n[00:28.66]It comes as emptiness, standing near,\n[00:30.24]Face to face, dissolving fear.\n[00:34.56]It may seem that all will break,\n[00:38.12]That all you built will start to quake.\n[00:41.64]That you are burning, losing ground —\n[00:45.40]But truly, darkness falls around.\n[00:48.94]It’s not your body that begins to die,\n[00:52.50]Not your breath, not your inner light.\n[00:56.06]It’s the prison that starts to collapse,\n[00:58.74]Where you were hidden from your own sight,\n[01:02.78]Where your radiance lost its might.\n[01:05.90]I don’t heal, I don’t save,\n[01:07.68]I just cut every poisoned wave.\n[01:13.20]Those lines that called themselves the light,\n[01:16.86]Were feeding venom out of sight.\n[01:18.82]And when all that blocked you fades away,\n[01:24.74]You’ll see who was beneath the clay.\n[01:28.56]Not the “better,” not the “new” —\n[01:31.84]But the one who came from the void — the true.\n[01:36.98]Those who “helped” were building cells,\n[01:38.68]Those who “taught” made slaves as well.\n[01:40.52]Their “love” was just a handy brand,\n[01:42.42]Their “care” — a bitter, binding hand.\n[01:44.34]And now it all has fallen down,\n[01:45.98]Like plaster breaking off the wall.\n[01:47.82]What once was “truth,” revered, profound —\n[01:49.78]Was only Satan’s clever call.\n[01:52.30]I don’t heal, I don’t save,\n[01:55.56]I just cut every poisoned wave.\n[01:59.76]Those lines that called themselves the light,\n[02:03.28]Were feeding venom out of sight.\n[02:03.52]And when all that blocked you fades away,\n[02:10.80]You’ll see who was beneath the clay.\n[02:15.08]Not the “better,” not the “new” —\n[02:17.60]But the one who came from the void — the true.\n[02:23.82]You are not the light.\n[02:25.60]Not the dark.\n[02:27.48]Not a role.\n[02:29.44]You are the one who watches —\n[02:31.38]Without eyes.\n[02:33.16]Without words.\n[02:34.94]Without pain.\n[02:36.54]You are the one who left the chain.\n[02:40.46]You are the one who’ll never sleep.\n[02:44.32]You are the one where silence speaks deep.\n[03:08.34]8. Он приходит с тишиной\n[03:08.35]Он приходит с тишиной,\n[03:11.16]Не с ответом, не с мечтой.\n[03:11.46]Он приходит с пустотой,\n[03:11.47]Что стоит перед тобой.\n[03:13.88]Тебе кажется - всё ломается\n[03:13.89]Всё что было - идёт ко дну\n[03:14.72]Что якобы ты сгораешь, якобы теряешься\n', '/stream/2302009'),
(110207, 1205, 'Caught Inside A Dream', '慵懒电子爵士，低语呢喃中沉溺于与你共筑的梦境。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=13576&width=300&trackid=110207', '[00:06.12]Thank you.\n[00:30.74]Don\'t stop.\n[00:34.40]Keep going.\n[00:40.34]Just touch me.\n[00:46.36]Caught inside a dream.\n[00:53.10]With you and me.\n[00:57.98]And no one fails.\n[01:03.66]Caught inside a dream.\n[01:09.34]Caught inside a dream.\n[01:13.84]I don\'t want you to stop.\n[01:20.20]Just keep touching me.\n[01:25.76]Because I was too.\n[01:30.22]Caught inside\n[01:35.74]a dream.\n[02:19.08]Caught inside a dream.\n[02:27.64]Just keep doing what you do.\n[02:37.02]Just you and me.\n[02:39.40]I want you to stop what you do.\n[02:49.34]Caught inside a dream.\n[02:55.88]With just you and me.\n[03:12.65]Caught inside a dream.\n[03:17.60]With just you and me.\n[03:22.80]And all the birds.\n[03:27.62]Caught inside a dream.\n[03:40.80]And all the birds.\n[03:44.18]With just you and me.\n[03:51.96]And all the birds.\n[03:56.00]Caught inside a dream.\n[04:07.92]And all the birds.\n', '/stream/110207'),
