(1485420, 474132, 'Two Kids', '回忆年少恋情，感叹曾经相爱却最终分离。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=248755&width=300&trackid=1485420', '[00:09.42]Was it easy walking away?\n[00:13.86]Or was it hard when you found yourself outside?\n[00:18.44]Were you scared to start all over?\n[00:23.80]Or did you always know you would leave me behind?\n[00:27.88]Do you remember when all we had was us?\n[00:32.64]I thought that would always be enough.\n[00:37.30]Or were we just two kids with nothing else to do-\n[00:38.10]A little money in our pockets in a hurry to say, “I Love You”\n[00:45.98]Swearing that days last forever\n[00:49.62]Never thinking about the end.\n[00:51.00]As long as we were together,\n[00:52.16]We could make it through anything.\n[00:54.18]Now I gotta see you all through town\n[01:03.40]Standing next to him.\n[01:07.54]Does he know all your secrets?\n[01:12.34]And could he tell you all your dreams?\n[01:16.80]Do you remember when all we had was us?\n[01:21.20]I thought that would always be enough.\n[01:27.12]Or were we just two kids with nothing else to do-\n[01:29.60]A little money in our pockets in a hurry to say, “I Love You”\n[01:36.46]Swearing that days last forever\n[01:38.10]Never thinking about the end.\n[01:39.48]As long as we were together,\n[01:40.66]We could make it through anything.\n[01:42.66]But I knew my heart’s in trouble\n[01:51.54]When you were always out the door.\n[01:56.26]We set a spark in motion,\n[01:57.82]Could have been a flame\n[01:58.74]Light up the skyline, watch it fall away.\n[02:03.20]Yea, It could have been the real thing.\n[02:12.44]And now we’ve got ghosts to remind us both\n[02:17.56]How we, How we came so close\n[02:20.56]But I loved the feeling, you loved leaving.\n[03:27.82](Chorus)\n', '/stream/1485420'),
