(1576712, 509448, 'Fool\'s Gold', '夏日青春恋爱，纵情享受当下美好时光。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=266618&width=300&trackid=1576712', '[00:10.97]I like it when we talk slow, tell me everything you want to be\n[00:16.67]Baby, is it fool\'s gold? Something like a distant diamond ring...\n[00:22.85]I don\'t care where we go, I just wanna feel you in the breeze\n[00:28.82]We can do whatever, as long as i\'m with you and you\'re with me\n[00:35.18]I got a summertime feeling in my chest,\n[00:38.61]Right next to the lipstick marks you left\n[00:41.53]Tracing my fingers across your skin, singing can this last forever\n[00:47.34]I got a summertime feeling in my chest,\n[00:50.45]Right next to the lipstick marks you left\n[00:53.52]Tracing my fingers across your skin, singing can this last forever\n[01:02.66]We\'re drinking liquor and wine in the neighbor\'s lot\n[01:05.28]Shootin\' from the car, trying not to get caught\n[01:07.84]Singing can this night last\n[01:12.77]So we\'ll put her in park by the old food plot\n[01:15.76]Climb a tall pine tree, and we\'ll look at the stars\n[01:18.50]Singing, oh my god, is this love...\n[01:23.33]It\'s fool\'s gold\n[01:33.26]Now we\'re close together, living like we\'re two roads on a map\n[01:41.38]All this young glitter has a way of fading to the past\n[01:47.46]We\'ll be sunsetters, riding every wave no looking back\n[01:53.46]Staying untethered, not afraid of leaving what we had\n[01:59.50]I got a summertime feeling in my chest,\n[02:03.27]Right next to the lipstick marks you left\n[02:06.04]Tracing my fingers across your skin, singing can this last forever\n[02:14.70]We\'re drinking liquor and wine in the neighbor\'s lot\n[02:17.58]Shootin\' from the car, trying not to get caught\n[02:20.16]Singing can this night last\n[02:25.13]So we\'ll put her in park by the old food plot\n[02:28.11]Climb a tall pine tree, and we\'ll look at the stars\n[02:30.66]Singing, oh my god, is this love...\n[02:37.81]So let\'s live while we\'re young\n[02:39.48]Learning how to break free\n[02:41.21]From all that haunts us\n[02:44.17]Life is in the small things\n[02:46.68]It\'s a happenstance love\n[02:49.79]Keep me till the morning\n[02:51.87]When we both wake up\n[02:54.20]It\'ll be like we were dreaming...\n[02:57.04]Of drinking liquor and wine in the neighbor\'s lot\n[02:59.31]Shootin\' from the car, trying not to get caught\n[03:02.02]Singing can this night last\n[03:07.48]So we\'ll put her in park by the old food plot\n[03:10.41]Climb a tall pine tree, and we\'ll look at the stars\n[03:13.16]Singing, oh my god, is this love...\n[03:17.95]It\'s fool\'s gold\n', '/stream/1576712'),
(1706367, 524610, 'Alkatraz', '意大利说唱，诉说内心囚笼般的痛苦与挣扎。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=226760&width=300&trackid=1706367', '[00:18.48]Frate sono chiuso nella mia mente tipo Alcatraz\n[00:20.68]Vengo dall\'inferno frate eccomi qua\n[00:22.74]Disperato al punto tale, frate sai che sto male, non mi disturbare sono tra le sbarre tipo ad Alcatraz\n[00:27.12]La mia mente gira pensieri tipo canne, giro il mondo tipo l\'equatore stando seduto nel mio salone...pensieri girano, girano come le trottole..non credo più a nessuno, dicono solo frottole, pensa ad arrivare in alto con le scale e non con l\'ascensore che la fatica poi ti ricompenserà lo sforzo\n[00:54.80]In giro per le strade, immobilizzati come statue, in questo regno se non sei fregno paghi pegno, ma a differenza tua darkice gira solo col meglio, bada a te stesso che gli altri si arrangeranno\n[01:13.24]Frate sono chiuso nella mia mente tipo Alcatraz\n[01:15.48]Vengo dall\'inferno frate eccomi qua\n[01:17.70]Disperato al punto tale, frate sai che sto male, non mi disturbare sono tra le sbarre tipo ad Alcatraz\n[01:22.30]La soddisfazione é tanta quando arrivi in alto ma é maggiore se ti sei fatto il mazzo...mi sentivo solo, abbandonato, ma qualcosa dentro poi é scattato\n[01:38.16]sono partito con un cazzo, la voglia di spaccare il mondo era tanta, e l\'ho capito quando ho scoperto che la musica incanta, si fra incanta, dona emozioni sia ai più forti che ai teneroni\n[01:49.80]Frate sono chiuso nella mia mente tipo Alcatraz\n[01:51.88]Vengo dall\'inferno frate eccomi qua\n[01:53.98]Disperato al punto tale, frate sai che sto male, non mi disturbare sono tra le sbarre tipo ad Alcatraz\n[01:58.04]La mia mente gira pensieri tipo canne, giro il mondo tipo l\'equatore stando seduto nel mio salone...pensieri girano, girano come le trottole..non credo più a nessuno, dicono solo frottole, pensa ad arrivare in alto con le scale e non con l\'ascensore che la fatica poi ti ricompenserà lo sforzo\n', '/stream/1706367'),
(2294371, 490580, 'Wasted', '电子说唱讲述借酒消愁的失恋之痛，深情又无奈。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=621851&width=300&trackid=2294371', '[00:19.40]My love, never give it up.\n[00:23.10]Promise that I\'ll put you first and nothing else above. This thing is ours, it was made for us. You are all I care about, I don\'t need no one else. Never giving up my love...\n[00:40.42]You\'ve been on my line, I stay busy grinding I ain\'t got the time, got business to be minding. I\'m a boss, I\'m a boss, you know this I\'m a boss, I\'m a boss, you know this. Wasted, can\'t feel my face, yeah I\'ve been sipping cups, tryna make it go away Make it painless, that we didn\'t make it.\n[01:30.82]Cause when I\'m sober, I miss you everyday, yeah...\n[01:55.50]We go together, I\'m yours forever, take me away, away. Is you a treasure, cause there\'s nothing better, take me away, away You\'ve been on my line, I stay busy grinding I ain\'t got the time, got business to be minding.\n[02:24.26]I\'m a boss, I\'m a boss, you know this I\'m a boss, I\'m a boss, you know this\n', '/stream/2294371'),
(1844768, 526602, 'Deadman', '亡者游荡人间，生者无奈诅咒，摇滚民谣诉说孤独与愤怒。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=200644&width=300&trackid=1844768', '[01:01.02]Deadman walks on the street\n[01:03.16]He walks with a quiet step\n[01:06.18]He looks around and afraid\n[01:09.18]Because he is completely rotten\n[01:11.88]He wants to hurt you\n[01:14.62]Take everything away\n[01:17.38]Make your life more complicate,\n[01:20.12]That’s the meaning of his life\n[01:22.74]With caution everyone looks at him\n[01:23.68]Stare after and curse him\n[01:23.69]They know deadman is more alive\n[01:23.70]Than all the living\n[01:23.71]Chorus\n[01:23.72]Life passes, dead man does not go away\n[01:28.70]People suffer, but he looks happy\n[01:33.66]How long it will be going on, No one knows\n[01:39.20]Deadman doesn\'t want to say goodbye to us\n[01:44.62]Ending chorus\n[01:45.48]Deadman, take what you want\n[01:46.76]Deadman, save your soul\n[01:49.06]Deadman, leave us alone\n[02:10.58]Deadman, go to the hell\n', '/stream/1844768'),
