(1807112, 428294, 'Hold Me', '电子流行情歌，诉说失恋后的孤独与渴望拥抱。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=315614&width=300&trackid=1807112', '[00:17.00]“ I tried to ask you why but you never say athing,\n[00:20.98]Won\'t you hold me tight? I feel i\'m gonna bleed.\n[00:24.74]And even tho your eyes will not talk about me,\n[00:28.64]i feel i have changed since you decided to leave.\n[00:32.76]Won\'t you hold me tight again,\n[00:40.68]\'Cause i know when i close my eyes you\'re somewhere else..\n[00:50.46]Surrounded by the emotions that you never let me breathe,\n[01:08.64]How to find something else inside a world that bleeds?\n[01:12.74]Whenever it gets cold i know you\'re warm into his arms,\n[01:16.80]whenever it gets warm you know i\'m thinking \'bout..\n[01:21.02]When i was talking alone,\n[01:24.88]no one would hear a thing, yes i was driving alone,\n[01:32.90]no one to understand me.\n[01:36.72]Won\'t you hold me tight again,\n[01:43.28]\'Cause i know when i close my eyes you\'re somewhere else.\n[02:25.00]Yes i know when i close my eyes.\n[02:35.54]you\'re somewhere else.”\n', '/stream/1807112'),
