hing I hate\n[03:32.98]Behind your poker face\n[03:34.82]I wanna feel\n[03:35.80]I wanna scream\n[03:36.62]I wanna tear this  down so badly\n[03:39.06]But save me from this pain\n[03:42.70]Its gonna be the end\n[03:46.20]Its gonna be the end\n[03:51.36]Its gonna be the end\n[03:55.50]Its gonna be the end\n[03:59.64]Its gonna be the end\n[04:03.86]OUTRO :\n[04:04.66]He tells me, I’m scared, my time is running out\n[04:05.08]But my suffering won’t fade away with me\n[04:18.78]Cause I will finally be at peace\n[04:22.36]I’m scared, my time is running out\n[04:25.74]But my suffering won’t fade away with me\n[04:28.48]Cause I will finally be at peace\n', '/stream/2318937'),
(571432, 354542, 'A Violent Ritual of Self-Enlightenment', '一场以嘶吼与仪式寻求自我觉醒的黑暗金属仪式。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=65968&width=300&trackid=571432', '[00:17.22]A violent ritual of self-enlightenment\n[00:17.40]Open my mouth\n[00:19.14]Give me a voice\n[00:20.94]Tear out my fucking heart\n[00:26.48]Bath me in your light\n[00:28.26]Cleanse me in your fire\n[00:30.22]Let me be one with stardust\n[00:35.76]Hail the one who dwells in the darkness of my dreams\n[00:42.90]I am chained on the brink of the abyss,\n[00:45.36]Let thy Silver Stars enlighten me\n[00:49.56]I strike the bell\n[00:51.36]I become a flame\n[00:53.94]And still I cannot see\n[00:59.26]I face the six directions\n[01:01.20]With the seal on my chest\n[01:03.44]I chastise all my fears\n[01:14.76]Thee I invoke, the Bornless One\n[01:17.80]Asar Un-Nefer\n[01:19.76]Whom no man hath seen at any time\n[01:29.72]IA-BESZ, IA-APOPHRASZ\n[01:38.86]Thou didst form Me to love one another,\n[01:44.24]And to hate one another*\n[01:50.50]Awake my spirit\n[01:53.12]The sun in me\n[01:55.50]Veiled and hidden for thousand years\n[01:57.08]Make me reborn\n[01:58.18]Open the gates\n[02:00.22]And I shall break the shell of my hell\n[02:06.92]*”The Oath” in the Ritual by THE BEAST 666 for the Attainment of the Knowledge and Conversation of His Holy Guardian Angel during the Semester of His Performance of the Operation of the Sacred Magick of ABRAMELIN THE MAGE.\n', '/stream/571432'),
