(2232398, 487529, 'What a Way to Live', '一首关于生死与回忆的民谣，温暖而感伤。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=594441&width=300&trackid=2232398', '[00:00.42]What a way to live\n[00:09.16]What a way to live\n[00:18.64]There\'s a cross on your shoulder\n[00:21.78]And I carry it for her\n[00:27.92]I want to live and reminisce\n[00:32.18]Just like "Vivere" written on your wrist\n[00:43.16]What a way to live\n[00:45.24]What a way to die\n[00:49.96]What a way to live\n[00:54.68]What a way to die\n[00:58.40]On my way back home\n[01:04.54]Knew I had to try\n[01:07.62]So always remember your playful side\n[01:11.78]Because you always meet each other twice in life\n[01:13.14]When I look back there’s no regrets\n[01:13.30]I love you all to the bitter end\n[01:13.31]What a way to live\n[01:13.32]What a way to die\n[01:13.33]What a way to live\n[01:13.34]What a way to die\n[01:13.35]On my way back home\n[01:13.36]Knew I had to try\n[01:15.32]On my way back home\n[01:27.18]Knew I had to try\n', '/stream/2232398'),
