ndermined cold\n[03:33.60]Inside the heart of darkness\n[03:38.64]I\'ve come to you\n[03:40.40]And maybe I could give it all\n[03:44.80]No longer feeling the distance\n[03:48.34]Breaking through\n[03:50.24]The shell of undermined cold\n[03:53.38]Take me where the sun is cold\n[03:57.72]Take me where the summer is fall\n[04:02.98]I\'m drifting down to the doom but\n[04:09.32]Create my plasm and umbra\n', '/stream/2282861'),
(971059, 373009, 'Se está tan bien aquí', '西班牙语民谣，唱出此刻安心自在、随风而行的惬意。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=114278&width=300&trackid=971059', '[00:21.36]Se está tan bien aquí\n[00:23.06]Detrás\n[00:25.88]A tres metros del suelo\n[00:29.40]Sin nada que temer\n[00:31.92]Ni esperar\n[00:34.06]Sin miedo a tener miedo\n[00:37.58]No hay nada que pedir\n[00:40.82]Se está tan bien aquí\n[00:44.80]El tiempo viene y va\n[00:50.06]No hay necesidad\n[00:53.36]Sentir la sensación\n[00:56.96]de hacer\n[00:58.02]lo que te pida el cuerpo\n[01:02.20]no hay nada que perder\n[01:04.98]ni se ven\n[01:07.28]los rotos que hace el tiempo\n[01:10.42]Tan lejos de mentir\n[01:13.62]Se está tan bien aquí\n[01:16.82]No hay hora de empezar\n[01:23.62]Ni nada que acabar\n[01:27.60]Tan solo hay que sentir el viento\n[01:34.20]Oh, oh, oh ,oh\n[01:37.86]Solo hay que sentirse dentro\n[01:42.30]Oh, oh, oh, oh\n[01:46.54]Tan lejos de perder el tiempo\n[02:28.64]Oh, oh, oh ,oh\n[02:31.12]Solo hay que sentirse dentro\n[02:35.58]Oh, oh, oh, oh\n[02:39.80]Tan lejos de perder el tiempo\n[02:43.02]Se está tan bien aquí, sin mas\n[02:45.66]Se está tan bien aquí, detrás\n[02:46.40]Oh, oh, oh ,oh\n[02:47.98]Tan solo hay que sentir el viento\n[02:52.50]Oh, oh, oh ,oh\n[02:55.36]Solo hay que sentirse dentro\n', '/stream/971059'),
(1178009, 457964, 'Round and Round', '深情爵士灵魂乐，唱出恋人间的甜蜜与心动。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=243608&width=300&trackid=1178009', '[00:10.48]ROUND & ROUND\n[00:10.49]Written by Lawrence Beamen\n[00:10.50]*Track without vocals is also available*\n[00:10.51]I told my boys that I found\n[00:12.88]The best woman around\n[00:15.22]She’s so sweet\n[00:16.66]My fantasy treat  - uuuhhh\n[00:20.18]Sexier than lingerie\n[00:22.26]Strong as serrated blade\n[00:25.22]Smart as can be\n[00:26.98]You\'d think she had a Ph.D.\n[00:29.60]One look into her eyes,\n[00:31.78]And I\'m mesmerized and hypnotized\n[00:34.60]She has class, and the\n[00:37.22]Body of an hourglass\n[00:39.48]I know she’s the one for me\n[00:42.06]It’s her I want to please\n[00:44.58]No I can’t compare\n[00:46.52]Not a game of truth or Dare\n[00:48.86]She got me going round and around, she got me spinning upside down, she got me going round and around, she got me going here and there and everywhere - upside down.\n[01:19.92]I heard you tell your girls\n[01:21.48]You had the best man in the whole wide world\n[01:24.78]Girl, he treats me nice\n[01:27.92]Brings me great delight\n[01:30.30]He opens my door and\n[01:32.64]Escorts me to the dining floor\n[01:34.76]You didn\'t know I heard\n[01:36.60]But I hung on your every word\n[01:39.64]Like Bonnie and Clyde\n[01:41.92]Girl when I heard you\n[01:42.90]I damn near died\n[01:44.68]I’ll be there at six tonight\n[01:47.08]I’ll be buttoned up and suited tight\n[01:49.56]Girl I feel so blessed\n[01:52.04]I want you to wear my favorite dress\n[01:54.62]Black on white\n[01:56.70]You\'ll love what\'s going down tonight\n[01:58.84]She got me going round and around, she got me spinning upside down, she got me going round and around, she got me going here and there and everywhere - upside down\n[02:24.22]Can you handle it\n[02:25.86]I need to know\n[02:27.12]Do you want to be my girl\n[02:29.62]Can you handle it\n[02:30.86]The only one I want to know\n[02:33.34]I love you so\n[02:34.58]Can you handle it\n[02:35.90]You got me going…\n[02:38.98]She got me going round and around, she got me spinning upside down, she got me going round and around, she got me going here and there and everywhere - upside down\n', '/stream/1178009'),
(1838262, 536545, 'The mland - The Echo of the Past', '雨夜独坐，往事如回声叩门，劝人放下旧梦。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=304663&width=300&trackid=1838262', '[00:25.10]My dear,\n[00:25.76]I washed my hands with cold water rainy September night.\n[00:31.56]The past, it’s me, your old blue warder, I’ve decided to write.\n[00:37.64]I was sitting on the floor, covered with a blanket,\n[00:43.64]Gazing at the shore and not waiting.\n[00:50.60]There\'s no one else I could talk to, I was in my cage.\n[00:58.18]I didn\'t look for you, I opened a new page.\n[01:04.46]My gray blanket was wrapped me, it took my warmth,\n[01:10.52]That I had send you before.\n[01:15.62]The fall melancholy has already become a part of me.\n[01:21.84]Bookcases are filled with my collection of memories.\n[01:28.04]Today I allowed myself to disappear for two hours.\n[01:34.32]I just wanna know what was two days ago…\n[01:40.88]The echo of the past knocks the door.\n[01:52.10]Put old ghosts to rest, forgive.\n[02:03.26]It seems even worse than before.\n[02:16.06]But you shouldn\'t relive the past,\n[02:26.46]The echo of the past…\n', '/stream/1838262'),
(1807394, 374509, 'Ancient Stories', '焚烧旧信，往事如雨散落，古老故事随风而逝。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=261789&width=300&trackid=1807394', '[00:00.56]Gathered in an antique bowl\n[00:08.86]All the letters from their joyful life\n[00:15.54]Kneeling like prayer, she’ll stoke the fire\n[00:23.78]She’ll burn the words, they are for her alone\n[00:31.32]Like unwritten pages..\n[00:34.92]Hopes, cries, dreams, sighs\n[00:38.50]Will flow out, debris after rain\n[00:44.52]Our untold stories..\n[00:49.96]Smiles, scrapes, charms, the screams\n[00:53.54]Will go out, smoldered by rain\n[01:00.66]Countless hours make a life\n[01:09.00]Sheer number of moments stun\n[01:15.94]Commotion, struggled swim\n[01:24.90]Ripples will calm to glass\n[01:31.16]Like unwritten pages..\n[01:35.00]Friends, shams, loves, spills\n[01:38.62]Will flow out, debris after rain\n[01:46.70]Our heartfelt stories..\n[01:50.08]Kids, aches, meals, the scars\n[01:53.64]Will go out, smoldered by rain\n[02:31.32]Like unwritten pages..\n[02:35.18]Jokes, peeves, pets, lies\n[02:38.72]Will flow out, debris after rain\n[02:45.84]Our ancient stories..\n[02:50.12]Thrills, falls, truths, the hells\n[02:53.76]Will go out, smothered in sand by time\n', '/stream/1807394'),
