(1819994, 441585, 'Do You Ever Feel Sorry', '深情追问恋人是否感到孤独与歉意，旋律忧伤动人。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=198464&width=300&trackid=1819994', '[00:15.56]Hey you, say it one more time,\n[00:19.10]I know it’s true, I know you’re mine\n[00:26.22]Hey you, do feel my love\n[00:33.58]Hey you, can you ever get enough\n[00:37.58]So tell me baby do you ever feel lonely\n[00:40.74]Tell me baby do you ever feel sorry\n[00:43.52]Honey please, love is taking over, taking over, taking over.\n[00:49.68]I’m so sorry\n[00:50.62]Say it one more time, do you feel my love,\n[00:51.26]I know you’re mine, can you ever get enough.\n[00:51.40]Feel so sorry\n[00:51.41]Do you ever feel lonely\n[00:53.00]Cause I feel lonely too\n[00:53.10]Oh so lonely\n[00:53.11]And tell me baby\n[00:53.56]SO you ever feel lonely\n[00:55.72]Oh so lonely\n[01:02.76]Hey you, now I see through\n[01:10.70]Cause I know what I found in you\n[01:14.32]And you, can be sure that\n[02:09.34]I will make you happy too, happy too\n', '/stream/1819994'),
