(1334445, 488960, '777', '与恐惧和解的德语民谣，回望七年挣扎，寻求自我救赎。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=157786&width=300&trackid=1334445', '[00:10.94]7 Tage, 7 Jahre, bin ich davon gerannt\n[00:15.76]und 7 weitere Wochen, steckte ich meinen Kopf in den Sand\n[00:20.88]In der Hoffnung mich zu verdünnen, in der Hoffnung mich zu verlieren\n[00:25.96]Im Augenblick, im Moment, Neues zu initiieren\n[00:30.88]Doch die Geister der Vergangenheit zehren an mir\n[00:36.00]Sie weilen auf meiner Schulter, und weichen nicht von mir\n[00:40.88]7 dunkle Jahre, zogst du mich in deinen Bann,\n[00:45.38]ich wusste nicht mehr wer ich bin, und wusste nicht mehr was ich kann,\n[01:01.26]Meine Angst, ich bin so lang davon gerannt\n[01:06.22]Meine Angst, bitte sieh doch was ich kann!\n[01:10.78]Meine Angst, willst ein Teil von mir sein,\n[01:16.16]meine Angst, bitte lass mich allein!\n[01:21.20]Meine Angst, bist du vielleicht die Antwort\n[01:26.22]Meine Angst, auf die Fragen die ich fand\n[01:41.00]7 Tage, 7 Jahre, hast du dich Freund geschimpft\n[01:45.92]wusstest immer was ich brauche, hast mir deine Welt eingeimpft\n[01:50.40]Du glaubtest stets mich zu kennen, und wusstest immer was ich will\n[01:55.84]Doch meine Ecken, Schatten, Kanten, die waren dir zu viel\n[02:00.34]Du versprachst mir das Beste, weil du mich kennst, weil du mich schätzt,\n[02:05.88]tust als wüsstest du um meine Ängste, hast mich betört mit deinem Geschwätz\n[02:10.80]soll ich nach Vorne schrauen um Neues zu etablieren\n[02:15.92]oder doch dich weiter begleiten, um vielleicht Alles zu verlieren\n[02:41.78]Meine Angst, ich bin so lang davon gerannt\n[02:46.22]Meine Angst, bitte sieh doch was ich kann!\n[02:51.18]Meine Angst, willst ein Teil von mir sein,\n[02:56.20]meine Angst, bitte lass mich allein!\n[03:01.16]Meine Angst, bist du vielleicht die Antwort\n[03:06.16]Meine Angst, Auf alle Fragen die ich fand\n', '/stream/1334445'),
(1967938, 505138, 'Fool in Love (feat. Mary Dee) [Radio Edit]', '心碎说唱，讲述被背叛后挣扎放手的故事。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=494157&width=300&trackid=1967938', '[00:23.74]Every time that I\'m alone I be thinking of you\n[00:26.48]Through the looking glass I\'m finding a future with you\n[00:29.42]Though that probability is low\n[00:31.42]I was never losing any hope\n[00:33.30]I thought I was in love with you\n[00:35.28]But its crazy cause you broke my heart\n[00:37.44]Found you cheating on me all the way back in the start of our relationship\n[00:40.96]Now I see the truth\n[00:42.06]I feel like you\'re the holding back my soul\n[00:44.28]I don\'t know what I can do I\'m feeling trapped\n[00:46.56]Confused\n[00:47.18]Conflicting feelings\n[00:48.30]Know that your not good for me\n[00:49.62]Yet I\'m feening for that synergy I\'m losing sleep\n[00:52.68]Got me writing all my feelings trying to get you out my head\n[00:55.56]With this trauma you have given me I\'m fucking pissed\n[00:58.36]There comes a time in every man\'s life to make a choice\n[01:00.94]Gain the self-respect and learn to let her go and set her free\n[01:04.20]It\'s time to wise up\n[01:05.82]Time to make a choice\n[01:07.12]You got me balling out my eyes\n[01:08.58]It\'s time to set you free\n[01:10.24]There are no words left to say no (say no)\n[01:13.60]Cause I heard them all before\n[01:15.86]Feelings are sharp like a knife now (knife now)\n[01:19.46]And it cuts through the heart\n[01:21.24]You ask me if I\'m okay love\n[01:23.96]No cause you\'re shredding me apart\n[01:26.98]Still I can\'t get away love\n[01:29.84]Why must I be a fool in love\n[01:32.92]Now I\'m sitting here\n[01:34.62]Listening to music\n[01:35.88]Wishing you can disappear\n[01:37.44]But still I think about ya\n[01:38.90]Its tough enough to see you every single day\n[01:41.28]Whenever we in class I turn around and see that smile on your face\n[01:45.46]Crazy knowing that I\'ve been replaced\n[01:47.30]Could he be making you as happy as me\n[01:50.20]Every single thing I did it was for you not for me\n[01:53.12]Making all this money\n[01:54.12]Going to the mall on a spree\n[01:56.50]I can\'t believe I wasted all my time believing on these fairytales\n[01:59.94]Now I see the truth that it\'s a bunch of lies\n[02:02.36]Is love whenever you are opened up to someone else they think and take advantage of you\n[02:08.00]Some kind of luck I have with all these women that I\'ve dated being selfish only here for themselves\n[02:13.28]But It\'s time that I move on and be the best that I can be\n[02:16.24]Learn to grow and to forgive and be the man I\'ve always strived to be\n[02:19.60]There are no words left to say no (say no)\n[02:22.94]Cause I heard them all before\n[02:25.64]Feelings are sharp like a knife now (knife now)\n[02:29.22]And it cuts through the heart\n[02:31.04]You ask me if I\'m okay love\n[02:33.78]No cause you\'re shredding me apart\n[02:36.80]Still I can\'t get away love\n[02:39.66]Why must I be a fool in love\n[02:42.62]There are no words left to say no (say no cause I love you)\n[02:49.42]No I can\'t take no more\n[02:52.80]You ask me if I\'m okay love\n[02:57.10]No cause you\'re shredding me apart\n[03:00.14]Still I can\'t get away love\n[03:02.92]Why must I be a fool in love\n', '/stream/1967938'),
(1704471, 456650, 'You Were You', '怀念昨日真实的你，感叹当下与逝去的美好。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=189258&width=300&trackid=1704471', '[00:26.00]You were you yesterday\n[00:28.58]You were you\n[00:31.30]And it broke my heart\n[00:33.90]Through and through\n[00:36.66]I put up all defenses in my mind\n[00:42.00]Anytime I go to see you\n[00:44.40]I make sure their holding strong\n[00:46.96]But you were you yesterday\n[00:49.98]You were you\n[00:52.64]You were witty\n[00:53.74]You were charming\n[00:55.68]For a moment you were you\n[00:58.24]And I didn’t want to leave\n[01:00.18]No, I didn’t want to go\n[01:03.58]‘Cuz I never know who you will be\n[01:06.32]Next time I come around\n[01:19.70](whistle)\n[01:19.71]The sadness that strikes\n[01:22.10]Even just thinking of you\n[01:24.32]Washes over like a dark cloud\n[01:27.78]Above that never moves\n[01:29.98]And I try to remember\n[01:32.94]The good times we all had\n[01:35.12]But the memories are distant\n[01:38.34]Broken and shattered\n[01:40.90]But you were you yesterday\n[01:46.00]You were you\n[01:47.24]I should hold onto the moment\n[01:51.12]A reminder of the truth\n[01:54.56]Now is all there is now\n[01:57.28]Now is all we have\n[02:00.02]Focus on the present\n[02:02.32]The past is in the past\n[02:04.30]When you were you\n[02:06.36]You were you\n[02:10.30]But now is all there is now\n[02:13.30]Now is all we have\n[02:14.84]And you are you now\n[02:17.38]You are you\n[02:20.88]And now is all there is now\n[02:23.90]Now is all we have\n[02:25.66]You are you now\n[02:28.06]You are you\n[02:31.62]And now is all there is now\n[02:34.60]Now is all we have\n[02:36.20]You are you\n[02:39.26]You are you\n[02:41.98]You are you\n[02:43.04]You are you\n', '/stream/1704471'),
(2318273, 516884, 'Buddy Come Home', '民谣吟唱对远行友人的思念，盼其归家。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=633173&width=300&trackid=2318273', '[00:04.64]Your bedroom is empty, you\'ve been gone so long.\n[00:12.62]Oh, when will you come back again?\n[00:18.90]Oh, where can our friend be?\n[00:22.34]Has something gone wrong?\n[00:26.06]You\'ve been gone since we don\'t know when.\n[00:30.42]The seasons are turning,\n[00:35.78]the home fires are burning,\n[00:38.64]we\'re yearning for your return.\n[00:44.78]Have you wandered too far?\n[00:48.56]Do you know where you are?\n[00:51.86]We all have lessons to learn.\n[00:58.60]You\'re somewhere out winging,\n[01:01.18]how far did you roam?\n[01:04.72]And that\'s why we\'re singing,\n[01:08.36]come home,\n[01:09.00]buddy, come home,\n[01:12.76]buddy, come home, buddy,\n[01:17.56]come home.\n[01:23.31]A light shining brightly, we leave on the stair,\n[01:31.38]in case you just can\'t find your way.\n[01:37.02]When you\'re gone all night,\n[01:40.10]we are burdened with care,\n[01:44.28]till we find you sleeping all day.\n[01:50.44]We shouldn\'t both fear it,\n[01:53.60]you are a free spirit,\n[01:57.02]a wanderer in the night.\n[02:02.14]We won\'t try\n[02:05.52]to change you,\n[02:06.72]but can\'t you arrange to drop by and say you\'re all right?\n[02:16.60]You\'re somewhere out winging,\n[02:19.50]how far did you roam?\n[02:23.42]And that\'s why we\'re singing,\n[02:26.62]come home,\n[02:28.06]buddy, come home, buddy,\n[02:32.50]come home,\n[02:34.26]buddy,\n[02:35.86]come home.\n', '/stream/2318273'),
(1804345, 363811, 'La beauté', '法语民谣吟唱对逝去之美的追忆与哀叹。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=197332&width=300&trackid=1804345', '[00:23.58]Qu\'on nous donne\n[00:27.10]Qu\'on nous donne la beauté\n[00:33.38]Celle qu\'on a oublié\n[00:39.09]Dans les mornes cités\n[00:41.33]Qui s\'endorment\n[00:45.27]Qui s\'endorment\n[00:49.63]Sans avoir pu réver\n[00:52.95]De lacs aux reflets bleutés\n[00:59.25]Par l\'eau pure des glaciers\n[01:05.83]Qui se meurent\n[01:08.33]Comme se meurent\n[01:12.21]Sous des orages d\'aciers\n[01:17.85]Nos espoirs etriqués\n[01:24.21]Nos désirs confinés\n[01:28.47]Qui implorent\n[01:30.13]Qu\'on nous donne\n[01:32.39]Qu\'on nous donne la beauté\n[01:35.09]C\'est ce qui doit rester\n[01:35.51]Quand tout sera conjuguer\n[02:56.53]Au passé\n[03:00.29]Ce passé\n[03:03.63]Qui nous a comdamné\n[03:09.39]De ne pas avoir su garder\n[03:16.43]Chérir et protéger\n[03:21.41]La beauté\n', '/stream/1804345'),
