(1017628, 432069, 'Absinthe', '民谣吟唱灵魂的腐蚀与重生，痛苦使人坚强。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=119867&width=300&trackid=1017628', '[00:09.96]There may come a time\n[00:12.90]When you\'re dancing\n[00:14.50]The demons in your mind\n[00:17.78]To the music\n[00:20.26]Of a troubled soul\n[00:25.16]Everyone around\n[00:28.28]Where a troubled\n[00:29.82]Proud there\'s something wrong\n[00:32.63]There\'s something wrong\n[00:36.34]Your soul lies\n[00:39.66]Corroded by the\n[00:41.92]Acids of time\n[00:44.12]Everything\n[00:46.02]You ever knew\n[00:47.80]Is gone\n[00:52.32]What doesn\'t kill you\n[00:54.08]Makes you strong\n[00:56.78]Strong as the steel Wrought in a forge Of\n[01:05.10]rage Straight as the rock Shackled and chained\n[01:45.58]There may come a time When you\'re dancing With\n[01:50.64]an angel on your arm The moon seems To shiver\n[01:56.42]Out of view When you look around All\n[02:03.82]that\'s beautiful Bounds It feels so true It\n[02:10.00]feels so true\n[02:13.86]Your poverty Is eased By love and hope\n[02:18.46]And care All your pain And misery Is gone\n[02:26.79]What doesn\'t kill you Makes you strong\n[02:34.16]Strong as the sea Brought to the mill Of\n[02:40.78]God Fine as the dust Shackled and shined\n[03:55.06]Your soul lies\n', '/stream/1017628'),
(110186, 1205, 'The Cold Comfort of Desperation', '绝望与心碎交织的电子摇滚，渴望挣脱却无处可逃。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=13576&width=300&trackid=110186', '[00:11.42]Thank you.\n[00:30.00]Rock songs, just to help you along.\n[00:33.99]I\'m tired of riding in the passenger.\n[00:38.18]I want to be the driver.\n[00:43.96]I want to be the driver.\n[00:53.20]Love and use, desperation.\n[01:00.20]Desperation.\n[01:09.94]Desperation.\n[01:17.89]Love and use,\n[01:20.62]it\'s aspiration.\n[01:32.06]Love and use of desperation.\n[01:39.96]Desperation.\n[01:48.00]Desperation.\n[02:19.76]I feel like you hate me.\n[02:22.88]I have nowhere to go.\n[02:25.82]My heart has been broken.\n[02:29.32]My soul has been stolen.\n[02:37.38]Nothing is desperation.\n[02:42.82]Desperation.\n[02:52.08]Nothing is\n[03:00.84]desperation.\n[03:05.32]Desperation\n[03:10.02]Loving is desperation\n[03:16.66]Desperation\n[03:34.58]So I turn and run away All my problems can\'t be concealed\n[03:41.59]The truth has been revealed I can\'t stay like baby\n[03:48.66]Desperation Excess\n[04:04.06]Excess\n[04:09.78]Desperation\n[04:10.66]Desperation\n[05:01.11]Thanks for watching!\n', '/stream/110186'),
