(1834483, 503091, 'Erick Fill & Alwaro - You\'ll Be Fine ft. Crushboys (Original Mix)', '分手后的温柔告别，安慰对方终会遇见更好的爱。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=332699&width=300&trackid=1834483', '[00:43.80]Youʼll Be Fine Lyrics\n[00:47.62]Intro:\n[00:48.38]Yeah x 3\n[00:48.48]Chorus:\n[00:48.49]Youʼll be fine - Baby\n[00:51.68]youʼll find someone whoʼs gonna love you\n[00:54.98]More than I can - Girl\n[00:58.28]in time-\n[01:00.82]When you think of us you wonʼt cry\n[01:04.28]Baby our love ran dry\n[01:07.90]It donʼt mean you wonʼt love again\n[01:10.68]I just canʼt fake it/ canʼt pretend\n[01:12.84]So wipe those tears that fall from your eyes\n[01:16.54]Baby youʼre fine\n[01:19.04]I canʼt be the one but I tried\n[01:23.84]I know in time/ weʼll be fine\n[01:27.10]V1:\n[01:28.36]Be careful what you wish for\n[01:29.64]Cuz you might just get it\n[01:31.80]I wanted your love\n[01:34.32]Now I regret it\n[01:35.40]You come over so unannounced\n[01:36.50]Youʼre staying late and sneaking out oh baby\n[01:37.00]I know you crazy\n[01:41.80]Oh you say—\n[01:46.72]All I do is play games—\n[01:50.86]But I donʼt wanna play games—\n[01:56.02]With you\n[02:00.96]Chorus:\n[02:03.74]Youʼll be fine - Baby\n[02:08.46]youʼll find someone whoʼs gonna love you\n[02:11.78]More than I can - Girl\n[02:15.18]in timeWhen\n[02:18.32]you think of us you wonʼt cry\n[02:21.38]Baby our love ran dry\n[02:24.94]V2:\n[02:25.62]I donʼt know what you thought - But\n[02:28.02]I wonʼt forget it\n[02:28.03]Fighting for your love\n[02:28.04]Even though its done already\n[02:29.34]I donʼt feel like Iʼm even here/ Iʼm too afraid to make it clear oh baby—\n[02:44.20]I know you crazy\n[02:45.98]You said if you- canʼt have me then nobody stands a chance\n[02:49.48]You want my heart but wonʼt listen you just only make demands—\n[02:49.49]Girl itʼs over\n[02:49.50]Build a bridge and get over/ what we did\n[03:07.24]Cuz I know its a matter of time —\n[03:07.64]Chorus:\n[03:07.65]Bridge:\n[03:07.66](ooh)\n[03:07.96]Youʼll be fine/ youʼll find someone to love you\n[03:08.76]More than I can\n[03:09.64]it might take some time\n[03:09.65]But when you think of us you wonʼt cry\n[03:09.76]Youʼll dry your eyes\n[03:25.88]Break:\n', '/stream/1834483'),
(1826719, 506259, 'Bajamar', '梦境般的海滩与永恒之爱，温柔静谧的拉美民谣。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=198991&width=300&trackid=1826719', '[00:27.34]Te soñé\n[00:33.02]mirando el mar en el atardecer\n[00:37.42]tus ojos contenían el ocaso\n[00:43.94]tu rostro parecía familiar\n[00:51.22]y al mismo tiempo me era tan extraño\n[00:56.08]que irradiaras el calor de mi hogar\n[01:05.91]Te escuché\n[01:10.48]palabras que no supe interpretar\n[01:15.59]pero el sonido de tu voz\n[01:22.07]me arropaba con serenidad\n[01:29.19]me hablabas con el mismo tono calmo\n[01:34.19]que las olas de la bajamar\n[01:39.99]Y no supe\n[01:45.84]si buscarte o esperarte\n[01:54.64]si soñarte o recordarte\n[01:59.82]tal vez siempre estuviste a mi lado\n[02:04.98]y recién te logro ver\n[02:13.22]y recién te logro ver\n[02:49.70]Vas a venir\n[02:54.26]un alma que cambió de cuerpo\n[02:59.08]consciencia que me cuida y me acompaña\n[03:05.14]imagen que mutó y nunca se fue\n[03:12.62]un barco sumergido en lo profundo\n[03:17.44]que la corriente trae a flote otra vez\n[03:23.66]La vida es\n[03:29.54]el centro de un reloj de arena\n[03:35.92]la ilusión de que el tiempo va cayendo\n[03:42.50]pero el reloj cada noche se da vuelta\n[03:50.20]por eso a veces sueño esta playa\n[03:54.96]donde no hay días y es sólo eternidad\n', '/stream/1826719'),
