(1163994, 675, 'Primitiv Man', '法式幽默摇滚，调侃原始人超级英雄的滑稽生活。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=139869&width=300&trackid=1163994', '[00:18.42]Un fut\' en peau, des doigts crados et recouvert d\'un poncho\n[00:22.74]Avec quelques kilos en trop\n[00:26.98]Pour sûr j\'suis fainéant!\n[00:31.34]Papa barbu, m\'man moustachue, tout les deux des poils au cul\n[00:34.88]D\'une soupe primitive j\'suis issu\n[00:37.40]D\'un jus dégoulinant!\n[00:49.18]On me nomme Primitiv Man\n[00:51.06]On dit de moi « l\'homme au Q.I.Q.I. d\'une moule »\n[00:54.90]C\'est trop compliqué, ça me donne mal au crâne\n[00:59.18]De mon gourdin les femelles s\'emparent et finissent en rondelles\n[01:05.96]J\'suis un super héros sensationnel\n[01:10.18]Oh maman regarde c\'est primitif man y se déplace sans bagnole avec ses jambes!\n[01:15.38]Et tu n\'as encore rien vu petit, j\'ai également d\'autres super-pouvoirs\n[01:18.94]Comme imiter l\'singe à la perfection!\n[01:22.00]Un fut\' en peau, des doigts crados et recouvert d\'un poncho\n[01:24.92]Avec quelques kilos en trop\n[01:29.10]Pour sûr j\'suis fainéant!\n[01:33.54]Papa barbu, m\'man moustachue, tout les deux des poils au cul\n[01:37.00]D\'une soupe primitive j\'suis issu\n[01:39.56]D\'un jus dégoulinant!\n[01:51.12]Tout l\'monde acclame cet homme anormal\n[01:53.24]Le seul homme à renier l\'induction\n[01:56.32]Et préférer le feu d\'Néandertal\n[02:01.44]Un appétit de taré\n[02:05.06]Les mammouths ont forcément morflé\n[02:08.42]Auchan j\'vais faire ma chasse désormais\n[02:12.44]Il est vraiment exceptionnel, quand il mange il n\'utilise jamais d\'vaisselle\n[02:18.88]Et tu n\'as encore rien vu, ma pépète\n[02:23.58]J\'communique sans téléphone, pue d\'la gueule sans provolone,\n[02:27.16]Epluche des pommes comme personne sans économe\n[02:30.88]Un fut\' en peau, des doigts crados et recouvert d\'un poncho\n[02:41.26]Avec quelques kilos en trop\n[02:43.68]Pour sûr j\'suis fainéant!\n[02:46.60]Papa barbu, m\'man moustachue, tout les deux des poils au cul\n[02:52.72]D\'une soupe primitive j\'suis issu\n[02:57.52]D\'un jus dégoulinant!\n', '/stream/1163994'),
(1672836, 495572, 'Shine On', '挣脱束缚、勇敢追梦的夏日流行摇滚，闪耀向前。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=319676&width=300&trackid=1672836', '[00:00.16]VERSE:\n[00:01.20]Lost the weights tied to my feet\n[00:04.84]Cut the chain\n[00:06.26]Broke the shell around me\n[00:08.50]Free from the\n[00:09.42]Free from the long way down\n[00:12.70]Way down\n[00:14.16]Left it all\n[00:17.00]Out on my own\n[00:19.22]Just a Never, tryin to be a Hero\n[00:22.24]Go on and\n[00:23.80]Go on and have your doubts\n[00:26.62]PRECHORUS:\n[00:27.18]Come along come along come along with me\n[00:28.72]If you want to want to want to be free\n[00:31.96]Come along come along come along with me\n[00:35.50]If you want to want to want to be free\n[00:39.68]CHORUS:\n[00:41.94]“Let go”\n[00:45.38]That’s all I remember\n[00:47.46]Before\n[00:48.82]Before we hit the ground\n[00:51.08]Time stood\n[00:52.34]still as ten thousand pieces fly up all around us\n[00:56.40]Shine on like glitter girl\n', '/stream/1672836'),
(1678830, 521321, 'Glass House Lover', '心碎独白，被背叛的恋人如玻璃屋般脆弱破碎。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=187152&width=300&trackid=1678830', '[00:19.48]Verse 1:\n[00:19.62]You\'ve changed, or maybe it\'s just me\n[00:34.81]But either way, I can finally see how unkind you\'ve really come to be.\n[00:49.11]And it hurts; does it ever hurt you, too?\n[01:05.75]Or are you still trapped in your facade\n[01:10.33]Of games and sex and getting bombed?\n[01:15.09]Pretending everything is still okay\n[01:19.93]Prechorus:\n[01:20.83]You never really cared for me\n[01:28.11]You never really cared for me\n[01:35.43]Chorus:\n[01:38.99]Sweat-soaked and drenched in cheap cologne\n[01:43.19]I\'d do anything to avoid being alone\n[01:51.41]And I\'m sorry for my bitter taste,\n[01:57.83]But you fooled me once and I\'m disgraced.\n[02:01.55]I was a glass house lover but you went and threw a stone\n[02:06.87]Oh, I should of known\n[02:11.61]Verse 2:\n[02:25.95]Is this what I was put here for?\n[02:29.29]Just to drive you to the liquor store,\n[02:33.33]And pray that there\'ll be something more?\n[02:37.37]I know we\'ll never make it in the end.\n[02:41.17]I\'m an optimist, but I\'ve been getting pissed,\n[02:44.87]And if I leave now, I know I won\'t be missed.\n[02:49.47]I\'m so tired of waking up alone\n[02:53.59]Prechorus 2:\n[02:57.07]I\'m naked with a note beside my bed,\n[03:03.33]And I can\'t seem to get you out of my head\n[03:11.69]​\n[03:35.97]Chorus 1x\n[03:40.81]​\n', '/stream/1678830'),
(1451496, 472436, 'White Spaces', '失恋后深夜独处，思念与孤独交织的梦幻民谣。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=271911&width=300&trackid=1451496', '[00:15.28]Just one year ago everything was growing inside\n[00:23.30]Packed up months ago, it is getting harder each time\n[00:27.96]I think I hear you now, turning as a calling reach out\n[00:38.48]All is going wild, I can’t even get through the night\n[00:43.56]Pre-Chorus\n[00:45.08]Where did you go, our love, it felt so right\n[00:49.38]Now I can’t get you off my mind\n[00:53.30]It’s spinning like a circle and I keep walking outside\n[00:58.82]Chorus\n[01:01.40]Maybe if I touched you right\n[01:05.34]Maybe I can put up a fight\n[01:07.66]Baby, did I hold you too tight?\n[01:12.72]Well, not tonight\n[01:15.88]Verse 2\n[01:18.70]I get home too late, life is getting busy at day\n[01:25.84]I keep my schedule up, filling it with meetings and stuff\n[01:33.64]but now it’s fall again, hearing voices sing through the night\n[01:41.50]where are you off my friend, maybe you could love me again\n[01:47.52]Pre-Chorus\n[01:48.24]Where did you go, my love, it felt so right\n[01:52.78]now I can’t get you off my mind\n[01:56.66]it’s spinning like a circle and I keep walking outside\n[02:02.00]Chorus\n[02:04.68]Maybe if I touched you right\n[02:08.74]Maybe I could put up a fight\n[02:11.36]Baby, did I hold you too tight?\n[02:16.38]MID 8\n[02:16.88]Did you know I sleep on the floor every night on my own to try\n[02:23.14]to not turn around just to find no one there, you know\n[02:33.06]you get used to the lack of the person you want the most\n[02:40.28]it’s like a friend in the dark and he’s singing you to sleep\n[02:46.60]Pre-Chorus\n[02:48.00]Where did you go, our love, it felt so right\n[02:52.32]now I can’t get you off my mind\n[02:56.12]it’s spinning like a circle and I keep walking outside\n[03:01.86]Chorus\n[03:02.64]Well, maybe if I touched you right\n[03:06.64]And maybe I could put up a fight\n[03:10.78]Baby, did I hold you too tight?\n[03:15.14]Maybe if I touched you right\n[03:16.84]Maybe I could put up a fight\n[03:16.85]Baby, did I hold you too tight?\n[03:16.86]Not tonight\n', '/stream/1451496'),
(1230248, 471542, 'Teorema de los espectros', '在静默中感受神性与爱，学会聆听与信任。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=147545&width=300&trackid=1230248', '[00:19.86]El silencio habló cuando mi ser calló\n[00:23.88]Tanto ruido en mí que no podía ver en ti\n[00:28.60]Tú estabas aquí sin decírmelo\n[00:32.80]Lloraste a mi lado y te doliste junto a mí\n[00:37.92]Me enseñaste a ver que no todo es pedir\n[00:42.30]Me enseñaste ser lo que no te dejé decir\n[00:46.92]Callar es amar, callar es volar\n[00:51.38]En los brazos de otro, la confianza de esperar\n[00:57.06]En cada silencio estabas Tú\n[01:01.68]Eras un silbo apacible\n[01:04.02]Que, a pesar de mi inquietud,\n[01:05.96]Con tu amor fuiste sublime\n[01:08.16]En cada silencio estabas Tú\n[01:10.98]Demostrando que eras Dios\n[01:12.60]Aún en medio de la tempestad,\n[01:18.60]En medio de la tempestad\n[01:32.53]Cada segundo que vacilé, lo reconozco, no sé porque\n[01:36.45]Fue necesario para aclarar que: Para escuchar, debo callar\n[01:41.61]Cada segundo es la oportunidad de sonreír una vez más\n[01:46.05]Cada lágrima vale la pena, ningún minuto tiene condena, y sé:\n[01:51.77]Coro\n[01:52.21]No sé cómo ni cuándo, el desenlace ni el porqué\n[01:54.53]No tengo las respuestas, pero hay algo que si sé\n[01:58.89]Tus estas a mi lado, y si eres mi aliado\n[02:42.53]Conozco el final.\n[03:34.01]El silencio habló…\n', '/stream/1230248'),
(1929475, 530223, 'Easy to love you', '轻快R&B情歌，诉说爱既简单又复杂。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=475937&width=300&trackid=1929475', '[00:00.26]Chorus:\n[00:00.27]Easy to love you\n[00:01.26]Easy to love you baby\n[00:03.60]Easy to love you\n[00:06.72]Easy and complicated (2x)\n[00:20.68]Ver 1:\n[00:21.10]Love, I\'m sure somewhere waiting.\n[00:25.52]Every time I try to wait.\n[00:31.54]When both are not going to stop loving\n[00:35.50]Love for you and me, love for us baby\n[00:41.60]I love\n[00:42.60]Chorus:\n[00:42.88]Easy to love you\n[00:44.30]Easy to love you baby\n[00:46.20]Easy to love you\n[00:47.88]Easy and complicated (2x)\n[00:53.58]Ver 2:\n[01:03.94]Love, I\'m sure somewhere waiting.\n[01:08.16]Every time I try to wait.\n[01:14.50]When both are not going to stop loving\n[01:20.08]Love for you and me, love for us baby\n[01:24.16]I love\n[01:25.30]Chorus:\n[01:25.76]Easy to love you\n[01:27.02]Easy to love you baby\n[01:28.92]Easy to love you\n[01:32.20]Easy and complicated (2x)\n', '/stream/1929475'),
(1888020, 502021, 'Kill You', '孤独绝望中唱出被忽视的痛苦与毁灭冲动', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=456111&width=300&trackid=1888020', '[00:19.43]Why do I feel alone?\n[00:25.34]Even though you are here\n[00:31.58]Why do I feel that there\'s something\n[00:35.90]Longing you keep silent\n[00:39.78]You don\'t even look at me\n[00:47.70]Why are you not talking to me?\n[00:52.92]Why are you just sitting there?\n[00:57.94]Look at the captain TV I will take\n[01:04.02]my gun You will try to run And I will kill you And\n[01:13.18]I blame myself for you I look in the mirror and cry\n[01:24.75]Can\n[01:26.56]you talk anymore?\n[01:29.24]Can you talk anymore?\n[01:30.08]Can you fight anymore?\n[01:31.40]Can you no longer be sincere?\n[01:36.86]I will take my gun You will try to run And I will kill you\n[01:56.26]And I blame myself for you\n[02:03.88]And I blame myself for you\n[02:16.46]And I blame myself for you\n[02:30.94]You don\'t even look at me\n[02:37.00]Why are you not talking to me?\n[02:42.24]Why are you just sitting there?\n[02:47.28]Look at the captain TV\n[02:50.35]I will take my gun You will try to run And I will kill you And I\n[03:02.76]blame myself for you I look in the mirror and cry And I\'ll be so good\n[03:20.44]And I\'m beating myself to sleep I will take my\n[03:27.20]gun You will try to run And I will kill you And\n[03:43.06]I\'m beating myself to sleep\n[03:50.34]I\n[03:52.66]will take my gun You will try to run\n[03:59.56]And\n[04:04.14]I\'ll be so good And I\'ll be so good\n[04:12.39]You will try to run And I\'ll be so good\n[04:36.65]Thanks for watching!\n', '/stream/1888020'),
(1223978, 469613, 'I Think Im In Love', '爱情错觉消散，坦诚面对失落与心碎。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=146832&width=300&trackid=1223978', '[00:14.91]I think I\'m in love when I\'m not\n[00:24.06]Seems the more I get, the more I want\n[00:32.20]In walks her true love,\n[00:36.08]riding on her blues\n[00:40.06]Half awake enough to tell the truth\n[00:52.08]Suddenly the spell is wearing off\n[01:00.08]All my feelings change with every cough\n[01:08.06]Now my head begins to hurt,\n[01:12.18]bones are aching too\n[01:16.08]Not the way I feel when I\'m with you\n[01:30.00]In love when I\'m not I pretend but I can\'t\n[01:38.24]surrender my thoughts Overcast around my head,\n[01:47.38]throat tied up in knots Can\'t pretend no more,\n[01:54.34]the feeling\'s lost\n[02:05.16]Won\'t you come round tomorrow Make me feel okay\n[02:14.66]You know it\'s better off this way\n[03:11.31]Thanks for watching!\n', '/stream/1223978'),
