(1044159, 435269, 'Let\'s Get Married', '轻快民谣唱出年轻恋人勇敢步入婚姻的甜蜜。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=122951&width=300&trackid=1044159', '[00:09.00]Stealing glances from a distance,\n[00:12.63]Never thought that I,\n[00:14.45]Would be the one you\'d wanna hold,\n[00:17.10]And sing with every night,\n[00:19.82]When I0 saw your face and heard your voice,\n[00:23.52]I never thought that we would,\n[00:25.35]Dance and fall in love,\n[00:27.12]So call me crazy if you want but,\n[00:29.86]Let\'s get married! Whoa oh oh!\n[00:51.50]Chasing shadows for a while,\n[00:54.39]Until we finally found the door,\n[00:57.05]That let us see the you and me,\n[00:59.78]The lights were shining on,\n[01:02.49]Some would scoff and stare at us,\n[01:04.25]And some would laugh and cry,\n[01:06.95]And others asked our age and wage,\n[01:08.75]And raised their eyebrows in surprise,\n[01:11.45]Let\'s get married! Whoa oh oh!\n[01:23.24]Cuz we are young and full of love,\n[01:25.98]And don\'t have much at all,\n[01:27.74]But we know something more than age and wages,\n[01:31.31]Tell you where you are,\n[01:34.97]Let\'s get married! Whoa oh o\n', '/stream/1044159'),
