(1791478, 481486, 'Destination Andromeda', '史诗配乐描绘前往仙女座的旅程，人声吟诵如静默祈祷。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=196087&width=300&trackid=1791478', '[01:12.54]SILENT PRAYER\n[02:02.00]LENT PRAYER\n[02:40.46]LENT PRAYER\n[03:00.62]LENT PRAYER\n', '/stream/1791478'),
(2231943, 551958, 'I See Green', '反思科技异化与自然失落，呼唤重拾人性与绿色梦想。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=593141&width=300&trackid=2231943', '[00:00.24]We have begun to build a land,\n[00:02.30]That we soon won’t understand,\n[00:05.28]Where faces of friends change every day.\n[00:09.66]A world not filled with mystery,\n[00:12.42]Cause all we do is click to see,\n[00:14.76]And thinking was a way of the past.\n[00:18.84]Living in a cubic world,\n[00:21.28]Without the human touch of a girl,\n[00:23.90]There’s no wonder we have grown so cold.\n[00:28.06]Love is not to penetrate,\n[00:30.70]It’s to live in peace among the hate,\n[00:32.94]Have we begun to lose our sense for the world?\n[00:36.82]I see Green, in my dream,\n[00:41.92]Just wipe away the grey we’ve built today.\n[00:45.74]I see Blue, blue, blue I’ve come to talk to you,\n[00:51.38]We came from the ocean but have we lost that notion.\n[00:55.98]We have begun to change our chemistry,\n[00:57.48]In a world growing small so rapidly,\n[01:09.66]And the kids are born different today.\n[01:13.02]No time for physical games,\n[01:16.40]It’s a consciousness forever tamed,\n[01:19.12]Sometimes I just don’t wish to understand.\n[01:22.56]Where we once natures friends,\n[01:25.50]Lions, trees, birds and things,\n[01:28.12]What happened to the love there use to be?\n[01:32.32]Now I’m looking deep inside,\n[01:34.62]And wonder how we will survive,\n[01:37.16]And the truth gets more apparent everyday.\n[01:40.56]I see Green, in my dream,\n[01:46.28]Just wipe away the grey we’ve built today.\n[01:49.70]I see Blue, blue, blue I’ve come to talk to you,\n[01:55.30]We came from the ocean but have we lost that notion.\n', '/stream/2231943'),
(2147998, 510926, 'Consume My Heart', '一首雷鬼与R&B融合的敬拜歌曲，表达对神的爱与赞美。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=556949&width=300&trackid=2147998', '[00:12.66]CONSUME MY HEART\n[00:12.67]VERSE ONE:\n[00:12.68]Now and beyond the end of days, I just wanna spend my life with You.\n[00:24.44]Your irreplaceable grace, LORD, only makes me want to sing Your praise.\n[00:36.20]You\'re a sight to behold, LORD.\n[00:42.04]Consume this heart of mine, O LORD.\n[00:47.90]Your name above all, LORD, You bring peace to the poor.\n[00:58.52]CHORUS:\n[00:59.46]Jesus, take our praise, O Saviour, have Your way.\n[01:10.88]Our Redeemer, take our praise, O Saviour, have Your way.\n[01:22.40]VERSE TWO:\n[01:22.48]To show Your affection, You died on the cross.\n[01:27.98]To express Your love, You gave Your life for me, for me.\n[01:44.98]To show Your affection, You died on the cross.\n[01:51.44]To express Your love, You gave Your life for me, for me.\n[02:37.62]Copyright 2024 Richard Shekari.\n', '/stream/2147998'),
(1892938, 503140, 'The Boy Who Never Smiled', '一个从不微笑的男孩，藏着悲伤与孤独。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=458682&width=300&trackid=1892938', '[00:18.48]There were no balloons\n[00:20.44]For the boy who never smiled\n[00:27.98]Locked away from view\n[00:30.92]Haven\'t seen him for a while\n[00:37.18]I\'d like to ask him why\n[00:40.78]He hides behind a pillar\n[00:46.76]I\'d like to ask him why\n[00:50.24]His hurt seems so familiar\n[00:56.10]Does your boy ever smile\n[01:00.92]Does your boy ever smile\n[01:08.01]Only when you can\'t see him\n[01:22.45]No candy floss parade\n[01:24.79]For the boy who\'s Holy wired\n[01:32.01]No firework display\n[01:35.63]His presence was not desired\n[01:41.49]The boy who never smiled\n[01:45.05]With his thoughts of pure vermilion\n[01:51.41]Mixed with wild azure\n[01:53.43]For the painting of my Pavilion\n[02:00.65]Does your boy ever smile\n[02:05.57]Does your boy ever smile\n[02:12.51]He\'s no longer a child\n', '/stream/1892938'),
