w how you.\n[04:31.88]Every bone that you break,\n[04:33.82]if you bruise every ache,\n[04:35.52]it will heal because it\'s you.\n[04:39.62]Invincible,\n[04:41.84]unbeatable,\n[04:44.18]it\'s time to show how you.\n[04:47.78]Every bone that you break,\n[04:49.82]if you bruise every ache,\n[04:51.64]it will heal because it\'s you.\n[04:55.86]Invincible,\n[04:57.16]unbeatable,\n[04:59.19]it\'s time to show how you.\n', '/stream/1529588'),
(2274039, 602069, 'Faithbound - Lifted Higher', '福音灵魂乐，歌颂信仰带来力量与希望。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=613661&width=300&trackid=2274039', '[00:07.20]Intro:\n[00:07.21]Oooh, oooh, yeah\n[00:11.90]Ahh, ahh, lifted higher\n[00:16.02]Verse 1 (Eli):\n[00:16.26]Woke up this morning, feeling weak inside\n[00:19.94]But I heard a whisper, said “child, don’t hide”\n[00:24.02]Every trial, every tear, won’t break my stride\n[00:27.92]‘Cause You’re my rock, Lord, always by my side\n[00:31.92]Verse 2 (Mal & Josiah):\n[00:32.14]Mal: When the night is heavy, shadows fall\n[00:35.78]Josiah: I lift my hands and hear Your call\n[00:39.80]Mal: Your light surrounds me, I will stand tall\n[00:43.74]Josiah: With faith in my heart, I’ll never fall\n[00:46.34]Chorus (All):\n[00:46.38]We are lifted higher, by Your love and grace\n[00:50.06]Singing hallelujah, in this holy place\n[00:54.08]Hearts united stronger, nothing can replace\n[00:57.98]The joy You give, Lord, lifted higher in Your embrace\n[01:03.82]Verse 3 (Micah):\n[01:03.83]Every burden, every pain, I surrender to You\n[01:07.64]You’re the healer, the redeemer, faithful and true\n[01:11.52]Through the storm, through the rain, You bring me through\n[01:15.70]My soul rejoices, my spirit renewed\n[01:19.32]Bridge (Micah lead / others harmonize):\n[01:19.82]Oh Lord, lift me up, let Your mercy shine\n[01:25.28]In Your presence, I’m forever divine\n[01:28.26]Singing praises, reaching higher, Your love is mine\n[01:32.88]Lifted higher, oh Lord, in Your light I’ll climb\n[01:35.98]Chorus (All / full energy):\n[01:36.16]We are lifted higher, by Your love and grace\n[01:39.62]Singing hallelujah, in this holy place\n[01:43.70]Hearts united stronger, nothing can replace\n[01:47.48]The joy You give, Lord, lifted higher in Your embrace\n[01:55.00]Outro (All / soft harmonies):\n[01:56.14]Oooh, lifted higher…\n[01:57.76]Ahh, in Your embrace…\n[02:01.98]Lifted higher… yeah…\n', '/stream/2274039'),
(1227197, 470555, 'All I Ever Wanted', '渴望爱与理解的灵魂乐，心碎却温暖。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=147211&width=300&trackid=1227197', '[00:24.54]I\'m gonna breathe you\n[00:27.16]Cuz God knows I need you\n[00:35.34]I wanna love you so much it hurts\n[00:39.28]There are no words\n[00:44.92]But you don\'t exist in my world\n[00:49.66]All I ever wanted\n[00:53.02]Was to hold you in my heart\n[00:58.74]For all the world to see\n[01:01.16]All I ever wanted\n[01:04.50]Was for the whole world\n[01:09.74]To sing with me\n[01:22.22]There\'s plenty of room in our dimension\n[01:27.48]For a little more love comprehension\n[01:40.76]It don\'t matter\n[01:43.16]If I\'m talking about faith or peace or the human race\n[01:49.56]Cuz at the end of the day\n[01:55.38]My heart still breaks\n', '/stream/1227197'),
(2286885, 358454, 'Meet Me Where We Started - Master', '旧日恋人重游故地，期盼重燃旧情。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=618526&width=300&trackid=2286885', '[00:13.34]The years have passed, we drifted apart.\n[00:21.96]We had things that were ours,\n[00:24.40]now only tears at my heart.\n[00:31.10]We\'re on the same road,\n[00:33.62]so why make a turn?\n[00:37.16]I know we walk in the dark,\n[00:40.24]so let the light burn.\n[00:45.22]We\'ve walked the same path,\n[00:47.90]no need to turn.\n[00:52.20]In shadows we strike,\n[00:55.44]let the light burn.\n[00:59.46]Meet me where we started.\n[01:06.54]Meet me where it all began.\n[01:11.56]Meet me where we started.\n[01:20.62]We can do it all again.\n[01:40.31]The years have passed,\n[01:45.08]we drifted apart.\n[01:47.56]What once was love, has now left my heart.\n[01:56.71]The place where we met,\n[02:00.10]the river and the park.\n[02:04.82]If you remember,\n[02:07.76]we can leave the dark.\n[02:11.74]Memories come flooding back,\n[02:14.04]let us find the bench where we sat.\n[02:17.58]Through joy speaks and sorrow planes,\n[02:21.04]the essence our bond remains.\n[02:25.92]Meet me where we started.\n[02:32.96]Meet me where it all began.\n[02:40.06]Meet me where we started.\n[02:47.10]We can do it all again.\n[03:08.32]Meet me where we started.\n[03:15.34]Meet me where it all began.\n[03:33.10]Again, again, again, again, again.\n[03:42.46]L és\n[03:43.14]Thank you for watching.\n', '/stream/2286885'),
(469454, 355165, 'Moorlough shore', '爱尔兰民谣，诉说等待爱人归来的忧伤与忠贞。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=55583&width=300&trackid=469454', '[00:11.14]Your years and days in flowery veins,\n[00:17.40]That line even more, Lord, for sure.\n[00:22.68]Your vines that blow by burdens grow,\n[00:28.18]Will I ever see you o\'er?\n[00:34.12]Where the primrose glows in the valley growth,\n[00:39.88]Where the twilight and the sun will play,\n[00:45.50]With my life and who delight I do,\n[00:50.94]To spend my youthful day.\n[00:56.98]Last night I went to see my love,\n[01:03.08]And to hear what she might say,\n[01:07.80]To see if she\'d take pity on me,\n[01:14.24]Lest I might go away.\n[01:19.48]She said,\n[01:21.26]I loved an Irish lad,\n[01:25.22]And he was my only joy,\n[01:30.82]And ever since I saw his face,\n[01:36.76]I have loved that soldier boy.\n[01:53.52]Perhaps your soldier lad is lost,\n[01:59.04]Sailing over the sea\n[02:02.32]of Maine.\n[02:04.60]Or perhaps he\'s gone with some other one,\n[02:10.18]You may never see him again.\n[02:15.46]Well, if my Irish lad is lost,\n[02:21.64]He\'s the one I do adore.\n[02:26.56]At seven years I\'ll wait for him,\n[02:32.52]By the banks of the Mall of Shore.\n[03:09.47]At seven years I\'ll wait for him,\n[03:18.26]By the banks of the Mall of Shore.\n', '/stream/469454'),
