(2311845, 490580, 'Diabla', '拉丁舞曲说唱，讲述追求危险女孩的炽热恋情。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=630442&width=300&trackid=2311845', '[00:00.28]Pero te vas conmigo. Somos amigos. Ser el lío.\n[00:06.32]Lo consigo.\n[00:07.98]Tal vez, no sé Con él. Poder tocar tu piel.\n[00:15.32]Que sí o que no, pero te vas conmigo. Sí, no solo somos amigos. Dime si vamos a hacer el lío. O tal vez lo consigo. No, tal vez, tal vez, no sé No sé lo que puedas hacer con él. Lo que tengo claro es que lo que quiero es poder tocarme tu piel.\n[00:47.12]Pare, lo que tu tienes ahora es la clave de mi cora tu tienes la llave tu eres mi diabla la que lo sabe soy un bandido, soy un maleante un delincuente, yo soy tu gante por ti roba, borazo y cantante quiere que vuelva a tiempo de antes.\n[01:02.46]Pare clave la llave ¿Quién lo sabe?\n[01:09.10]Maleante.\n[01:10.72]Yo soy tu Gantem. Cantante. Tiempo de antes.\n[01:17.58]Dímelo Veng. Vente conmigo vamos a hacerlo. Ya no me fío tu eres muy mala. Tu eres malvada yo quiero un beso. Mami que rico como lo explico. Que estoy loco bien crazy. Quiero besarte quiero comerte. Déjame mira como crece. Muévelo rápido si que lo.\n[01:34.10]Migo, fío, mala, malvada, qué rico, loco, loco, mira cómo crece.\n[01:49.36]Pare, lo que tú tienes ahora es la clave, de mi cora tú tienes la llave, tú eres mi diabla la que lo sabe, soy un bandido, soy un maleante, un delincuente, yo soy tu. Por ti roba, borazo y cantante Quieres que vuelva a tiempo de antes...\n[02:20.82]Pare, lo que tú tienes ahora es la clave De mi cora tú tienes la llave. Tú eres mi diabla, la que lo sabe Soy un bandido, soy un maleante. Un delincuente, yo soy tu gante Por ti roba, borazo y cantante. Quieres que vuelva a tiempo de antes.\n[02:35.52]Migo, fío, mala, malvada, que rico, loco, loco, mira como crece\n', '/stream/2311845'),
(1534631, 363811, 'Atlas', '少年吞下地图，怀念过去，渴望远行却害怕孤独。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=175735&width=300&trackid=1534631', '[00:04.94]Je replonge vers mon passé\n[00:08.74]Qui était simple et sans souci\n[00:15.90]Je regrette qu\'aujourd\'hui\n[00:20.70]S\'étrangle ma naïveté\n[00:27.54]Je souffle sur des braises\n[00:32.88]Qui ne peuvent me réchauffer\n[00:38.46]Je regarde mal à l\'aise\n[00:43.50]Ma jeunesse s\'évaporer\n[00:49.76]C\'est l\'histoire\n[00:52.32]D\'un enfant qui aimait les voyages\n[01:01.06]C\'est l\'espoir\n[01:03.24]D\'un départ pour de lointains rivages\n[01:11.34]Mais je constate un rien sévère\n[01:17.76]Qu\'il suffirait de peu de choses\n[01:23.00]Car je sais que sur cette terre\n[01:28.94]Tout appartient à ceux qui osent\n[01:34.84]Mais devrai-je être solitaire ?\n[01:40.58]Et prendre des risques salutaires\n[01:46.20]Je ne voudrai pas finir seul\n[01:50.82]Pour que mes amours s\'immolent\n[01:57.48]Alors je dévore mon atlas\n[01:59.70]Et j\'envie les trains qui passent\n[02:00.48]Ils me couvrent de leurs sarcasmes\n[02:00.49]Car eux au moins dévorent l\'espace\n', '/stream/1534631'),
(1852866, 475967, 'Igor Pumphonia - Ride It', '氛围电子乐搭配空灵人声，营造宁静梦幻的放松氛围。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=201275&width=300&trackid=1852866', '[00:30.00]I know you.\n[00:33.90]And children never leave.\n[00:41.00]You make me\n[00:42.34]like a horse.\n[00:44.80]And children never leave.\n[00:50.80]But no.\n[01:14.67]You make me like a horse.\n[01:20.88]And children never leave.\n[01:30.00]But no.\n[01:32.93]And children never leave.\n[02:00.78]But no.\n[02:51.88]You make me like a horse.\n[02:57.62]And children never leave.\n[03:03.67]You make me like a horse.\n[03:09.30]And children never leave.\n[03:26.51]You make me like a horse.\n', '/stream/1852866'),
(2292724, 600977, 'A. Asurov - Voice of the Structure   (Голос структуры)', '俄语灵魂乐，神秘而励志，讲述默默引导他人走出黑暗。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=621143&width=300&trackid=2292724', '[00:13.00]18. ?  VOICE OF STRUCTURE - Голос структуры\n[00:13.01]I’m not here to flip the world around,\n[00:16.32]I stand in the moment where you might go off course.\n[00:19.44]I don’t act from power — there’s no such aim,\n[00:23.32]I come for those who are alone in the dark.\n[00:26.56]I won’t join a fight just to break it all,\n[00:29.72]Don’t expect me to lift the whole world up.\n[00:33.06]I’ll quietly shift the key that’s in your hands,\n[00:36.28]So you can find yourself beneath other people’s words.\n[00:39.70]I won’t kill — I’ll rearrange the shadow,\n[00:43.18]I’ll forge winter into a summer day.\n[00:46.50]I’ll remove the barrier from the shores,\n[00:49.86]Or build a bridge made from clouds.\n[00:52.84]I see the trace that hid inside your soul,\n[00:55.94]And the fear that long took root in your blood.\n[00:59.30]I work with what was sunk beneath the ice:\n[01:02.68]What keeps you from moving forward,\n[01:05.76]I wipe away the ban that blocked your dreaming,\n[01:09.48]So you can create your world from scratch.\n[01:15.36]My touch may seem like nothing at all,\n[01:19.28]You’ll say, “I was just lucky, that’s all.”\n[01:22.70]But I was the one who guided the event,\n[01:25.98]So help could arrive right on time.\n[01:29.24]Don’t expect me to grant every whim,\n[01:32.56]I see what drags you down.\n[01:35.94]I will go against your words when needed,\n[01:39.54]But never to harm what you do.\n[01:42.78]My power — it’s your answer:\n[01:45.38]Are you ready to shed the weight of past years?\n[01:49.34]Where shame and roots of darkness hold you,\n[01:52.48]I will burn them out — only you will remain.\n[01:55.96](repeat Verse 2)\n[01:57.44]If the path is blocked — I find a bypass,\n[01:59.32]No chance — I change the outcome.\n[02:02.70]I’ll tear down the walls that hold you inside,\n[02:04.84]But above all — you must step forward yourself.\n[02:09.36]I’ll turn the breath of the winds around,\n[02:10.56]So the storm won’t touch your dreams,\n[02:12.74]So thunder passes beyond the ridge,\n[02:14.70]And here only rain will gently touch you.\n[02:14.71]When there’s nowhere to find a solution,\n[02:14.72]I appear within the created field.\n[02:17.62]The task is done — and then I’ll go,\n[02:33.98]So that you can feel your own strength.\n[02:59.56](repeat Verse 2)\n[03:01.22]I walk in a space where shadows do not stay,\n[03:04.28]I loosen knots deep in the roots.\n[03:04.76]I change the current that has frozen in you,\n[03:06.02]I’ll show you where the source of power is.\n[03:08.90]I don’t heal, but I release the clamp,\n[03:09.22]I alter the grid under a foreign wind.\n[03:11.18]I’ll remove the collapse from your path,\n[03:12.42]So the road won’t break you.\n[03:14.28]18. ГОЛОС СТРУКТУРЫ\n[03:17.68]Я не для того, чтоб мир перевернуть,\n[03:19.40]Я в том моменте, где ты мог свернуть.\n[03:21.34]Я делаю не исходя из власти, нет таких причин,\n[03:27.68]Я для тех, кто в темноте один.\n[03:30.90]Я не войду в борьбу, чтоб всё сломать,\n[03:37.14]Не жди, что я смогу весь мир поднять.\n[03:40.96]Я сдвину тихо ключ в твоих руках,\n[03:43.38]Чтоб ты себя нашел в чужих словах.\n[03:44.52]Я не убью, я переставлю тень,\n[03:47.38]Я переплавлю зиму в летний день.\n', '/stream/2292724'),
(1820998, 510867, 'COMING BACK TO YOU', '走出阴霾重回爱人身边，充满希望与浪漫。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=370714&width=300&trackid=1820998', '[00:16.34]Feeling alright\n[00:17.04]From any point of view\n[00:19.38]Got outta dark\n[00:21.30]I’m coming back to you\n[00:23.82]Turning around\n[00:25.48]See the world as brand new\n[00:27.82]I shout out loud\n[00:29.26]That I come back to you\n[00:32.22]I’m coming back\n[00:37.70]Felling alright,doing alright baby\n[00:40.76]I’m coming back\n[00:44.34]Love me tonight\n[00:45.28]And even if all lights fall down\n[00:52.68]I swear you’ll be the only one\n[00:56.72]Together we will have some fun\n[01:00.86]I’m coming back to you\n[01:05.30]And if our world will go astray\n[01:08.84]We surely will find perfect way\n[01:12.90]To enjoy each specific day\n[01:16.86]I’m coming back to you\n[01:19.42]Never again\n[01:21.34]Ain’t gonna feel sad and blue\n[01:23.28]I drive a right lane\n[01:25.22]I’m coming back to you\n[01:27.54]Drift to my shore\n[01:29.44]Sit down on my pew\n[01:31.48]True feelings galore\n[01:33.28]Yeah I come back to you\n[01:36.10]I’m coming back\n[01:41.72]Feeling alright,living alright baby\n[01:44.60]I’m coming back\n[01:47.72]Love me tonight\n[01:51.72]And even if all lights fall down\n[01:56.88]I swear you’ll be the only one\n[02:00.92]Together we will have some fun\n[02:04.92]I’m coming back to you\n[02:08.08]And if our world will go astray\n[02:12.90]We surely will find perfect way\n[02:16.32]To enjoy each specific day\n[03:08.34]I’m coming back to you\n', '/stream/1820998'),
