(1495726, 371777, 'Shadow', '霓虹合成器流行，暗夜中追逐只留影子的恋人。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=172498&width=300&trackid=1495726', '[00:19.24]Girl I\'ve been looking for you\n[00:24.00]But you only move in the dark\n[00:29.08]So tell me how to find you\n[00:33.55]Cause I don\'t even know just where to start\n[00:38.60]Baby, I don\'t know where you are\n[00:43.86]It\'s an all alone in the dark\n[00:47.48]So lie down where that leads to your heart\n[00:52.67]Now I can only see your shadow\n[00:57.90]But girl,\n[00:58.50]I wanna bring you into the light Now I can only see your shadow\n[01:06.48]But baby, tell me that you\'ll be my new night\n[01:33.43]She\'s dancing in the moonlight She\'s moving till the sun comes up\n[01:43.44]Be careful how you\'re moving She got a fire that will burn you up\n[01:52.38]Baby,\n[01:53.44]I don\'t know where you are It\'s an all alone in\n[01:59.30]the dark So lie down where that leads to your\n[02:04.16]heart Now I can only see your shadow But girl,\n[02:12.34]I wanna bring you into the light Now I can only see your shadow\n[02:21.00]But baby, tell me that you\'ll be my new night\n[03:05.46]Baby,\n[03:07.26]I don\'t know where you are It\'s an all alone in\n[03:13.14]the dark So lie down where that leads to your heart\n[03:21.00]Now I can only see your shadow\n[03:25.64]But girl,\n[03:26.18]I wanna bring you into the light Now\n[03:30.42]I can only see your shadow But baby,\n[03:35.54]tell me that you\'ll be my new night\n[04:18.82]Thanks for watching!\n[04:49.63]Thanks for watching!\n[04:57.94]Thanks for watching!\n', '/stream/1495726'),
(1480423, 461414, 'The Path To Power', '史诗感的原声配乐，充满力量与能量。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=387576&width=300&trackid=1480423', '[00:30.38]Amen.\n[01:34.16]Chacness\n[01:38.48]Precious\n', '/stream/1480423'),
(405928, 352727, 'Martha & Mary', '民谣讲述马大和马利亚的故事，温暖平静。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=50387&width=300&trackid=405928', '[00:08.30]Martha and Mary\n[00:09.14]Martha and Mary were sisters\n[00:10.82]As different as chalk and cheese\n[00:16.50]Martha was uptight most of her life\n[00:20.38]For Mary, life was a breeze\n[00:25.66]She never worried ‘bout her future\n[00:28.46]Or felt guilty about her past\n[00:34.04]She only lived for the present\n[00:37.92]And how she could make it last\n[00:42.76]She knew that life was for living\n[00:47.06]She wasn\'t an also ran\n[00:51.00]And while Martha was fussing in the Kitchen\n[00:56.04]Mary was listening to the man\n[01:01.56]One day Jesus came calling\n[01:05.74]He dropped in to say hello\n[01:08.52]He brought along some disciples\n[01:14.34]He thought they should get to know\n[01:19.12]Martha started feeling real nervous\n[01:22.92]She worried about how she was dressed\n[01:26.68]So she beat a retreat to the kitchen\n[01:31.78]To get some food for her guests\n[01:36.52]She wondered if they\'d like the apple tart\n[01:40.30]Or cookies with strawberry jam\n[01:44.70]And while Martha was fussing in the Kitchen\n[01:50.92]Mary was listening to the man\n[01:54.10]She sat at his feet and she listened\n[01:58.80]To everything he had to say\n[02:03.76]He realised that she knew where she was at\n[02:07.92]As she sat there on that day\n[02:12.64]Meanwhile out in the kitchen\n[02:16.88]Martha was getting uptight\n[02:21.22]Buttering the scones\n[02:23.12]All on her own\n[02:25.44]She felt that it just wasn’t right\n[02:29.40]It was slowly driving her crazy\n[02:33.68]That her sister wouldn’t lend her a hand\n[02:37.18]And while Martha was fussing in the Kitchen\n[02:42.76]Mary was listening to the man\n[02:48.46]Martha confronted Jesus\n[02:52.58]She told him it just wasn’t fair\n[02:56.90]She just couldn’t hide\n[02:59.02]She was burning inside\n[03:01.44]She had to have help out there\n[03:04.68]He told her when she worried ‘bout so many things\n[03:09.86]There was no room for love in her heart\n[03:14.44]She had to slow down\n[03:16.70]Stop running around\n[03:18.92]Her sister chose the better part\n[03:23.24]She sat by his side and she listened\n[03:27.62]He calmed her and took her hand\n[03:31.72]There was nobody fussing in the kitchen\n[04:09.97]And Martha was listening to the man\n', '/stream/405928'),
(1932670, 510867, 'RED LIGHT', '渴望释放的舞曲，拒绝红灯阻拦，情绪炽热急切。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=477294&width=300&trackid=1932670', '[00:03.34]I’ve been waiting for so long to\n[00:07.62]Try to get things going on,\n[00:11.20]My mental health is about to break,\n[00:15.48]It’s give and take game,it’s give and take..\n[00:19.88]Out of control,in strange state-\n[00:23.96]There’s no reason left here to wait,\n[00:27.82]You make me lose my head and mind,\n[00:31.48]I get unwind,\n[00:35.28]You gotta give me this-\n[00:37.08]No red light!\n[00:38.20]Want to have all of this\n[00:41.30]All night,\n[00:42.44]When we’re so close to this-\n[00:45.30]No red light!\n[00:47.50]Ain’t no red light!\n[00:51.96]Don’t tell me no,I need\n[00:53.48]No red light!\n[00:54.78]Refuse to do this-\n[00:57.50]It’s a suicide,\n[00:58.94]I can’t get over this-\n[01:01.92]No red light!\n[01:03.32]Ain’t no red light!\n[01:11.68]I’ve been patient,I’ve been good\n[01:15.60]So don’t let me be misunderstood,\n[01:19.24]Your body needs mine almost all of the time,\n[01:23.62]Say you’ll be here,say you’ll be mine,\n[01:28.10]In a chaos, in a mess\n[01:32.26]I lived lately and I need to confess-\n[01:36.00]You make me lose my head and mind,\n[01:40.00]I get unwind..\n[01:43.54]You gotta give me this-\n[01:45.32]No red light!\n[01:46.40]Want to have all of this\n[01:49.44]All night,\n[01:50.96]When we’re so close to this-\n[01:53.62]No red light!\n[01:55.74]Ain’t no red light!\n[02:00.22]Don’t tell me no,I need\n[02:01.72]No red light!\n[02:04.02]Refuse to do this-\n[02:05.74]It’s a suicide,\n[02:07.18]I can’t get over this-\n[02:10.10]No red light!\n[03:04.90]Ain’t no red light!\n', '/stream/1932670'),
(1478753, 439258, 'Dont go', '孤独中挣扎，恳求爱人不要离去。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=171086&width=300&trackid=1478753', '[00:32.54]And when the lights are shut till dawn\n[00:35.10]And swallowed by the sea\n[00:40.26]I\'ll bear my wearied mind to something close\n[00:44.22]To eternity\n[00:48.08]Some things are not easy to let go\n[00:52.24]Sometimes it takes some time\n[00:55.32]I drag myself and hold myself\n[00:58.98]Between the lines\n[01:19.64]Chorus:\n[01:19.65]Naked and lonesome\n[01:21.16]Turn into the inside\n[01:23.14]Beating the alarm bell\n[01:25.44]I teach myself indifference\n[01:30.58]I teach myself that it\'s fair\n[01:36.24]It\'s hard but it\'s fair\n[01:53.66]My dear baby we will never know\n[01:57.72]When it starts when it stops\n[02:01.78]Now i battle on my own\n[02:04.64]With dark\n[02:07.00]We let it out it\'s time to rest\n[02:13.46]And think and bleed and weep\n[02:17.42]The Sun goes down and rise each day\n[02:20.26]One day we will\n[02:40.96]Chorus:\n[02:41.00]Naked and lonesome\n[02:42.44]Turn into the inside\n[02:44.44]Beating the alarm bell\n[02:46.74]I teach myself indifference\n[02:51.94]I teach myself that it\'s fair\n[02:55.20]It\'s hard but it\'s fair\n[03:01.06]Baby don\'t go\n[03:05.06]Baby don\'t go\n', '/stream/1478753'),
(1822983, 529425, 'Mind Loss', '氛围电子曲，歌词近乎空白，弥漫忧郁孤独的失神感。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=198705&width=300&trackid=1822983', '[00:01.78]Thank you.\n[00:36.00]oh\n[01:01.18]oh\n[01:33.42].\n[01:37.76].\n[01:42.24].\n[02:07.36].\n[02:12.52].\n[02:15.72].\n[02:35.22].\n[02:43.36].\n[02:46.90].\n[03:11.18].\n[03:14.70].\n[03:19.94].\n[03:35.40].\n[03:41.74].\n[03:41.82].\n[04:01.06].\n[04:01.96].\n[04:01.97].\n', '/stream/1822983'),
(964541, 424916, 'DO YA', '法语情歌，反复追问爱人是否依然爱自己，旋律融合爵士与电子。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=113423&width=300&trackid=964541', '[00:15.54]DO YA (est-ce que tu?)\n[00:15.55]pourrais-tu me dire combien tu m\'aimes encore?\n[00:20.82]j\'oublierai à chaque nuit les mots les plus fort\n[00:29.12]j\'ai besoin que tu cries ton amour même quand je dors\n[00:37.48]peut être je ne te demanderais plus alors\n[00:42.76]DO Y DO YA (est ce que tu?) est ce que tu m\'aimes encore?\n[00:50.16]DO Y DO YA (est ce que tu?) est ce que tu m\'aimes encore?\n[01:07.00]je ne t\'entends plus me dire de chiffres au hasard\n[01:12.94]quand je te demande combien tu m\'aimes dans le noir\n[01:21.20]tu dis qu\'l\'infini n\'existe plus à deux heures moins le quart\n[01:29.10]même si je sais que tu m\'aimes j\'ai besoin de savoir\n[01:34.92]DO Y DO YA (est ce que tu?) est ce que tu m\'aimes encore?\n[01:43.18]DO Y DO YA (est ce que tu?) est ce que tu m\'aimes encore?\n[01:50.16]vois-tu comme tu m\'as drogué le coeur?\n[01:58.04]dis le moi oh dis le moi encore\n[02:03.72]DO Y DO YA (est ce que tu?) est ce que tu m\'aimes encore?\n[02:10.80]DO Y DO YA (est ce que tu?) est ce que tu m\'aimes encore?\n', '/stream/964541'),
(1230405, 471621, 'Time Travel (Feat. Blanchard De Wave)', '时光无法倒流，爱情逝去只剩遗憾与追忆。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=147554&width=300&trackid=1230405', '[00:12.30]Verse 1:\n[00:12.32]Let’s go back in time\n[00:13.90]When you and I were uncomplicated\n[00:23.76]Let’s go back in time\n[00:25.82]Before I felt what I felt when you did what you did that night\n[00:32.88]Pre-Chorus:\n[00:34.74]Once upon, upon a time\n[00:38.94]I thought you were the man in my mind\n[00:45.60]But oh, how fooled we can be\n[00:51.16]When we see with our eyes but our hearts lead the way blindly\n[00:56.16]Chorus:\n[00:57.28]Time travel ain’t possible (it’s impossible) (x3)\n[01:02.96]Time travel ain’t possible (that’s the way that love goes)\n[01:08.66]Verse 2:\n[01:08.67]If I went back in time\n[01:10.18]Before you took advantage\n[01:10.68]When I let my guard down, damn I would have thought about it\n[01:14.34]I would never allowed us to\n[01:16.74]Feel what we felt when we did what we did that night\n[01:19.76]Blanchard De Wave Verse:\n[01:19.77]Wish they was goin’ 88 in the DeLorean\n[01:23.00]To back before the ‘Breakup’, Jennifer Aniston\n[01:46.98]Co-starrin’ Vince Vaughn, and they was made up\n[01:49.02]That’s without the Makiage, I can see him mackin’ her\n[01:49.03]Shorty what’s happenin’\n[01:52.58]Who’d of thought 30 years later they’d be divorcin’ huh?\n[02:34.18]In the courthouse dividing up the fortune\n[02:36.98]It’s such a sad case of misfortune\n[02:39.98]Time travel ain’t possible (it’s impossible) (x4)\n[02:45.90]Time travel ain’t possible (that’s the way that love goes)\n[03:08.68]Time travel ain’t possible\n[03:11.98](That’s the way, that’s the way, that’s the way that love goes) (x3)\n', '/stream/1230405'),
