(2232708, 475085, 'Brighter Than Any Star', '一首温柔的治愈情歌，鼓励爱人发现自己如星辰般闪耀的美丽。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=595250&width=300&trackid=2232708', '[00:07.36]When you\'re hiding in your shadow\n[00:10.22]You can\'t see what I can see\n[00:14.92]Believe me when I tell you\n[00:18.42]You\'re a star in this galaxy\n[00:22.80]When you mirror this cruel reflection\n[00:26.20]You see flaws where beauty lies\n[00:30.00]But in my eyes there\'s no rejection Your sunrise\n[00:34.98]in disguise If I could show you How beautiful you\n[00:44.02]are You\'d shine like the sun Brighter than any star\n[01:01.38]You\'d shine like the sun Brighter than any star When\n[01:17.18]you\'re hiding in your shadow You can\'t see what I can see\n[01:23.96]Believe me when I tell you You\'re a star in this galaxy\n[01:31.20]When you mirror this cruel reflection You see flaws where beauty\n[01:37.80]lies But in my eyes there\'s no rejection Your sunrise in disguise\n[01:46.26]If I could show you How beautiful you are You\'d shine like the sun\n[02:00.04]Brighter than any star If I could show you How beautiful\n[02:08.08]you are You\'d shine like the sun Brighter than any star\n[02:32.77]If I could show you How beautiful you are\n', '/stream/2232708'),
