(1187331, 347454, 'Island Lullabye', '夏威夷风情的民谣摇篮曲，伴海浪与月光入梦。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=142919&width=300&trackid=1187331', '[00:16.76]Island Lullaby\n[00:16.86]When the waves roll in and sing of old romances\n[00:22.42]When the flowers scent the air with rich perfume\n[00:33.08]When the palm tree in the evening wind dances\n[00:39.88]To the rhythms of an old Hawaiian tune\n[00:46.60]That’s the time that moonlight shines upon the water\n[00:55.30]In a silver shimmer pleasant to the eye\n[01:02.76]When the island sings to all her sons and daughters\n[01:13.10]Then we all can dream to an island lullaby\n[01:18.70]When an island girl all scented like  a flower\n[01:29.16]Swaying like a breeze in a hula spell\n[01:37.44]Tells a story of the island’s magic power\n[01:43.26]In secret words no tongue can ever tell\n[01:53.32]That means the rhythm of the island moon has caught her\n[02:01.34]And taken her where wings can never fly\n[02:07.16]When the island sings to all her sons and daughters\n[02:17.10]Then we all can dream to an island lullaby\n[02:56.10]That means the rhythm of the island moon has caught her\n[03:03.86]And taken her where wings can never fly\n[03:11.76]When the island sings to all her sons and daughters\n[03:19.52]Then we all can dream to an island lullaby\n', '/stream/1187331'),
