(2280858, 532087, 'Forsaken Warrior', '被梦境困住的战士，在现实与虚幻间挣扎呐喊。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=615807&width=300&trackid=2280858', '[00:30.00]in silent skies\n[00:35.72]shadows dance with open eyes\n[00:42.62]dreams get sharp like\n[00:44.26]broken glass\n[00:49.74]I won\'t let this fandom pass\n[00:56.40]can\'t you see all\n[00:58.58]the writing\'s on the wall the line between reality the\n[01:05.84]dream begins to blur forsaken warrior forever caught in time\n[01:17.72]trapped in my own dream\n[01:20.32]no way out no end between\n[01:44.30]clocks erased\n[01:45.78]no exit sign\n[01:51.26]prisoner of my only sign\n[01:58.10]Kenny eyes and souls untamed\n[02:04.94]Woke up once but not again\n[02:11.82]Can\'t you see all the writings on the wall\n[02:17.00]The line between reality and dream\n[02:21.18]Out of reach and blurred\n[02:26.40]Forsaken warrior Forever caught in time\n[02:33.26]Trapped in my own dream No way out,\n[02:37.00]no in between\n[03:11.66]Do you see what I see?\n[03:13.96]Do you feel what I feel?\n[03:15.66]Do you need what I need?\n[03:17.16]You don\'t need no bad seed\n[03:19.24]Do I want to kill?\n[03:20.94]Do I want to die?\n[03:22.64]Do I want to give up?\n[03:23.98]Oh, I don\'t give a fuck, no\n[03:47.88]Can\'t you see all the writings on the wall\n[03:52.45]The line between reality and dream Out of reach and blurred Forsaken\n[04:03.50]warrior Forever caught in time Trapped in my own dream No way out,\n[04:12.94]no in between\n[04:22.97]Do you see what I see?\n[04:24.60]Do you need what I see?\n', '/stream/2280858'),
(1969660, 348835, 'Pyre (feat.Happy Little Accidents,Jade Gritty & Aurc)', '电子氛围下的低吟浅唱，关于燃烧与离去的静谧独白。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=494122&width=300&trackid=1969660', '[00:08.74]Make your choice\n[00:08.75]And watch me leave\n[00:08.76]On fire\n[00:08.77]Send me off\n[00:08.78]And leave me be\n[00:08.79]I’m on fire\n[00:08.80]Hold your breath\n[00:08.81]And play for keeps\n[00:08.82]We’re On fire\n[00:08.83]All I need\n[00:26.82]Is all we keep\n[00:31.10]On Fire\n[01:43.26]Once in a while\n[01:45.00]I’ll find some way\n[01:47.64]Once in a trial\n[01:51.34]I’ll find my\n[02:56.88]Space\n[02:59.20]My grace\n', '/stream/1969660'),
(2266451, 510926, 'Grace and Glory', '一首颂扬神恩与荣耀的敬拜歌曲，旋律温暖而充满希望。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=609069&width=300&trackid=2266451', '[00:20.98]Grace and Glory\n[00:20.99]Chorus:\n[00:21.00]Salvation belongs to our God,\n[00:24.54]To the Lamb, forever adored.\n[00:30.06]By grace, we stand on holy ground,\n[00:34.44]To witness glory so profound.\n[00:36.98]What joy to serve, what awe to see—\n[00:39.74]Your matchless power and majesty!\n[00:41.88]Verse 1:\n[00:41.89]You sit enthroned in majesty,\n[00:44.30]Adorned in light beyond our sight.\n[00:47.10]The heavens tremble at Your voice,\n[00:49.64]Yet in Your mercy, we rejoice.\n[00:52.52]The Lamb once slain, now crowned above,\n[00:55.02]You reign in justice, truth, and love.\n[00:57.96]Though many fail to see Your grace,\n[01:00.66]All creation will bow to You. *Chorus*\n[01:04.48]Verse 2:\n[01:06.00]Your kindness reaches far and wide,\n[01:08.40]In every trial, You still abide.\n[01:09.00]You formed the stars, yet know our frame,\n[01:09.16]And call the lowly by their name.\n[01:14.16]Grant us wisdom for the race,\n[01:37.69]To seek Your truth and know Your face.\n[01:40.63]You alone bring light and grace—\n[01:43.11]Let Your Spirit fill this place. *Chorus*\n[01:46.45]Bridge:\n[01:47.31]Hearts ablaze, our spirits cry—\n[01:51.67]“Yours the kingdom, power, and light!”\n[01:55.41]Oh, what honour to kneel and sing,\n[01:59.39]Before our Saviour, God, and King! (2x) *Chorus*\n[02:59.79]Copyright 2025 Richard Shekari\n[03:11.67]Written, produced and performed by Richard Shekari\n', '/stream/2266451'),
(2203626, 508143, 'Alive', '因爱重生，从挣扎走向自由与希望', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=581062&width=300&trackid=2203626', '[00:15.70]I was down before\n[00:17.38]A war in my head\n[00:19.96]I was sick of fighting\n[00:22.10]I wanted something more\n[00:25.62]In my life\n[00:27.44]I couldn’t find my way\n[00:32.76]I think I ran out of time, oh\n[00:36.94]You must have heard me pray\n[00:40.30]Cause you came, cleared the sky\n[00:43.78]I am free, I survived\n[00:49.74]Do you feel my heat\n[00:52.86]You make my life complete\n[00:57.26]You’re the one I need\n[01:00.94]You’re the air I breathe\n[01:04.48]I really tried before\n[01:09.12]I struggled with life\n[01:11.66]I was sick of hiding\n[01:14.48]I couldn’t break the core\n[01:16.52]Now I’m free, I survived\n[01:20.98]Cause of you, I’m alive\n[01:24.42]Do you feel my heat\n[01:29.78]You make my life complete\n[01:33.20]You’re the one I need\n[01:37.84]You’re the air I breathe\n[01:41.56]I’m alive\n[01:42.94]I’m alive\n[01:44.74]Cause of you I’m alive\n[01:48.36]You can make me cry\n[01:52.56]You can make me fly\n[01:56.02]I’m alive\n[01:58.78]I couldn’t see where I was going\n[02:07.44]I guess I needed you to show it\n[02:11.34]How to rise and smile and be alive\n[02:19.42]Do you feel my heat\n[02:24.92]You make my life complete\n[02:29.00]You’re the one that I need\n[02:33.22]You’re the air I breathe\n[02:41.60]I’m alive\n[02:42.92]I’m alive\n[02:44.90]Cause of you I’m alive\n[02:48.94]You can make me cry\n[02:51.96]You can make me fly\n[02:55.84]I’m alive\n[02:57.54]I’m alive\n[02:59.94]Cause of you I’m alive\n[03:03.16]You can make me cry\n[03:06.90]You can make me fly\n[03:15.72]I’m alive\n', '/stream/2203626'),
(1017600, 432069, 'The first day', '民谣吟唱生命初日与时光流逝，温暖治愈。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=119867&width=300&trackid=1017600', '[00:00.00]I saw the first day there has ever been\n[00:08.48]And I heard first birds sing\n[00:16.47]Saw the first sun climb into the first sky\n[00:25.27]But you know I never thought or wondered why\n[00:33.94]This is a day like no other\n[00:38.16]There will never\n[00:40.80]be another\n[00:43.26]Each moment that passes\n[00:47.32]Will never come again\n[00:52.22]Love is the only thing The joy that every season brings\n[00:59.42]Can warm the spirit\n[01:02.24]When the night is cold So may the rolling thunder pass you by\n[01:15.06]May you\n[01:17.02]live your life\n[01:20.98]Spirit fly\n[01:22.24]May you find your path\n[01:25.44]To go back\n[01:30.55]Sometimes the night is cold\n[01:36.13]You know that there\'s no going back\n[01:44.18]Some things you have\n[01:48.14]Some things you lack\n[01:50.54]But you know that you carry with you Everything you pack\n[01:57.74]So may the rolling thunder pass you by May you live your\n[02:08.74]life May your spirit fly May you find the path To go back\n[02:24.29]Thanks for watching!\n', '/stream/1017600'),
