.48]Put it on me I’m ready\n[02:15.34]Whatever it is I carry I carry I got it\n[02:26.34]She said her favorite color yellow\n[02:30.08]And it look girl on her dress whether slim thick or not you’re still pretty nonetheless don’t go falling\n[02:37.12]Though your heart is broken summertime crashes never noticed\n[02:41.92]A little bit to kind\n[02:44.04]She a little bit too emotional\n[02:46.02]cry your cry your heart out\n[02:47.88]let me know what’s going on I’ll make you feel mellow ￼\n[02:57.06]When you see her tell her hello for me\n[03:03.88]She said her favorite color...\n', '/stream/1784196'),
