(2315285, 597553, 'Loving You All My Days', '分手后仍深情不改，誓言爱她一生一世。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=631899&width=300&trackid=2315285', '[00:02.25]And she wakes up, and she makes up\n[00:06.60]And she says, I think it\'s time to break up\n[00:10.02]And she sighs now, and smiles goodbye now\n[00:13.32]And then she says, I think it\'s time to cry now\n[00:17.32]And then she walks away\n[00:20.42]And there\'s only one thing to say\n[00:22.98]I\'ll be loving you all my days\n[00:26.68]I\'ll be loving you in a thousand ways\n[00:30.08]I\'ll be loving you all my days\n[00:34.64]This my love I pray And the days pass,\n[00:38.90]and the tears pass And the years end,\n[00:42.54]all the beers pass\n[00:44.36]And I sigh now,\n[00:45.48]sometimes I cry now And I wonder every night just why now\n[00:51.56]I dream of when she walked away And there\'s only one thing to say\n[01:00.94]I\'ll be loving you in a thousand ways I\'ll be loving you all my days\n[01:08.94]This my love I pray The clock will turn And the\n[01:15.26]candle will burn And the torch grow cold As the heart\n[01:23.76]grows old\n[01:37.43]And she\'s gone now,\n[01:40.38]and it\'s all wrong now Lord,\n[01:42.84]I just have to be strong now I won\'t forget her,\n[01:47.22]always regret her And I know I\'ll never meet her better I\n[01:52.96]remember when she went away When the only thing I could say\n[01:59.86]I\'ll be loving you all my days I\'ll be loving you\n[02:04.40]in a thousand ways I\'ll be loving you all my days\n[02:10.66]This my love I pray\n[02:14.02]This my love I pray\n[02:17.48]This my love I pray\n', '/stream/2315285'),
