(1968609, 7063, 'Handcrafted', '一群少年在手工平原上狂欢，无惧世界终结，掀起一场革命。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=493526&width=300&trackid=1968609', '[00:00.60]Ten thousand miles away from on oppressive home\n[00:04.94]The kids are going faster than the speed of light\n[00:09.94]Some of them will never come back\n[00:13.14]Some of them will touch the sky\n[00:20.36]Spending their holidays on a handcrafted plain\n[00:25.02]Not afraid of entering the twilight zone\n[00:30.12]Something changed in their eyes, in their minds\n[00:33.60]Don’t even try to stop them, try to join them\n[00:40.32]Something weird in their eyes, in their minds\n[00:43.64]A revolution\n[00:45.82]They’re leaving ‘cause the world is coming to an end\n[00:49.06]Everything’s on fire, but they’re still having fun\n[00:59.88]Some of them will never forget\n[01:03.14]Some of them will cross the stars\n[01:10.62]Spending their holidays on a handcrafted plain\n[01:15.04]Not afraid of entering the twilight zone\n[01:20.30]Something changed in their eyes, in their minds\n[01:23.62]Don’t even try to stop them, try to join them\n[01:30.64]Something weird in their eyes, in their minds\n[01:33.68]A revolution\n[01:35.82]Something weird in their eyes, in their minds\n[01:38.48]A revolution\n[02:00.70]Something changed in their eyes, in their minds\n[02:03.58]Don’t even try to stop them\n[02:10.76]Something weird in their eyes, in their minds\n[02:13.68]A revolution\n', '/stream/1968609'),
