(636962, 362501, 'Sit And Hope And Wait', '在等待中寻找希望，勇敢迎接新的开始。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=73787&width=300&trackid=636962', '[00:00.50]Wait.\n[00:04.72]Wait.\n[00:08.46]Wait.\n[00:13.57]I can see it clear.\n[00:21.16]Although your image always disappears.\n[00:26.21]It must be a picture with a twist.\n[00:31.43]Just like a thrill ride that can be missed.\n[00:36.10]Well, let\'s get lost again.\n[00:41.90]The world may stop, but my dream will never end.\n[00:45.80]Yeah.\n[00:47.96]Well, listen to the colors of your heart.\n[00:53.84]It\'s never too late for a brand new start.\n[00:56.64]I don\'t want to sit and hope and wait.\n[01:06.59]I want to sit and hope and wait.\n[01:10.50]Wait.\n[01:22.41]Well, I could never plan a great escape.\n[01:28.14]Sometimes you have to eat what\'s on your plate.\n[01:33.86]I don\'t want to sit and hope and wait.\n[01:37.56]Wait.\n[01:44.76]Wait.\n[01:54.38]I want to sit and hope and wait.\n[01:59.46]And wait.\n[02:02.20]And wait.\n', '/stream/636962'),
