(1858689, 531163, 'Gimme Love Feat Eric Maseko', '夏日夜晚的放克灵魂舞曲，呼唤爱与自由。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=290197&width=300&trackid=1858689', '[00:10.60]I’ve been waiting\n[00:11.42]For this time all year\n[00:13.20]Summer nights to dance all night\n[00:18.90]I’ don’t want to be locked up in a room All i want is to Be free with all it means\n[00:27.78]I’ve been waiting\n[00:30.60]For someone like you\n[00:33.08]Someone to give me nights that i want (just give me the nights boy ) I’b been waiting for summer nights with you\n[00:42.52]No one that gives me nights like you do\n[00:45.40]Oh\n[00:46.08]Come on, come on, come & give me love x3 ( just give me the love babe )\n[01:04.22]If I can get you by my side girl\n[01:09.38]U gotta trust me when i say, hm hm\n[01:16.44]I’ve been looking for someone like you Somenight nights to dance all night ah ah\n[01:24.12]I’ve been waiting\n[01:26.62]For someone like you\n[01:29.58]Someone to give me nights that i want I’ve been waiting\n[01:35.78]Summer nights with you\n[01:38.94]No one that gives me nights like you do\n[01:42.02]Oh\n[01:42.54]Come on, come on, come & give me love x3 ( just give me the love babe )\n[01:53.50]Come on, come on, come & give me love x3\n[02:01.24]Imma grab it ( girl )\n[02:03.54]Imma smash it\n[02:04.58]You going to get it & girl you going to love it\n[02:06.70]Get on top babe, i’ll make u blind damn\n[02:09.24]We might need to use a lube or you’re gone cry girl I’ll make you fly,\n[02:12.34]I’ll make you wild,\n[02:13.50]She’s gon’ crave it,\n[02:15.10]She’s super shy tough\n[02:16.20]Give her up boy (just give me the love babe)\n[02:17.54]And don’t u cry boy\n[02:18.40]Imma be the one stuck up in her mind, damn\n[02:21.16]Oh\n[02:21.82]Come on, come on, come & give me love x3 ( just give me the love babe )\n', '/stream/1858689'),
(1483590, 503014, 'Stay', '失恋后孤独恳求对方留下，心碎而忧郁。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=171527&width=300&trackid=1483590', '[00:00.48]STAY:\n[00:00.49]I’ve been down on my luck out here lately\n[00:07.14]I’ve been broke, beaten, and bruised\n[00:11.94]I’m lost and confused…\n[00:18.70]On which path to take.\n[00:26.96]She walked out like a scene from a movie\n[00:33.76]She stopped, she turned, and she stared\n[00:38.10]While I stood right there\n[00:44.18]Just holding her gaze.\n[00:53.90]And it’s hard to describe the look that she gave.\n[01:05.48]I don’t wanna sleep by myself tonight\n[01:19.18]Lie here with me, stay by my side.\n[01:33.76]She woke up on a cold Sunday morning\n[01:40.56]Felt the sting of freshly made scars\n[01:45.28]Cause boys, booze and bars.\n[01:52.00]Make heavy her heart.\n[02:00.54]And I can’t understand how it is we fell so far.\n[02:09.72]I don’t wanna sleep by myself tonight\n[02:26.04]Just lie here with me, stay by my side..\n[02:41.08]Tonight, when you call, will I even be\n[02:45.50]Able to answer the phone, the connection is\n[02:52.36]wrecked and I’m reeling along, til you let me back in…\n[03:04.26]And tonight, when it ends, will we find ourselves\n[03:12.02]Drowning in guilt for the sins we so innocently\n[03:19.84]Commit in attempt to make sense of it all…?\n[03:29.18]I don’t wanna sleep by myself tonight\n[03:45.62]Just lie here with me, stay by my side.\n[03:59.16]Stay here tonight… Stay by my side (3x)\n', '/stream/1483590'),
(969878, 358532, 'Wolf Song', '狼群守候黎明，人与狼的古老寓言。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=114122&width=300&trackid=969878', '[00:10.84]Thank you.\n[00:30.14]Number seven is near.\n[00:34.20]Long black horns across the plain.\n[00:36.46]Gazelles are there to murder.\n[00:39.06]Slow and slight, the wolves remain.\n[00:41.20]Man, dare not go further.\n[00:44.12]Tanger watches all and all is clear.\n[00:48.32]Wolf, you wait, you wait and see.\n[00:50.96]Wolf, you wait so patiently.\n[00:53.36]Waiting through the night for the sun to rise.\n[00:58.28]Thirteen hordes are at the gate.\n[01:00.32]Sons and daughters equally.\n[01:03.02]One man to rule the world.\n[01:08.10]Tanger father, earthen mother.\n[01:09.90]Wolf, you are my brother.\n[01:12.30]You taught me all the secrets of the\n[01:14.72]war that made me stronger.\n[01:17.06]The world never saw the dawn.\n[01:21.46]A man could reach his neighbor\'s farm\n[01:24.36]before his saddle would be worn.\n[01:27.24]Even then, the fear surrounds him.\n[01:29.32]The wolves can\'t choose their victim.\n[01:31.30]The wolves are roaming in the dawn.\n[01:36.28]Wolf, you wait, you wait and see.\n[01:38.60]Wolf, you wait so patiently.\n[01:40.92]Waiting through the night for the sun to rise.\n[01:45.92]Thirteen hordes are at the gate.\n[01:48.40]Sons and daughters equally.\n[01:50.50]One man to rule the world.\n[01:54.34]Wolf, you hear them well.\n[01:57.30]And you will not fail.\n[02:00.22]To wait for them until the hunter stops to kill.\n[02:05.08]You love your daughters and you love your sons.\n[02:09.42]But all that man remembers is the dark side.\n[02:13.70]The dark side of your son.\n[02:22.54]Golden coat and piercing eyes.\n[02:24.36]His sheep are there to plunder.\n[02:27.10]And a throat to agonize.\n[02:29.06]The sky begins to thunder.\n[02:32.02]Heaven number seven is near.\n[02:36.18]Wolf, you wait, you wait and see.\n[02:38.68]Wolf, you wait so patiently.\n[02:40.94]Waiting through the night for the sun to rise.\n[02:45.92]Thirteen hordes are at the gate.\n[02:48.42]Sons and daughters equally.\n[02:50.50]One man to rule the world.\n[02:55.34]Wolf, you wait, you wait and see.\n[02:57.80]Wolf, you wait so patiently.\n[03:00.10]Waiting through the night for the sun to rise.\n[03:05.46]Thirteen hordes are at the gate.\n[03:07.40]Sons and daughters equally.\n[03:09.70]One man to rule the world.\n[03:15.08]One man to rule\n[03:17.14]the world.\n[03:17.58]One man to rule the world now.\n[03:19.88]One man to rule\n[03:21.94]the world.\n[03:22.40]One man to rule the world.\n[03:24.64]One man to rule.\n[03:26.42]One man, one man to rule the world.\n', '/stream/969878'),
