(1601038, 486769, 'Háblame - (Talk to me)', '爵士摇摆曲风中，追忆旧爱，渴望重寻通往巴黎的路。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=347148&width=300&trackid=1601038', '[00:29.58]Sigue aún mis pasos,\n[00:32.88]es como una sombra\n[00:32.89]y vuelve a mi.\n[00:32.90]Y esos recuerdos\n[00:32.91]solo quise borrarlos,\n[00:33.02]hoy vuelven a mí.\n[01:06.59]¿Cómo encontrar una vía a París,\n[01:10.25]que me lleve hacia tí?\n[01:15.50]¿Cómo olvidar nuestra juventud\n[01:19.11]y aquella vida?\n[01:44.43]Algo más que amigos,\n[01:45.99]nos asustó el destino,\n[01:50.25]cobardes fuímos…\n[01:52.97]Recuerdo su sonrisa,\n[01:54.75]mi alma se alborota,\n[01:59.39]necesito ya…\n[02:02.41]encontrar una vía a París\n[02:05.71]que me lleve hacia tí.\n[02:11.05]¿Cómo olvidar nuestra juventud\n[02:15.33]y aquella vida?\n[02:19.85]Vuelvo,\n[02:22.93]te veo\n[02:24.97]y pienso,\n[02:28.15]hablame…\n[02:30.15]Vuelvo,\n[02:32.41]me miras\n[02:34.57]y piensas,\n[03:14.03]hablame...\n[03:14.09]Ya encontré una vía a París,\n[03:17.81]que me lleve hacia tí.\n[03:22.97]¿Cómo olvidar nuestra juventud\n[03:26.63]y aquellos días?\n', '/stream/1601038'),
(2214290, 595787, 'Waste', '独立摇滚唱出失恋后的自我怀疑与情感浪费。', 'https://usercontent.jamendo.com?type=album&id=584854&width=300&trackid=2214290', '[00:14.60]Forgotten nights is where I keep my peace\n[00:21.34]Sedated memories,\n[00:23.30]they start to leak and roll right down my cheek\n[00:27.68]I look at my reflection through the\n[00:30.86]looking glass to avoid any resurrection\n[00:41.36]Should I stay and limp away from all the decisions being made today?\n[00:48.08]If I die,\n[00:49.36]would you cry and want to turn to me and say\n[00:54.80]If you were here,\n[00:56.24]I could be myself again without the pain of being real And\n[01:03.36]for us to feel all of the times I\'ll waste again I know you,\n[01:17.12]and I know that you don\'t want me to know what you need\n[01:24.80]Take every seed in your watercolor garden\n[01:27.50]and grow All the things you say today,\n[01:31.70]they don\'t mean nothing If you\'re walking away,\n[01:35.52]you think it\'s real cool To take a piece of me\n[01:39.24]and own it to the stars so light shines through\n[01:49.36]Should I stay and limp away from all the decisions being made today?\n[01:55.28]If I die,\n[01:57.46]would you cry and want to turn to me and say If you were here,\n[02:04.44]I could be myself again without the pain of being real\n[02:10.86]And for us to feel all of the times I\'ll waste again\n[03:02.96]If I die, was it a waste for you?\n[03:10.98]Would you cry?\n[03:13.02]Is it a waste for me to love you now?\n[03:27.42]Thanks for watching!\n', '/stream/2214290'),
