(1492690, 0, 12420, 12520, 'Greta Reign - I.D.G.A.F.A.Y Lyrics'),
(1492690, 1, 12520, 12530, 'Intro:'),
(1492690, 2, 12530, 23880, 'Hey what\'sup allow me to introduce myself to people in this world who might feel lost and need a little helpcoz I, can be, the courage that you need and help you to a place to realise that you can succeed hey.'),
(1492690, 3, 23880, 23980, 'Verse 1:'),
(1492690, 4, 23980, 36000, 'Should you pay attention focus on what your life means Hah, or listen to the haters as they come for you or me Nah, no one really knows what their future might bring so instead they listen to alarm bells hear them ring-a-ling hey.'),
(1492690, 5, 36000, 36100, 'Verse Hook:'),
(1492690, 6, 36100, 48040, 'People they go crazy it happens on the daily, no one there that really cares didn\'t stop to ask who, what, why, where, so make your calm get wavy ride it out on your own tide, throw your 2 fingers up at the world coz this right here your time.'),
(1492690, 7, 48040, 48980, 'Verse 1 (Continued):'),
(1492690, 8, 48980, 60120, 'If you stop to realise that some people maybe in your life, can be the ones who drag you down only hit you up if they need your time, so tick tick tick tick tock put them bitches on the clock and if you don\'t believe in second chances fuck them they can get blocked blocked.'),
(1492690, 9, 60120, 72000, 'Every single day I contemplate the same question, should I let what others say affect me with aggression, depression is here in the world so don\'t ever think that you are weak I wanna see you seek the help you need.'),
(1492690, 10, 72000, 72010, 'Bridge:'),
(1492690, 11, 72010, 75220, 'Cooking up a brand new remedy.'),
(1492690, 12, 75220, 78940, 'Sprinkle extra for the enemy.'),
(1492690, 13, 78940, 82020, 'Exterminating all the jealousy.'),
(1492690, 14, 82020, 85460, 'Shake deficiency like tetany.'),
(1492690, 15, 85460, 86220, 'Chorus:'),
(1492690, 16, 86220, 90040, 'Fuck you bitches make it simple.'),
(1492690, 17, 90040, 95960, 'I.D.G. A.F.A.Y (x2) I don\'t give a fuck about you and I wrote this song to tell you why.'),
(1492690, 18, 95960, 96040, 'Verse 2:'),
(1492690, 19, 96040, 107700, 'For too long in my own life I\'ve sat and watched time pass me by, as it faded away, eroded away, didn\'t know back then to draw a line, on the mother fuckers dragging me down every day, should I stay, don\'t wanna leave, is there any other way.'),
(1492690, 20, 107700, 116780, 'Verse 2 (Continued):'),
(1492690, 21, 116780, 131980, 'These words are mine saying I despise you most coz you shut me out of everything I wanna bang bang bang on all your doors, \'n\' pick up a sledgehammer take it to the walls, destroy everything I see and then you might just hear my cause.'),
(1492690, 22, 131980, 134760, 'So he he hello, better pick up when I call.'),
(1492690, 23, 134760, 137820, 'Watch out below it\'s so long for you to fall.'),
(1492690, 24, 137820, 145080, 'All the way down where my temper gets the best of me, you\'ll never see the rest of me, not welcome on my destiny.'),
(1492690, 25, 145080, 164880, 'Verse 3:'),
(1492690, 26, 164880, 179780, 'If you wanna eat a slice go bake up your own cake, add some elbow grease in every piece then serve onto your plate, all the blood, sweat and tears that it took to make it rise, do your best to keep it safe away from all the prying eyes.'),
(1492690, 27, 179780, 264710, '[Bridge (x2)'),
